window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_PRODIGIOUSLY_AMAZING_WEAPONSMITH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1501,"title":"Chapter 1501 - Out of expectations (5)","paragraphs":["Now, Li Moying had proactively jumped down the cliff for Huang Yueli!","If the both of them really died down there, even if he died ten thousand times, he could hardly absolve himself of the blame!","Luo Jiyun trembled as he squatted beside the cliff while silently praying, “Eldest Senior Brother, little Sister-in-law, you two... you two must come back alive.....",".....","After Li Moying jumped down the cliff, he didn’t hang onto the side of the cliff but allowed himself to fall down directly.","He was caught off guard while worrying about Huang Yueli hence he directly fell down the cliff, hoping to be able to intercept her in the middle of the path.","Li Moying was fully concentrated on searching for Huang Yueli in the middle of the sky.","However, as the fog around the cliff was simply too thick, especially now that it was already evening time and the sky was turning dark whilst the fog was getting thicker and thicker, he wasn’t able to see Huang Yueli anywhere.","Just as Li Moying was extremely frustrated, suddenly a bright light broke out from beneath!","A bundle of flaming fire seemed as though it descended from the sky as it hung in mid-air, giving off a brilliant and dazzling flame!","This flame even broke through the thick fog, clearing up his eyes.","The ray was so bright that Li Moying almost couldn’t open his eyes and it took quite a while before he could see the situation in front of him.","A huge Phoenix appeared in the middle of the sky and the brilliance of those feathers was of a proud and beautiful matured Phoenix. The moment the gorgeous feathers opened up and slowly fluttered, it seemed as though a ball of fiery flame slowly burning while showing off its brilliance and flowing lights, dazzling one’s eyes.","On the back of that Phoenix was a dainty, petite figure. Dressed in white, it set off her elegant complexion and on that huge awe-inspiring Phoenix made her appear godly, elegant and refined.","Li Moying couldn’t help but cried out, “Li’er—!!”","Huang Yueli raised her head suddenly and saw Li Moying’s falling figure.","She hurriedly patted the phoenix below her and prompted with haste: “Wang Cai, Moying’s fallen down, quickly fly over to catch him!”","The Phoenix which she sat on was Little Phoenix Wang Cai. When Wang Cai was still at a tender age, he was able to burn up all the energy in his body and turn himself into the state of a huge Phoenix for a short period of time, and had once saved Huang Yueli’s life in the Dark Moon Forest previously.","Now that his ability had been promoted, the image of his Phoenix form was even more beautiful as his wings were broader and furthermore, the time he lasted was much longer as well.","When Huang Yueli fell down, she immediately summoned Wang Cai but unfortunately this little fellow’s transformation speed was a bit too slow, almost causing her to fall to her death but finally managed to catch her in time.","Hearing Huang Yueli’s command, Wang Cai was extremely unwilling to do so.","He had always been on loggerheads with Li Moying and the bloodline awe coming from Li Moying made it felt extremely uncomfortable entirely every time it neared him.","What was scarier was Li Moying’s icy cold look that scared it and kept pressing it to cultivate.","The person Wang Cai hated the most was Li Moying! But he was unfortunately his Master’s fiancé, someone whom Wang Cai could not afford to offend!","Now that he could finally get the chance to see Li Moying falling to death, Wang Cai was feeling delighted in his heart but whoever knew that Huang Yueli actually asked it to go save him!","Wang Cai dragged on and off as it intentionally flew very, very slowly, with the intention to drag on the time.","Huang Yueli was extremely anxious as she patted its head hard, “Hey! Why are you in a daze for! Hurry up! If you don’t work hard properly, there will be no drumsticks for you in future!”","Hmof! Anyway it hadn’t eaten chicken drumsticks for a very long time!","Wang Cai refused to give in and was still flying very slowly.","Li Moying fell down straight and indeed brushed past the huge Phoenix as he continued to descend!"]},{"number":1502,"title":"Chapter 1502 - Out of expectations (6)","paragraphs":["But Li Moying didn’t reveal any anxious or terrified expression at all.","Just as he happened to fall past that huge Phoenix, Huang Yueli’s right hand suddenly swung, throwing out a rope towards him!","Li Moying raised his hand and let that rope coil around his wrist, then following Huang Yueli’s pull, he slightly took a breath as he leapt onto that huge Phoenix’s body.","Wang Cai was so infuriated! That irritating fellow was still able to climb up on him!","It really wanted to fling him down but Female Devil was still riding on her back. It didn’t want its Master whom it had tried so hard to save, to meet with danger once again.....","Just as little Wang Cai was in a dilemma, Li Moying had already seated himself comfortably on the Phoenix’s back, hugging his own fiancée tightly.","“Li’er, you’re alright, you’re really alright! That’s great, I was almost scared to death earlier!” Li Moying hugged her arm, as he shivered.","Huang Yueli immediately pacified him, “No matter, don’t worry! Although I didn’t react in time when Murong Fei pushed me, but I won’t die that easily! No matter what waves might come, If I were to die in that kind of rubbish’s hands, then I’d be just too unlucky!”","She intentionally made it sound very easy, hoping that the man beside her could relax a little.","However, Li Moying’s face was black, “Your joke isn’t funny at all! You plainly know that the cliff is very dangerous, why did you stay there?”","Huang Yueli innocently blinked her eyes, “Wasn’t it because I wanted to save Junior Brother Luo?”","“Then surely you can’t risk your own life for it isn’t it? His life, isn’t as important as yours, alright??”","Huang Yueli laughed out loud when she heard that, “If Junior Brother Luo hears you saying that, he’d cry!”","“Who cares if he cries or not? Have you or have you not recorded the things that I’ve told you?”","Huang Yueli looked at that man’s anxious looks as she felt helpless. She knew that Li Moying was worried about her but at that moment then, she totally could not have expected it....","“Right!” She hurriedly switched topics, “Do you see my huge phoenix, isn’t it flashy? Make a guess how I caught it?”","Li Moying shot her a glance as he spoke sarcastically, “Do I even need to guess? It must be that dumb little Phoenix of yours which had transformed into this? At least this little thing is of use, otherwise it’s really a waste to rear it! I’d even despise it to be cooked, there’s just too much oil!”","With a loud “chirp”, Wang Cai gave off an anguish cry!","It almost couldn’t endure it as it wanted to fling that fellow on its back down, but luckily it suddenly thought of Huang Yueli and managed to endure it.","However, what made it even more infuriated was coming right up.","Its Master actually didn’t answer back sarcastically to fight for justice for it. Instead she was like a little bird relying on that man’s side, following him as she joined in the ridicules.","“Aiya, don’t sprout rubbish! If it was to cook into a meal, it’d be much better to be fat. Thin ones aren’t delicious. You don’t even know how to cook so you don’t know!”","Listening to their conversation, they were actually discussing how to eat it!","Little Phoenix was devastated as it wanted to fight back.","Just at this moment, it suddenly felt that something was not right as the movement of his flapping wings started to slow down.","The other two seated on its back also sensed this as they both sat up straight, exchanging glances at each other.","“The surrounding Profound Energy’s fluctuations are extremely strange. I think... we’re probably in trouble.....” Huang Yueli frowned.","Li Moying’s expression also started to turn grave as he stood up and immediately pulled Huang Yueli in a protective stance behind his back."]},{"number":1503,"title":"Chapter 1503 - Big trouble (1)","paragraphs":["“Be careful and hide behind my back, protect yourself properly.” Li Moying instructed in a deep voice.","Huang Yueli took a step back but didn’t follow his instructions to hide herself. Instead her brows furrowed and observed the surrounding situation.","Right at this moment, she recalled what Li Lingchuan told her when they were on the cliff above.","Their current position was the central area of the mystic region. According to Li Lingchuan’s saying, this was an extremely dangerous place and it gathered a huge amount of high levelled magical beasts. Before this, Li Moying was trapped on the cliff below because he was attacked by these magical beasts.","Now that they had fallen to this place, it was much deeper than where Luo Jiyun had been trapped so it would definitely be much more dangerous...","Just as Huang Yueli was in deep thoughts, wings flapping sound was heard from everywhere.","Amidst the thick fog, magical beasts started appearing one after another.","Huang Yueli’s eyes grew wide as she felt a surge of shock rushing into her heart!","Even though she was mentally prepared, but seeing so many high levelled magical beasts with her own eyes still made her feel appalled!","The flying magical beasts which surrounded them were at least sixth tier and furthermore, there were ten or more of them.","Huang Yueli had absolute confidence towards Li Moying’s ability but he was after all only in the seventh stage realm and after experiencing several battles earlier, was it really not a problem to deal with so many magical beasts now?","Huang Yueli bit her lips as she said softly, “You.. you must be very careful, I’ll cover you.”","Li Moying shook his head slightly, “You’d better try not to make a move. These magical beasts depend on swallowing Profound Energy to survive and advance so the minute they sense any Profound Energy fluctuation, they will rush over and charge towards you! The minute you make a move, you’d be deemed as a delicious dish to them.”","“But....” Huang Yueli somehow felt that something was amiss and wanted to say something more.","But at this moment, the magical beast at the foremost position couldn’t hold on any longer as it shot forward in mid-air, charging viciously towards them!","Huang Yueli shut her mouth tightly, not daring to influence Li Moying.","Li Moying’s finger flipped and he grabbed the Amethyst Light Sword in his hand tightly. Not only did he not retreat or evade, instead he charged towards the magical beast.","His sword brandished out—","“Ga ga—! Ga ga—!”","Miserable cries were heard.","That magical beast was struck by Li Moying as its entire body was bathed in blood, falling straight down into the cliff.","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened really large and stared at Li Moying intently. He, he, he... actually didn’t use a single bit of Profound Energy, merely using that sharp half god relic and his physical strength to directly chop off a seventh tier magical beast’s wing.....","Even though she knew he was very strong, but... wasn’t this a little too ridiculous?","Could it be that he didn’t need to use his Profound Energy but he was able to challenge realms way above him?","Even if it was in his past life, Li Moying didn’t seem to have such a powerful body.....","The intensity of his physical body and Profound Energy were two different things. Although the physical body could be trained via various training cultivation methods but they mainly depended on their innate bloodline while it was extremely limited to advance through acquired means.","Hence Li Moying’s ability which he had displayed could only be explained as something which he was born with this lifetime.....","What kind of abnormal bloodline was so powerful like this. Even if he was really from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, surely he needn’t be this powerful right!!","Li Moying turned his head back to realise that his little fiancée was in a dazed look.","He cried out anxiously, “Li’er, stop being in a daze, ask your dumb Phoenix to fly higher quickly! Take this opportunity to do it now!”","Saying that, he pointed to the front not too far away."]},{"number":1504,"title":"Chapter 1504 - Big trouble (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli followed the direction of where his finger was pointing to as her brows twitched.","Not too far away where Li Moying had just struck and injured that magical beast, it didn’t fall into the depths of the valley but was surrounded by a group of magical beasts.","It’s body was seriously injured but it was not blood which gushed out from its wound, but substantial Profound Qi.","The other magical beasts sensed the fluctuations of Profound Energy and like a mosquito which smelled stench, they all crowded around the injured magical beasts as they started attacking it wildly.","That magical beast was originally hurt so naturally it couldn’t win the masses and was quickly surrounded. The other magical beasts rushed over and fought with one another trying to take a bite out of it. Very quickly, they devoured it cleanly while it was still alive.","Huang Yueli’s scalp went numb as she finally realised why Li Moying had sternly requested her not to strike out casually.","The magical beasts below this cliff were simply too vicious, not even letting off their own species!","The both of them with abundant Profound Energy were simply like sending a sheep to the mouth of the tiger!","Huang Yueli didn’t dared to hesitate as she hurriedly patted Wang Cai’s head while urging, “Quickly, Wang Cai, quickly flu upwards! You don’t want to be swallowed alive by these magical beasts too right? Work harder a little more, try your best! After we managed to escape unscathed, I will definitely make you chicken drumsticks. No matter how many you want, I will satisfy your craving and guarantee you to have your fill!”","Little Wang Cai’s tears were all over his face, to think that she was finally willing to give him chicken drumsticks at this point of time! Female Devil was indeed one who wouldn’t release the hawk until she saw the hare!","But what was the point of saying all these now?","Even if there were no chicken drumsticks, it didn’t want to be swallowed alive so naturally it would try its hardest to fly upwards.","But it had already used up all its energy and really couldn’t fly any faster.","The deep valley below the cliff seemed to have a strange power which kept on restraining it, exhausting its Profound Energy faster than usual by several times. There was also a gust of airflow which kept revolving around it, as though it wanted to pull it down into the deep valley.","Little Wang Cai tried really hard and it was able to surge upwards slowly, but it’s speed was gradually decreasing....","“Hurry, hurry, hurry! Didn’t you claim that you’re the incisive and flashy spiritual beast? Why is it that you’re not able to do it at a crucial moment?”","Huang Yueli’s heart was burning with anxiety as she urged however, there wasn’t much use.....","Those magical beasts were hovering around in the lower part of the sky and after they had devoured the magical beast, they started eyeing them covetously as they started to gather around.","Li Moying’s expression was cold and stern and that bewitching peach blossom eyes were filled with chilliness as his right hand grabbed the Amethyst Light Sword tightly.","His body was upright like a pine tree, standing in front of Huang Yueli while shielding her behind his back.","Huang Yueli saw the situation was getting worse and made preparations for battle.","Just at this moment, some magical beasts couldn’t help but start charging towards them again. The only difference was that it wasn’t just one, but three altogether!","Li Moying concentrated his senses as he struck back in full force!","His sword brandished out and struck towards that magical beast in the middle, striking it down with just one strike. Immediately following that, the long sword in his hand had switched direction as it pierced towards the magical beast on the left.","His action was very fast but those flying magical beasts were also very swift. While he was making his move, the magical beast on the right had already broken through his blockade, charging towards Huang Yueli’s direction while opening its mouth trying to bite Huang Yueli!","“Damn it!” Li Moying noticed this and he was feeling extremely anxious as he hurriedly sent the magical beast in front of him flying as he turned around to rescue her!","However, it was still too late.","The magical beast had already flown towards Huang Yueli!"]},{"number":1505,"title":"Chapter 1505 - Big trouble (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli was dealing with a magical beast whose stage realm was much higher than hers by an entire huge realm but the expression on her face was still extremely peaceful.","Her right hand waved and suddenly struck out!","Ten over crystal clear flying daggers flew out from her hand and the speed of those were shockingly fast!","This kind of flying dagger was originally transparent and the light below the mountain was pretty dusky hence the magical beast couldn’t see the direction where she shot out the flying dagger, only assuming that she was waving her hands in fluster without any direction hence it didn’t evade at all while charging straight towards the flying daggers!","A stabbing sound was heard and the flying dagger pierced through the magical beast’s eye!","“Ga Ga—!!!”","The magical beast which suddenly lost its sight shrilled out in pain as it patted its wings with all its might while struggling!","Li Moying managed to turn back in time and dealt it with a serious injury, causing it to drop down the cliff!","Three magical beasts were heavily injured and in the process of falling down, it expectedly caused the wave of looting from the other magical beasts.","Bursts of miserable bird cries could be heard from the bottom of the cliff and in the dusky light, it appeared to be extremely eerier and scary.","“This goddamn place.... It’s indeed a place where only ninth stage realm practitioners could enter!” Huang Yueli was still feeling flustered.","Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s central region was simply too dangerous, even more dangerous than those early historical mystic regions which she had been to in her past life. Even if she and Li Moying still had their past life’s cultivation, they had to plan carefully in detail before entering. For them to suddenly intrude in like this was simply no different from seeking death.","Li Moying frowned, “No wonder Leng Yi Feng they all wanted to deceive us to come down here. It’s almost impossible to leave this ghostly place after you’ve entered! If it wasn’t for your phoenix, we’d probably be dead right here today!”","Huang Yueli hurriedly urged, “Wang Cai, try your best! Work your hardest! If you don’t fly up higher, we’d all be swallowed and skinned alive!”","Little Wang Cai used all its strength and patted his wings with all its might.","As there were a total of three magical beasts which were injured and fell down the cliff, the other magical beasts spent quite an amount of time trying to swallow them.","Taking this opportunity, Wang Cai indeed flew up higher by a distance and had already flown past the midpoint of the mountain.","Huang Yueli lowered her head towards the cliff and in the fog, she could not see the silhouettes of those magical beasts.","Apparently, after they tore at those three injured magical beasts, they could not sense their positions and totally lost track of them.","Huang Yueli breathed out a long sigh and said, “We seem to have finally shook them off? Now we must be extra careful to not use any Profound Energy so as not to attract their attention then flying up the mountain shouldn’t be any problem at all.”","However, Li Moying had a grave expression on him as he gazed at the cliff below afar.","“I think things will not end so simply....” His voice was deep as he spoke.","Huang Yueli’s heart cringed as she hurriedly took a glance below the cliff again.","The flapping of wings was getting more and more distinct and the magical beasts figure appeared once again in the fog.","Furthermore, this time round, there were at least twenty over magical beasts. As compared to earlier, not only had it not decreased, instead many more appeared!","Huang Yueli looked at these magical beasts in shock, “What... what situation is this? Why must they get tangled with us non-stop! We obviously didn’t use any Profound Energy!”","Li Moying’s forehead creased tightly as he shook his head, “I also don’t know but now is not the time to think about these, we seem to be getting into deep trouble!”","He was usually calm and composed and it was a rare sight to see him being so highly strung like now."]},{"number":1506,"title":"Chapter 1506 - Big trouble (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli also knew that they were on the verge of a life and death crisis.","These magical beasts kept pouncing from the front and back, seemingly not knowing when to give up.","If this carried on, the magical beasts which were attacking them would increase in numbers whereas they weren’t able to use a single ounce of their Profound Energy so sooner or later, they’d not be able to persist on.","Even for the first wave of attack like now, they didn’t know if they were able to withstand it.....","The strange thing was that they obviously had not used Profound Energy so how did they still attract the magical beasts’ attention? Earlier when Li Moying saved Luo Jiyun, he had obviously used his Profound Skills thus causing the attacks from the magical beasts but right now, everything had been safe and sound.....","Why was it that when she fell, the situation changed totally?","Huang Yueli’s eyes suddenly lit up as she thought of something.","But now at this point of time, she had lost the chance to speak out.","Another wave of magical beasts started their attacks once again!","This time round, the number of magical beasts which attacked simultaneously were much more than before. Wave after wave, they continued to surge towards them.","Li Moying’s gaze was chilly and his moves were like lightning. The places which his long sword had grazed past laid a heap of magical beasts shrilling out miserably as one after another started to fall into the cliff below.","Huang Yueli and his coordination was perfect as she kept adding on side stabs causing quite a number of magical beasts to fall as well.","Right now, she was feeling extremely lucky that she had once bathed in Phoenix Blood to strengthen her physique. Otherwise there was no way she would be able to use her Profound Energy to go up against such a strong intensity fight!","The two of them had shown explosive ability which had far surpassed their own cultivation and if there were anyone else who saw them now, that person would be extremely shocked!","Because only ninth stage realm practitioners who used their power to suppress the weak might not even be able to display their current battle power which they were displaying right now.","However, even so, they could not find a way to get rid of these magical beasts totally.","The number of magical beasts gathering around were increasing and for those which they simply were unable to block, they could only watch them flying nearer and nearer to them.","Li Moying locked Huang Yueli’s waist and dragged her to his side, sticking close.","The battle following this was even more intense and were all close fights. He was worried that he would get distracted and unable to guarantee his fiancée’s safety.","However, the matter which went on later was totally out of his expectations.","While the two of them were fully focused on them, those magical beasts didn’t continue to charge towards them. Instead, they started towards Little Wang Cai whose wings were flapping non stop!","“Chi chi—! Chi chi chi chi—!!”","Little Wang Cai’s shrilling cries shot past the clouds!","Several magical beasts continued to attack towards it and that made the inexperienced little phoenix totally lost as it flapped its wings in disorientation, in a bid to chase away those disgusting magical beasts!","But this degree of resistance was not enough to go against those ferocious magical beasts.","After Little Phoenix was torn at by then, very quickly, blood started to appear on its wings.","“We must have met living ghosts, how could these magical beasts be so intelligent to know that they must attack our mount first??”","Li Moying’s expression turned green as he kept brandishing his sword to drive away those magical beasts attacking Little Phoenix but these magical beasts were extremely persistent and some of them totally ignored him as they only had one thought in mind which was to take a bite at Little Phoenix.","Huang Yueli bit her lips as she answered sorrowfully, “If I didn’t guess wrongly, these magical beasts’ target is actually Wang Cai!”","Li Moying was stunned momentarily as his hand that was brandishing his sword paused shortly and he was almost bitten by the magical beast which came flying over.","“Directed at this dumb phoenix? How is that possible? Why are you so sure?"]},{"number":1507,"title":"Chapter 1507 - Big trouble (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli threw out a flying dagger successfully shielding Li Moying from the magical beast’s attack.","She speedily narrated, “Don’t you find it weird? When you and Junior Brother Luo fell onto the midpoint of the mountain, if you don’t use your Profound Energy then those magical beasts would not be attracted. But why was it that when we fell, we were targeted by so many magical beasts for no reason? We had obviously restrained ourselves to not use any Profound Energy. Even for our attacks we didn’t even use any Profound Skills!”","Li Moying frowned, “That’s right, this indeed is very strange, but... but what does it have any relation to Wang Cai?”","Huang Yueli replied, “To be honest, I also don’t know what’s the relationship but the minute Wang Cai appeared, these magical beasts started to pursue us tightly. Now the magical beasts’ leading target is it! I’m guessing perhaps this target is too big so we’re unable to conceal ourselves hence we have no way to shake off these magical beasts’ attacks!”","Li Moying’s thoughts ran through wildly as he merged all the scenarios which had happened earlier and he had no choice but to agree with Huang Yueli’s words.","But he was still feeling puzzled, “This is just too abnormal! Although this phoenix of yours is a little dumb and a little weak, but no matter what, it’s still a spiritual beast! Spiritual Beasts’ existence naturally bears a powerful might over ordinary magical beasts. So when these magical beasts saw Wang Cai, they should avoid him from a far distance instead. But why is it that instead of doing so, they kept pursuing him relentlessly instead?”","Huang Yueli pondered on this for a moment and replied, “I feel, the reason might be because.... this is the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s turf.....”","Li Moying was stunned.","Huang Yueli continued, “Didn’t Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Race have some feud going on? Even Cloudy Qilin Clan’s little Qilin which they reared refused to let me touch it. Those magical beasts in the central region might be attracted by Little Phoenix and thirst for its Profound Energy which is a normal thing right.... We also don’t know what the top exponent of the past Cloudy Qilin Clan had given any spiritual hints.....”","Li Moying recalled the scenario where he had taken in the little Qilin several days ago as his heart jolted.","He had to admit that Huang Yueli’s deduction was possibly correct.","“What you said should be correct... but in this way, doesn’t that mean that we have no way to leave this place?”","The position where they were at right now was still very far away and moreover, they were a distance away from the cliff as there were no places which they could borrow strength from.","Under this sort of scenario, if they wanted to return to the top of the cliff, they could only rely on Little Phoenix to fly over.","But mounting on Wang Cai would cause them to be attacked by the central region’s flying beasts, totally unable to shake them off... if this goes on, they would definitely have no way to return to the top of the cliff.","The current predicament which they were in right now, could be explained as in between a hard place and a rock.","Just as their thoughts were racing past quickly trying to think of a way out, Little Phoenix had totally lost energy to persist on!","Don’t think this little thing was usually very arrogant. To tell the truth, it was just an inexperienced noob spiritual beast which had not had any experiences in battling so since when would it ever see such a spectacle?","Being surrounded by so many magical beasts at the same time, it immediately started to turn anxious.","Following that, Wang Cai was quickly attacked again and after it was inflicted with an injury, it became even more flustered as it started to flap its wings disorientedly but that was of no effect at all. In fact it revealed more flaws as it increased his injuries.","Even with Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s cover, they weren’t able to save it.","Eventually, Little Phoenix couldn’t endure it any further and puffed out a burst of flame in the sky!"]},{"number":1508,"title":"Chapter 1508 - Big trouble (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","A dazzling flame burst up into the sky as it illuminated half of the sky, dispersing a portion of the fog around the cliff.","This was a genuine True Phoenix Flame and its might was incomparably powerful!","Those few magical beasts which were flying in front of little phoenix were torched by the flame as they were incinerated on the spot!","Immediately following that, those few magical beasts by the side which were implicated couldn’t withstood the overbearing might as all of them started to retreat!","Little Wang Cai succeeded in a single move and was feeling proud and elated at itself as it excitedly flapped its wings while raising its little head, showing off a complacent look.","However, Huang Yueli and Li Moying’s expression turned totally terrible.","“No good! This little thing indeed isn’t able to withstand pressure!”","“The situation has turned even worse now!”","As expected, not long after little Wang Cai had turned complacent, the surrounding dispersed magical beasts just revolved for a little while and started gathering together to attack it again.","Further, the thick fog around the cliff kept on emitting wings flapping sound. Apparently, many other magical beasts were heading over here.","Little Phoenix then realised that it seemed to have gotten into trouble.","Although these magical beasts were dispersed for a short moment, the desire to swallow its energy was extremely intense. Not only did they not get scared off by the True Phoenix Flame, on the contrary as it had caused an intense Profound Energy fluctuation, it attracted even more magical beasts instead as they kept charging towards it, wanting to have a share of the cake!","Little Phoenix’s heart was filled with terror but it was too late for regrets.","Magical beasts all started to attack towards it.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying simultaneously struck back. Since they had already been exposed, then they need not hold back as they used their Profound Skills.","But alas, all these were in vain.","Little Phoenix’s injuries were getting heavier and heavier and moreover in the intense battle, its Profound Energy was exhausted. Very soon, it was left with nothing much.","“Fe... Female Devil, I seem to.... I think I can’t hold on any longer... you two.....”","Little Wang Cai hemmed and hawed and before it could finish its words, its body shook violently and later on, in a visible speed, it speedily shrank.","Huang Yueli’s expression changed, “What the, do you need to be so fraud! You... can’t you just hang on for a while longer? For your chicken drumsticks!”","“I’ve already reached my limit... it’s of no use even if I ate a hundred chicken drumsticks.... Boo hoo...female devil, will I die? If we go to hell in future, you must make chicken drumsticks for me...”","Huang Yueli gritted her teeth out of anger, “You can go meet Hades yourself! I’m not going and you can keep dreaming about me making you chicken drumsticks!”","Although she said that, she knew clearly that this time.... They would probably really have misfortune befalling onto them!","Under so many magical beasts’ relentless attacks, little phoenix was completely overwhelmed and both she and Li Moying didn’t have any wings so basically they weren’t able to fly up the cliff to leave this dangerous central region!","Li Moying understood this as well but he was much calmer than Huang Yueli. The more dangerous moment he faced, the calmer he was.","He quickly made a resolute decision.","“Now there’s no other ways. Since we can’t fly up, then we can only fly down. We must immediately land.”","Huang Yueli went into a blank but quickly came around it, “That’s right, we can only reach the bottom of the cliff now and think of a way out later.”","She patted little Phoenix, “Wang Cai, quickly bring out whatever Profound Energy you have left right now! Try to persist on as long as you can. Whether we can land successfully or not will depend on your last performance!”"]},{"number":1509,"title":"Chapter 1509 - Big trouble (7)","paragraphs":["Li Moying was observing the surroundings as he commanded.","“I’ll count to three. Li’er and I will strike together, fully unleashing our Profound Skills to disperse the surrounding magical beasts. Wang Cai must immediately charge downwards, fighting to safely arrive at the bottom of the cliff before you shrink back to your original physique. Do you understand it all clearly? One, Two, Three!”","Following Li Moying’s command, Huang Yueli’s surrounding Profound Skills lifted to the extreme as she suddenly struck out!","An intense flame coiled around from her body as it ferociously swept the surrounding magical beasts with its blazing heat.","Her flame was a mix between the True Phoenix Flame and Amethyst Thunder Flame. When combined with the exclusive Profound Skills from the Sacred Phoenix Race, it formed into a special combusted deviant flame where the might was much stronger than True Phoenix Flame alone, by one fold!","Although the magical beasts around her were all sixth grade and above but under such a strong flame, they had no way to ward it off.","After the foremost few dropped from the skies, the others all scattered as they escaped for their lives!","Li Moying’s move was even more straightforward. The magical beast in front of him was already used to his strength before he used his Profound Energy and thought that his ability was just so-so. Hence after he suddenly exploded his Profound Energy, they were caught unaware as thunder swept past them and in an instance, they were all struck down, not leaving a single beast alive.","The surrounding magical beasts around them were cleared in an extremely short amount of time.","Little Phoenix did not face any more obstructions in front of it.","Although it was already exhausted, but right now, it still forcibly lifted a breath and used up all its energy to dive towards the bottom of the cliff!","It’s speed was too fast and Huang Yueli lost her balance as she swayed around its back and almost fell off.","Luckily Li Moying grabbed hold of her wrist and pulled her back.","Huang Yueli immediately grabbed hold of Wang Cai’s feathers on its back as she lowered her body, following Little Phoenix’s actions, sticking to its back tightly.","Wang Cai’s body was slowly shrinking but it continued to dive downwards.","Li Moying stood up occasionally, attracting lightning to disperse all the obstructions which came near Wang Cai.","It took only ten over breaths and Wang Cai had already charged over a thousand over a meter of distance. Huang Yueli was on its back and could see the bottom of the cliff with her eyes.","But at this moment, Wang Cai’s Profound Energy had been completely exhausted and its body shrank to such a tiny size that the both of them could no longer stand on its back.","What was most dangerous was the nearer it went near the ground, the more magical beasts gathered around. Especially after Li Moying showed his Profound Energy without any restraint, many magical beasts all surged towards this place after sensing it.","On seeing that Wang Cai had turned into the size of an ostrich, Li Moying grabbed Huang Yeuli’s waist tightly as he whispered softly by her ear, “Right now, three, two, one, jump!”","Li Moying brought Huang Yueli along as they jumped straight into the bottom of the cliff.","Huang Yueli’s hand wound around Li Moying’s waist tightly while the other kept on gesticulating incantation gestures, speedily moving little Wang Cai into the Sky Phoenix Ring.","Li Moying’s thunder wings appeared on his back and it flapped lightly, diminishing the huge impact of their descent.","The duo crashed heavily on the ground and Li Moying hugged Huang Yueli in her arms as they rolled on the ground several times.","“Li’er are you alright?” Li Moying propped up his body as he lowered his head to question anxiously.","Huang Yueli shook her head, “I’m fine, why would I not be? You’ve protected me so well! How about you.... are you hurt? Ah, you’re bleeding!”","She grabbed Li Moying’s arm and saw a wound which was seeping blood on his shoulder."]},{"number":1510,"title":"Chapter 1510 - Number one genius dies (1)","paragraphs":["This man had always protected her well in his arms, deeply worried that she would suffer a single bit of harm but totally downplayed his own injuries.","Li Moying turned back and took a look, “Just a minor injury. If you didn’t mention it, I wouldn’t have noticed at all.....”","Saying that, he looked behind Huang Yueli and frowned, “It’s simply too dangerous here, we must leave immediately!”","Huang Yueli turned her head around to see a large heap of magical beasts charging towards them.","Apparently the thunder wings which Li Moying had exhibited when they descended caused a huge Profound Energy fluctuation, hence causing quite a bit of trouble for them.","“What are you still waiting for? Run quickly!”","Huang Yueli held on to Li Moying’s hand as they fled desperately!","...","A few days later.","Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, gathering point at the entrance.","Before entering the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, Cui Yuan Shan and the others had already clarified that the activation of the mystic region would only be for a short period of one month.","Now that one month’s period was up, according to the two large Sect’s agreement, today would be the day where the Sect’s elders cooperated to reactivate the entrance so Celestial Light Sect and Green Cloud Sect’s disciples must all gather at the entrance, to await for the passage to be reactivated.","Right now, the gathering point was filled with disciples from both large Sects and they were all huddled together in groups, exchanging the experience and knowledge which they had been through in the mystic region.","This was the first time for a large number of them to enter the ancient mystic region. For those who were able to leave this place alive, all of them had reaped their own benefits and although they had met with danger, but their abilities were lifted quickly. Quite a number of them had obtained several treasures and were all revealing joyful looks, feeling extremely excited.","Naturally, Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region was filled with danger all around and not everyone was able to leave safely.","As time went by slowly, some people had eventually not appeared.","Quite a number of them revealed shocked expressions as they started to discuss secretly.","“It’s only less than one hour before the time to exit this place is up. Those who aren’t able to gather here, does it mean that they have met with an accident in the mystic region?”","“Most likely. If not, why would they drag on until now and still not gather here, aren’t they afraid that they’d miss the timing to leave?”","“Isn’t that so. I heard my Master say this before that every time there were direct disciples entering the mystic region, there would at least be thirty percent of them who were lost! We should really count our lucky stars that we are able to leave this place in one piece!”","“But... have you guys realised something....” a Celestial Light Sect disciple hemmed and hawed.","“What? What are you trying to say?”","“Have you discovered that, Young Sect Master he.... until now he still hadn’t appeared!” This person finally couldn’t take it and blurted it out.","His voice wasn’t very soft and many people around them heard that.","All of them lifted up their heads and searched around for Li Moying.","However, no matter how they looked, they were not able to find that legendary shockingly powerful number one genius in South Sky Region!","“Heavens, Young Sect Master he really hasn’t gathered here yet! Why is it like that? Where has he gone to??”","“Not only him, Junior Sister Bai is missing too!”","“There’s also Senior Brother Li and Senior Sister Murong! Green Cloud Sect’s eldest disciple Leng Yi Feng hasn’t appeared too!”","“Surely not right? What’s the situation now? Could it be that I’ve got the gathering date wrong? So many top exponents and their abilities are the top amongst all of them, how would they all suddenly go missing?”","Could it be that they have all gotten into an accident in the mystic region, and already.....”"]},{"number":1511,"title":"Chapter 1511 - Number one genius dies (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Pui pui pui 1 ! What nonsense are you sprouting? How would Young Sect Master possibly have a mishap in a mere Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region? Even people like us are able to get here in one piece!”","“That might be hard to say. Young Sect Master’s cultivation is much higher than us, that’s for sure. But he would definitely go to more dangerous places to seek opportunities and the opportunities which he meets should be much more dangerous than what we can imagine so how would you know that he had not met with unexpected failure?”","This man’s words immediately raised the displeasure of all Celestial Light Sect’s disciples.","“Anyway it’s just not possible, Young Sect Master will definitely not get into a mishap!”","“That’s right, you crow-beak fellow, scram to one side. How dare you curse Young Sect Master!”","“Don’t you be too delighted. Based on what you said, why hasn’t your eldest disciple Leng Yi Feng appeared as well? Could he also have gotten into a mishap?”","The scene instantly escalated into a berating scene and that Green Cloud Sect disciple was scolded till he didn’t dare to make a single sound.","Amidst this chaos, under the tree shade, Luo Jiyun didn’t move at all while leaning against the tree trunk. Hearing the surrounding disturbances one after another, his expression was cold as he didn’t say a single word.","Ever since that matter that happened by the cliff, he seemed to have matured overnight.","The effect of the medicinal pills which Huang Yueli gave was very good. After taking it continuously for three days, his injuries had mostly recovered and at the very least, he didn’t lay limp on the ground and was able to move around.","He stayed by the cliff for a long period of time while keeping track of the various flames and lightning coming from the cliff below and also heard those miserable shrills from those magical beasts which were struck down.","He thought that Li Moying would be the same as before, suddenly appearing on the top of the cliff in one piece.","But time and days went by, the duo who had dropped down the cliff did not return eventually.","Luo Joyun tried to climb down the cliff to look for them but unfortunately he had barely reached the two hundred meters mark and almost died in the magical beasts mouths. After experiencing many near deaths, he finally made it back to the top of the cliff luckily.","He waited till the last day when the mystic region was going to be reactivated but Li Moying and Huang Yueli still hadn’t returned.","Furthermore, the cliff below stopped giving off various rays and he really couldn’t tell if they had met with real danger or if they had left the place through other means.","Luo Jiyun refused to believe that top experts like Li Moying and Huang Yueli’s kind of ability, wisdom and luck, they would die just because of a few villain’s schemes.","Hence, he carried a sliver of hope, wishing that he would be able to see the duo’s sudden appearance at the gathering point.","Perhaps there was some other route below the cliff and they might not have to climb up the cliff!","Alas, the final result was that it was all his own wishful thinking and he had been self-comforting himself. The gathering point was filled with people but the duo whom he wanted to meet was totally missing.","Following the mystic region’s reactivation time nearing, Luo Jiyun’s heart grew heavier and heavier.","Why did it turn out like this! Eldest Senior Brother was so powerful and Lil Sister-in-law was so intelligent! They had met with countless near death crisis but had been through it all. Why did they fall right here this time round??","Just as he was feeling incomparably guilty wishing that he could just throw himself at the wall to kill himself, suddenly a voice was heard from his right side.","“Mister Luo, I wonder if you’ve met my Master and Third Miss in the mystic region?”","Luo Jiyun raised his head and saw all Li Moying’s Shadow Guards standing in front of him, all bearing an anxious expression.","His heart thumped wildly and the minute he opened his mouth, he discovered that his voice was extremely hoarse.","“This.... About this.....”"]},{"number":1512,"title":"Chapter 1512 - Number one genius dies (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Mo Yi’s hand gripped the handle of his sword which hung around his waist as he frowned and said, “Based on our Master and Third Miss’ abilities, by right they wouldn’t get into any trouble here. But they haven’t appeared for such a long time so I really am worried over this! I heard that you, Master and some others had entered a cave dwelling together? Do you know where they went later on?”","Li Moying’s Shadow Guards naturally were hundred percent confident towards their Master.","Others might underestimate Li Moying’s ability but as his most trusted aides, how would they not know just how powerful was Li Moying? His innate talent seemed to not have a limit and no matter under what kind of situation, he was able to do something which other people thought was impossible!","That kind of power was something which no one could hope to surpass, only bowing down in revere towards him.","So right from the start, even when those people were in discussions, Mo Yi and the rest didn’t feel that there was anything to be worried about.","How could their Master ever get into any trouble? They had not appeared.... Probably because he was getting intimate with Third Miss and had forgotten the time.","But now that it was only left with a quarter of an hour to the time of activation of the entrance, there were still no signs of their whereabouts so it was just too ridiculous.","Shadow Guards couldn’t sit still as they exchanged information only to discover that none of them had met Li Moying in the mystic region.","Out of desperation, they could only turn to Luo Jiyun for help.","Luo Jiyun was feeling frustrated, not knowing how to answer.","Just at this moment, another voice was heard, “That’s right Master Luo. You indeed should explain properly and give us an explanation!”","Luo Jiyun turned his head around and saw Fang Shaoning’s gloomy look, standing right next to him.","His brows creased, “Explanation? What explanation?”","Fang Shaoning said, “Ten days ago, a few of our Green Cloud Sect’s disciples were near the central region and saw with their own eyes that you and Murong Fei were holding on to a drawing as you took the risk to enter the central region. Later on, my eldest senior brother and your sect’s Li Lingchuan were together as they also went in. Later on, some others also saw Li Moying and Bai Ruoli barging in.”","When Fang Shaoning said that, he immediately caused a bustle among the other disciples.","“Surely not right? So many sixth stage realm top experts and they all entered the central region!”","Before we entered the mystic region, hadn’t Sect Master already instructed us not to enter the central region? Otherwise there is a high chance of not making it out. How would they even dare to enter that place?”","“Are you silly? These few people are the top talents in both Sects, hadn’t you heard of the saying ‘abled people are normally bold’?”","“But... that’s the central region! I’ve heard that even ninth stage realm practitioners aren’t guaranteed to be able to leave safely....”","“In that case, that person’s guess earlier was true? Have they really.... Met with a mishap?”","The more Luo Jiyun heard their discussions, the uglier his expression got.","However Fang Shaoning kept on persisting in his questions, “Mister Luo, so many of them had entered the central region but you’re the only one who had returned alive whereas the rest of them had all gone missing! Surely you need to give us an explanation on why the others have gone missing? Furthermore, among so many people there, only my eldest senior brother is a disciple of Green Cloud Sect. I have all the reasons to suspect that you Celestial Light Sect people have joint hands to do harm to him!”","Fang Shaoning’s words were indeed provocative as Green Cloud Sect’s disciples all crowded around when they heard that.","“That’s right, something’s fishy going on here!”"]},{"number":1513,"title":"Chapter 1513 - Number one genius dies (4)","paragraphs":["“Luo Jiyun definitely knows something so we must make him say it out!”","“That’s right, if anything were to happen to Senior Brother Leng, then we must make Celestial Light Sect pay the price for it!”","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were all feeling furious over this as they crowded around and started arguing with Green Cloud Sect’s disciples.","“You’d better all scram further away! On what basis do you have to spill dirty water on our Celestial Light Sect’s disciples? Is Leng Yi Feng the only one whose missing?”","“Even our Young Sect Master isn’t out as well. Should we count this debt onto you Green Cloud Sect people?”","One couldn’t blame them for being so agitated. If there were any losses, Celestial Light Sect would definitely be the side which resulted in severe damages. They had four top experts who had mysteriously gone missing, as compared to Green Cloud Sect’s only top expert which was Leng Yi Feng!","Now, Fang Shaoning pushed the entire responsibility to Celestial Light Sect and the disciples totally couldn’t agree to it.","Two Sect’s disciples were arguing over this but Fang Shaoning totally ignored them, only starting intently at Luo Jiyun.","“Master Luo, what on earth is going on? You’d better explain this clearly! After all, your Celestial Light Sect has suffered quite a heavy damage as well so shouldn’t you give your fellow disciples an explanation as well?”","Hearing that, everyone quietened down, all looking towards Luo Jiyun.","Luo Jiyun was originally feeling very frustrated and had no mood to say anything more. The minute he recalled that scenario, strong guilt and misery started to crush him completely!","But Fang Shaoning kept on chasing after him, asking and asking once and again making the anger in his heart grew wider and wider, as he simply could not endure it any further!","He raised his head sharply as he stared at Fang Shaoning deadly giving off a cold smile, “Alright, you insist on finding out the truth eh? Then I shall tell you!”","Luo Jiyun had been hanging his head low and not giving off any sound so Fang Shaoning thought that he was afraid of himself.","Now when the both of them exchanged glances, Luo Jiyun’s look made everyone so shocked that they withdrew a breath of cold air!","His face had been stained with drops of blood and a large patch of muddy ash while his entire face was greyish green. His anxious and despondent look paired with his dark eye circles were deep and large, looking no different from a ghost. But unfortunately his eyes revealed a strange coldness, like a lone wolf on a patch of grassland who would take a bite at anyone who came up to him.","When Fang Shaoning saw him, his stance immediately weakened.","“You... what do you mean by this?”","Luo Jiyun laughed coldly, “You want to know the truth so I’ll tell you, as long as you don’t find it embarrassing! Your eldest senior brother hasn’t been harmed by our sect’s disciple. Instead he had colluded with Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei to set up this trap, just so that they could scheme and harm our Young Sect Master!”","When Fang Shaoning heard that, he totally refused to believe it.","“What you said is just too funny! How could my Eldest Senior Brother possibly mix around with Celestial Light Sect’s disciples? Then wouldn’t he become Green Cloud Sect’s traitor? Why did he need to do such a thing? It’s true that he and Li Moying had always been disagreeable but Young Sect Master Li’s ability is much higher than his. Moreover there doesn’t seem to be any deep set vengeance between the two of them so does it need to be like this?”","Luo Jiyun chuckled and swept him with a disdainful glance.","“You feel that it’s impossible? Of course there’s a reason for him to do this! It’s because he had taken an interest in Eldest Senior Brother’s fiancée Miss Bai! I think you probably don’t know about this right? Leng Yi Feng had already expressed his feelings to Miss Bai several times secretly, saying that his status is extremely valuable and he’s the descendant of Sky Emperor City’s Leng family. He asked her to ditch Eldest Senior Brother to be together with him! Regarding this matter, Mo Yi and the others can vouch for me!”"]},{"number":1514,"title":"Chapter 1514 - Number one genius dies (5)","paragraphs":["“What? How is that possible? Stop slandering others! How could my senior brother even take interest.... take interest in....”","Fang Shaoning expressed his disdain towards Huang Yueli but speaking about it halfway, he was unable to continue.","Huang Yueli’s innate talent and beauty was obvious. Even for a descendant from a large family like Leng Yi Feng, it wasn’t a strange matter for him to develop admiration towards her. Even for Fang Shaoning who was on the opposing team could not summon courage to speak blindly.","However, the last time at the arena stage when Leng Yi Feng specially came out to stop him from hurting Huang Yueli, it had already caused Fang Shaoning to be suspicious.....","This time round, Celestial Light Sect’s disciples were all rummaging with anger.","“Damn it! This is simply too shameless! Is he even worthy of our Junior Sister Bai? A toad lusting for a swan’s flesh!”","“How dare you belittle our Young Sect Master? Using your status to suppress us? Why don’t you compare between the two’s ability and innate talent? Really trash!”","Fang Shaoning’s expression flushed a pink shade of embarrassment but he quickly changed his tone, “Even if my senior brother took interest in Miss Bai, that doesn’t mean anything because Li Moying hadn’t even officially married her! Moreover speaking, how glorious is your Celestial Light Sect? Li Lingchuan and others are all disciples from Celestial Light Sect so how did he conspire with my senior brother to harm your sect’s Young Sect Master?”","Luo Jiyun’s face was filled with hostility, “Li Lingchuan this despicable man, isn’t it all because of the position of Young Sect Master? He thought that if he caused Eldest Senior Brother’s death, he would take over the position of Young Sect Master? Furthermore he even shamelessly colluded with Leng Yi Feng! Luckily they all got what they deserved and they’re all now probably all dead! But my pitiful Eldest Senior Brother and Miss Bai... they have been murdered these three few scums! They.... are really too pitiful.....”","As he was narrating, his nose suddenly felt a sourish sensation as his tears started to flow down.","Everyone at the scene all turned silent when they saw that.","Even Green Cloud Sect’s disciples couldn’t be bothered to argue but were all stunned by this explosive news till they weren’t able to react.","Li Moying.... really died?","That publicly known South Sky Region’s number one genius Li Moying, with overpowering innate talent which no one could surpass, he actually.... really died in Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region??","This matter sounded just too unfathomable! It was simply unimaginable!","After all, Li Moying was simply too strong. He had a well-known reputation among the younger generation in the Four Sky Regions!","There was even a rumour that even for the number one top expert in Soaring Heavens Continent Mu Chengying, his innate talent and speed in advancement in his younger days was not comparable to Li Moying’s.","This kind of genius would definitely become a leading character in Soaring Heavens Continent in future.","How could he have died silently in one mystic region’s training?","But this news actually came from Luo Jiyun’s mouth.","As Li Moying’s closest junior brother and a witness, the words that he said were extremely convincing which was unable to make anyone doubt it.....","It took a while before Fang Shaoning regained his senses as he burst out laughing.","“Ha ha ha ha, so interesting, it’s just too interesting! Li Moying actually died just like that? Isn’t he very amazing? Wasn’t he said to be able to battle someone beyond his stage realm, or even challenge an elementary ninth stage realm top expert? He actually died in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region?”","The shadow guards’ expression changed and Mo Yi’s hand kept trembling, almost unable to grab his sword. He walked up front and with a shaking voice, he continued interrogating, “Master Luo, are you absolutely.... absolutely certain?”"]},{"number":1515,"title":"Chapter 1515 - Number one genius dies (6)","paragraphs":["Luo Jiyun didn’t dare to look at Mo Yi directly as he lowered his head.","“I... I saw Murong Fei pushing down little Sister-in-law down the cliff with my own eyes and after that Eldest Senior Brother immediately jumped down after her.”","When Mo Yi heard that, he heaved a sigh of relief, “If it’s just jumping down the cliff, it shouldn’t be life threatening. Master isn’t an ordinary practitioner! He probably just couldn’t find a way out.”","Luo Jiyun however wasn’t as optimistic as him as he clenched his teeth and said, “But the cliff below should be Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s central region. I had been down there previously and three to four hundred meters down that cliff were numerous flying magical beasts. All of them are of sixth grade and above! They would also automatically attack those practitioners who intrude that place and it is an extremely dangerous and perilous place. The cliff below is filled with thick fog and it’s practically impossible to see how deep it is, nor can you see the situation below. But one thing for sure is it is even more dangerous in the valley below.”","Mo Yi then started to turn anxious as his brows creased together tightly.","The gathering point exploded with bustle as everyone was discussing Li Moying’s disappearance.","Almost everyone was certain that Li Moying was probably dead.","“Our Sect Master had once said that if anyone was stuck in the central region, even a ninth stage realm practitioner was unable to get out! No matter how powerful Young Sect Master Li is, surely he’s not comparable to a genuine ninth stage realm practitioner right?”","“That’s right, furthermore even if it’s not dead now, later when the mystic region closes up, he will have no way to leave the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.....”","“That’s right. In this way, he would no longer be known in the South Sky Region in future?”","Everyone sighed in sadness.","Fang Shaoning also stopped pursuing the whereabouts of Leng Yi Feng.","Having provoked Li Moying, Leng Yi Feng definitely did not meet with a good ending but to be able to wipe off Li Moying before he died, he was really not simple as well.....","Later when he left the mystic region, he only needed to report truthfully to his Sect Master.","Just as this moment, the ground suddenly shook violently as sand and stones flew while cracks started to appear on the ground.","After a short moment of confusion, someone cried out in joy, “Look quickly! The entrance to the mystic region has appeared! The designated timing has reached so it must be the Sect’s Elders who are activating the mystic region from the outside! We can finally leave this place!”","Everyone lifted their heads and indeed saw a black entrance appearing by the side of the mystic region, exactly the same one as when they entered.","Many of them immediately heaved a long sigh of relief.","Although there were many opportunities in the mystic region and everyone had reaped some rewards, but it was simply too dangerous here!","Especially after the news of the unparalleled genius Li Moying who had gotten into trouble, all the more the others didn’t want to continue staying in this place.","Anyway they have all gotten some treasures and it was simply great that they could leave this place as soon as possible!","Originally Celestial Light Sect’s leader was Li Moying while Green Cloud Sect’s leader was Leng Yi Feng. But now that these two people had gone missing, the situation instantly became messy and everyone was fighting to pass through the entrance to leave this place.","Green Cloud Sect’s side was still alright because at least Fang Shaoning’s words were still of use.","Celestial Light Sect was disoriented. They had a greater number of people and the only direct disciple whose status was slightly higher was Luo Jiyun and he was totally unable to maintain the order.","Mo Yi and the rest raised up their heads and after taking a look at the direction of the entrance, they suddenly seemed to have agreed on something together and turned around to walk away simultaneously.","Luo Jiyun immediately jumped up and chased after them while asking, “Wait, you guys... where are you guys heading off to?”"]},{"number":1516,"title":"Chapter 1516 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (1)","paragraphs":["Mo Yi’s footstep paused but he didn’t turn back.","“Master Luo, we will stay behind to save Master and Third Miss.”","Luo Jiyun asked, “But... in this way, you will not be able to leave the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region! Without both sect’s Elders to activate the mystic region together, you have no chance to leave this place!”","Mo Yi sighed softly, “To tell the truth, I don’t believe that Master would die just like that! You also haven’t seen Master dying in front of you with your own eyes right? I believe Master is definitely alive but we’re not sure what situation he had met with down the cliff so he should be trapped! At this point in time, how could we possibly leave just for our own safety? This is considered as betraying our Master!”","Even if there is a possibility, if Master is indeed in trouble, we cannot allow ourselves to live on alone. Not being able to protect our Master properly is originally our sin, so even if we die, we bear no grudges!”","“Master Luo, don’t bother about us and leave the mystic region quickly! Don’t miss the timing.”","Saying that Mo Yi turned around and the few of them Shadow Guards all left swiftly.","Hearing that, Luo Jiyun stayed silent for a moment and suddenly started to chase after them.","“Wait a minute, Brother Mo Yi, I’ll go with you guys to save Eldest Senior Brother, I will not leave too!”","When Mo Yi heard that, he frowned, “Master Luo, you... you need not do that! We are Shadow Guards and Young Sect Master is our Master so we must stay behind. But you’re different. You have a great future before you and you need not be trapped in the mystic region because of Master. If Master manages to leave that place someday, seeing you here will not make him happy.”","Luo Jiyun anxiously said, “Brother Mo Yi, don’t stop me! Eldest Senior Brother met with danger this time round was all because he tried to save me! I had fallen into Murong Fei’s scheme hence I dragged Eldest Senior Brother and little Sister-in-law down! If I were to leave like this, my conscience would be pricked so I must follow you guys to save them!”","He had just finished his words when another voice was heard from his back.","“Me as well, I’ll go with you guys!” The person who said that was Yuan Zeyu.","Mo Yi was stunned, “You.....”","Yuan Zeyu appeared to be relaxed as he smiled, “I’m Third Miss’ men so surely it cannot only be Young Sect Master’s subordinates who stays behind only right?”","Mo Yi sized them up and prudently nodded.","“As long as you have all thought over this carefully and not regret it, then follow me!”","...","Below the cliff.","“These magical beasts have too much determination! They have been prowling in wait for three days and three nights and they still aren’t leaving?” Huang Yueli asked gloomily.","She and Li Moying were now inside a cave.","Yesterday after they descended at the bottom of the cliff, they immediately came under the pursuit of a group of magical beasts. While they were running wildly for their lives, they chanced upon a narrow passageway in between the mountains and hurriedly squeezed in only to discover that there was a cave inside. Furthermore the cave was rather huge.","Therefore the two of them started to split up their work.","Li Moying was in charge of blocking those magical beasts which pursued them to the front of the cave while Huang Yueli was responsible for setting up an invisibility and defence array in front of the cave’s entrance.","After the array was set up, the two of them heaved a sigh of relief.","The layout of the cave wasn’t bad at all and with this array, they only needed to ensure to change the magical beast core in the crux of the array and it would deflect a large portion of the attacks. Occasionally when there were slightly incredible magical beasts which broke through the restraint, they would also be blocked by Li Moying.","But these magical beasts’ determination had surpassed their imagination.","Originally they thought that they only needed to wait for several hours and the magical beasts would all disperse then they were able to leave this place.","But in the end, three days had passed and they were still trapped in the cave."]},{"number":1517,"title":"Chapter 1517 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“This can’t continue on, we need to think of a way to leave this place as soon as possible....” Huang Yueli frowned.","Li Moying’s expression was grave, “The designated activation date is left with only three days. If we’re not able to leave here from the central region, then I’m afraid that we will be trapped in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region. By then if we want to leave this place, it’d be extremely difficult.”","Huang Yueli said, “This is hard to do. It’s easy for us to leave this cave but once we’re out, if we’re being chased so many magical beasts, how could we possibly find a way out? Furthermore.....”","“Furthermore what?” Li Moying saw her keeping silent as he nudged her to continue.","“Furthermore this valley is shrouded with fog which doesn’t dissipate all year round. And there are so many high levelled magical beasts which can swallow Profound Energy. This itself isn’t very normal. Have you noticed that some magical beasts’ ability in flying is very strong but when we’re up on the cliff, no matter what Profound Skills we use, we did not attract any magical beast. But the minute we went down to a distance of one to two hundred meters, we’d be tangled.... That could only explain one problem.”","Li Moying seemed to have understood something, “You’re saying that this valley is actually enveloped by a large sized array?”","Huang Yueli blinked, “You can classify it as an array but this is not an ordinary array. It can directly change the valley’s heaven and earth rule, even causing these magical beasts’ nature to undergo changes. It’s a major work of a sky high structure! Only ancient God Clans are able to do so.”","Li Moying dropped his eyelids as he muttered softly, “In this way, Cloudy Qilin Clan was originally an important ancient clan and there are plenty of practitioners who have reached the God realm. It’s not surprising for God grade’s array masters to be able to set up with this kind of array.”","“What you say is correct but in this way, we’re in deep sh*t! If we still can’t find a way to decode the array, then we probably would never be able to go out for eternity.” Huang Yueli was feeling rather frustrated as her delicate face appeared to be a sign of melancholy.","Li Moying pacified her as he caressed her face while speaking in a deep voice, “Don’t worry, we’ll definitely be able to find a way out.”","Huang Yueli rose her head and met with that pair of bewitching peach blossom eyes. In an instance, she seemed to be sucked into that pair of deep gaze as she nodded her head blankly.","Actually, she also knew that the difficulties placed in front of them now was simply unimaginable.","But with this man by her side saying such consoling words, she suddenly felt at ease, as though there was nothing to be terrified of.","Because they had been working hand in hand for so many years and experienced innumerable dangers, hadn’t they all been through it successfully?","Huang Yueli proactively walked over as she leaned by Li Moying’s side and hugged his arm.","Li Moying caressed her long black hair and analysed, “No wonder Leng Yi Feng and the others wanted to lure us over, looks like they definitely knew something was up. Sect Master Cui had already mentioned that they had transcribed a portion of the ancient manual hence discovering the location of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region. That ancient manual must have recorded all the matters related to the central region. If I had thought of this earlier, I should have searched Leng Yi Feng’s realm ring before I jumped down. Perhaps we might find some information from there.”","“Saying all these now are of no use, we.....”","As Huang Yueli was talking, she suddenly stopped.","Li Moying lowered his head as he looked at her curiously."]},{"number":1518,"title":"Chapter 1518 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","He saw Huang Yueli’s gaze looking straight ahead to the right side, bearing a dazed look.","Li Moying hurriedly nudged her shoulder, “Li’er, are you alright?”","Huang Yueli then regained her senses and said, “Moying, take a look over there.... is there something over there?”","Li Moying followed the direction of her finger but unfortunately other than an entire piece of uneven wall, he totally couldn’t see anything strange at all.","“Is there something?”","“There is! Of course there is!”","Huang Yueli jumped out of his arms as she swiftly walked over.","She stretched out her right hand and her slender fingers swiftly moved along seven to eight positions on the wall as she continuously pressed down hard on it.","Hearing a “click” sound, a burst of dust flew and a portion of the wall moved backwards to reveal a secret door.","Li Moying acted swiftly as he locked his little fiancée’s waist and dragged her backwards.","Unfortunately, Huang Yueli was still choked by the dust which had fallen down onto her when the wall moved and kept coughing non stop.","Luckily, this secret door wasn’t a mechanism armed with attack nature hence she had not suffered any injuries.","Li Moying gave her an angry stare, “Why are you not defensive at all? Just simply opening the door directly? What if there’s a mechanism on the door? You’d definitely be hurt and I won’t be able to save you in time!”","Huang Yueli didn’t think much of it as she replied, “How is that possible? I’m the Armament Master here! Whether there’s any mechanisms or not, surely I’d know right? I.....”","She was originally speaking with confidence as everything she said had sense but after being glared at by Li Moying’s upset gaze, she started to feel guilty as her voice also toned down.","This man’s angry look was really a teeny wee bit frightening.... But how could he be so fierce towards her?","With this thinking in mind, she stared back at him righteously!","Li Moying had always been absolutely helpless towards his little fiancée who always acted pampered and arrogant so he could only shake his head as he walked forward, towards the secret door.","The entrance of the secret door was concealed by an entire patch of bluish purple light as the electricity flickered to the extent of the surrounding Heaven and Earth Profound Qi being affected, making one felt extremely suppressed.","Actually the entire central region was where the thunder attributed energy was at its strongest. It was denser than the outside world by at least ten times and to ordinary practitioners, it was something which would make them feel extremely unbearable.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Huang Yueli and Li Moying had great innate talents in terms of the thunder attribute, they would probably not be able to last at this place for two hours and they would have suffered a serious internal injury.","But now right in front of this ray, the intensity of the thunder attribute increased yet again.","Even Huang Yueli was starting to feel uncomfortable as she frowned and started to retreat several steps.","Li Moying on the other hand, looked the same as he totally didn’t feel anything uncomfortable about this.","He stood in front of the ray and asked, “Li’er, are you sure this secret door had no mechanism? This patch of ray doesn’t look very normal.....”","Huang Yueli looked over from afar and replied, “This basically is a kind of mechanism but not that type that you’re thinking of. It merely filters the practitioners who can enter this place. Apparently, in order to enter this secret room, one must at least be a ninth stage realm thunder attributed practitioner. Other attributes are not able to enter, unless.....”","Before she could finish up, she already saw Li Moying’s foot stepping into it, without getting hurt at all.","Furthermore he even turned back his head and asked curiously, “Why aren’t you continuing? Unless what?”","Huang Yueli’s lips twitched, “Unless for an abnormal god grade thunder attributed genius like you!”"]},{"number":1519,"title":"Chapter 1519 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (4)","paragraphs":["She continued in exasperation, “Alright, as a man, stop being so naggy to keep on asking and asking and asking. Anyway this mechanism is of no threat to you so you’d better hurry on in to take a look. See if there’s any clues in the secret room that can help us to leave this place!”","Li Moying looked at her angry face as his lips couldn’t help but curled upwards.","His Li’er definitely wanted to have a look around the secret room but too bad... although she had ninth grade thunder attributed innate talent, but she wasn’t able to enter so it was no wonder that she was feeling so gloomy.","But even if she put on an angry look, she was still so adorable.","Alright I’ll head in first. Be obedient and wait here for me, don’t run about.” He instructed.","Huang Yueli gave a snort, “Isn’t that gibberish? Where else can I run off to?”","Li Moying smiled as he turned around into the secret room.","Huang Yueli was waiting on the outside for quite some time and felt a little bored hence she got up to add security onto the array, changing the magical beasts cores which were almost depleted of energy.","This kind of defensive array which blocked out those magical beasts actually used up quite a huge amount of resources.","For them to keep the array on throughout the day and night needed a fresh batch of seventh grade magical beast cores every four hours. This was simply burning money and there were many ninth stage realm practitioners who did not have such capacity, hence they would naturally feel their hearts ache and their entire being ache as well as a huge headache!","But Huang Yueli herself was wealthy enough, not to mention that she had a fiancé who was at her beck and call, responsible for getting the magical beast cores hence there wasn’t much reluctance in her at all.","After waiting for around two hours, Li Moying walked out from the secret room.","Huang Yueli immediately went up to him as she interrogated, “You’re finally out! What’s there in the secret room? Have you found any useful clues?”","Li Moying smiled and suddenly raised his hand and hung something around Huang Yueli’s neck.","“This is for you, do you like it?”","Huang Yueli lowered her head to take a look and her eyes immediately grew wide with joy.","Li Moying had given her an impressively carved jade made out of a piece of rainbow spirit crystal. Furthermore the lustre was exceptional, more crystal clear than those seven pieces which existed in Soaring Heavens Continents. She could also clearly sensed the unmatchable powerful energy which was contained inside!","She stretched out her hand to touch this rainbow spirit crystal pendant as she simply loved it so much that she couldn’t bear to part with it, “It’s so pretty! Did you find it in the secret room?”","Li Moying nodded, “There are a lot of thunder attributed Profound Artifacts and cultivation methods and also some medicinal pills. But only this, I guessed that you’d like it very much. In the past didn’t you always hope to have one?”","Huang Yueli’s smile was radiant.","In her past life, she had always wanted a piece of rainbow spirit crystal and Mu Chengying had risked his life to get one for her but she’s not expecting him to still remember this in this lifetime.....","“Unfortunately, I wonder if that piece in my past life had exploded along with my self-explosion. Even if it hadn’t, it’s probably impossible to find it back now... but, this piece is much prettier! Thank you darling.”","Saying that she tipped her toes up and swiftly gave Li Moying a peck on his cheek.","Li Moying went into a blank and had an overwhelmed look on his face, apparently not expecting his pampered and arrogant little fiancée to automatically throw herself into his arms!","However, before he could even reminisce properly, Huang Yueli had already retreated backwards and at the same time asking, “Other than Profound Armaments and whatever, there’s nothing else?”","Li Moying then regained his senses but he no longer could catch her as he replied helplessly, “This secret room seemed to be a temporary home for some senior from the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the ancient times.”"]},{"number":1520,"title":"Chapter 1520 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (5)","paragraphs":["“As this is that senior’s temporary abode, so he hadn’t left many things behind. There is a manuscript which recorded some matters related to this valley.”","As Li Moying spoke, he retrieved a yellowed notebook from his chest pocket as he passed it over to Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli received it and couldn’t wait as she started flipping through it.","She only took a look and smiled, “This is quite the coincidence. The owner of this manuscript seems to be Sage Wu Ding! We had collected a huge fortune in his cave dwelling a couple of days ago and now we’ve entered his secret room, it seems that we have an affinity with him!”","The first half portion of the manuscript recorded some insight which Sage Wu Ding had obtained while in his path of cultivation and some minor daily matters.","It was obvious that Sage Wu Ding’s cultivation was extremely high, at least tenth stage realm and above. Other than that, his status in the Cloudy Qilin Clan was rather high as well, especially in terms of thunder attributed cultivation method, he had an exceptional exclusive understanding on it so this to Li Moying was of great value.","But Huang Yueli was rather uninterested in this portion.","She swiftly glanced through and finally found the contents in the last few pages which she was interested in.","Sage Wu Ding had mentioned that in the process of his cultivation, he had met with a bottleneck and for the longest time ever, he wasn’t able to breakthrough. Hence after expending a huge amount of effort, he finally managed to apply for a quota to enter the central region. Therefore he set his mind that if he didn’t break through, he would not leave that place. That was why he set up an array formation in a slightly hidden location within the central region.","As Huang Yueli watched, she suddenly screamed.","“So this valley is actually Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement grounds!”","Li Moying looked at her shocked expression as he couldn’t help but laughed, “Is there a need to be so shocked? Doesn’t your Sacred Phoenix Race also have your own refinement grounds? Cloudy Qilin Clan is also one of the ancient spiritual clans so why can’t they have one as well?”","Huang Yueli replied, “This... the difference between the two clan’s refinement grounds is too huge of a difference....”","In the Sacred Phoenix Race’s inheritance tower, there was a senior like Huang Zixiao around to guide her step by step with detailed instructions. With that, she knew clearly what the reward was after she had passed by each stage and it was transparently shown.","But in the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s valley, if this was really its refinement grounds, wasn’t it a little too ridiculous!","Such a large area with danger lurking around, there wasn’t even a proper place for the practitioner to rest and recuperate. Furthermore, before they reached this place, they had already been pursued after by a group of magical beasts with their lives on the verge. If one’s ability was slightly weaker, he would have died before he even entered the valley, not to mention anything about refinement?","Li Moying looked at her shocked look as he laughed, “You haven’t taken a detailed look at the contents right? Senior Wu Ding mentioned that the way Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Race nurtures their younger generation are totally different. Sacred Phoenix Race are extremely protective towards their younger generation with great potential, and will supply them with a large amount of resources, doing their best to help them raise their ability to ensure that they become the clan’s pillar of support in future. But Cloudy Qilin Clan is the exact opposite.”","“Cloudy Qilin Clan uses the method of rearing parasites. Resources wouldn’t be split equally to all geniuses, instead they’re required to go fight for it on their own. Death awaits those who fail whereas the victor will step on the dead corpses to obtain the resources, rising above others! So, in terms of the number of top experts, Sacred Phoenix Race stands out but the real absolute strongest were mostly from Cloudy Qilin Clan.”"]},{"number":1521,"title":"Chapter 1521 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli’s eyes grew wide, “There’s such a thing! A huge clan like Cloudy Qilin Clan actually does this?”","She had once heard that some sects would use the spartan method of filtering their disciples but in Soaring Heavens Continent, most Sect felt that this method was too cruel and the method itself was similar to demonic ways hence proper large Sects would not do that.","However Cloudy Qilin Clan had a respectable status in God Realm yet they actually adopted this method which was why it made her extremely surprised.","Li Moying however didn’t think much of it, “A large clan with an inheritance of several thousand hundred years really isn’t that simple to achieve? For Cloudy Qilin Clan to have this kind of regulation, there must be a reason for it! Moreover speaking, the art of cultivation originally is a fight against heavens so there really aren’t too many who can reach the peak. Furthermore, even if there is no such regulation, did you really think that the same generation in the clan would not attack each other mutually? This is merely bringing the underground fights to the surface.”","Huang Yueli immediately thought of Murong Fei and Li Lingchuan and the others who pushed them down her, as she sighed.","She couldn’t not admit that what Li Moying said was right.","“In this case, this place really is Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement grounds? But how do you go on with the refinement here? To what extent of accomplishment do we achieve before we can leave this place?”","Li Moying shook his head and said, “Senior Wu Ding’s manuscript didn’t talk about this in detail. He only mentioned that while in the valley, the higher the grade of the magical beasts killed, the more advantages one would gain and the more central the location, the higher the grade of the magical beasts. Lastly entering the deepest core of the central region would result in confirmation of the final refinement results.”","He paused and continued, “That’s right, Senior Wu Ding also mentioned that in the ancient times, it wasn’t an easy matter to enter the valley for refinement. Only the strongest among the same generation would be able to enter so our luck isn’t that bad for us to be able to enter this place.”","Huang Yueli smiled, “I’d never expected that Li Lingchuan thought that he could harm us but in the end, he helped us instead!”","Li Moying swept her a glance and kept his smile away as he replied solemnly, “Don’t be too quick to be happy. The rate of those peerless geniuses who entered this valley and failed are around eighty percent and above! Cloudy Qilin Clan’s experience training uses the failures’ blood to pave the way! So later when we leave this place, you have to follow me closely and you’re not allowed to run off on your own!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she immediately protested, “What are you saying? Since when have I ran off on my own? Moreover, I’m not a young child and my cultivation isn’t that weak alright? I can take good care of myself!”","Li Moying responded, “If this was the Sacred Phoenix Race’s turf or even an ordinary inheritance ground, I would be absolutely assured. But this is the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement grounds so a little lass from the Sacred Phoenix Race like you had better not cause any trouble for me.”","“What’s wrong with us Sacred Phoenix Race? Have I ruffled your feathers? Hmph!” Huang Yueli raised her chin in a pampered yet arrogant look.","After a while later, she seemed to have recalled something and questioned, “From what you said you’ve finally admitted that you’re from the Cloudy Qilin Clan?”","Li Moying frowned, “Actually I’m still not entirely sure.... But the entrance of the secret room is obviously set up with a restraint. Generally speaking, unless it’s been damaged by brute force or only those practitioners with the same bloodline as senior would be able to enter. Plus the face that little qilin acknowledges me as its Master... so there’s a high possibility that I’m from Cloudy Qilin Clan...”"]},{"number":1522,"title":"Chapter 1522 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s secret (7)","paragraphs":["The longer Huang Yueli looked at him, the more she suddenly felt upset.","Not knowing why, she seemed to have a repulsive feeling towards Cloudy Qilin Clan as there was an ill premonition in her heart.","Li Moying didn’t notice her unusual condition. He stood up and said, “Since we’re clear of the situation, we should start moving.","Huang Yueli’s lips twitched, “In which way are we clear? We still haven’t figured out a way to leave this place!”","“We indeed don’t know but since we’re already here at the refinement grounds, then we can only take part in the refinement. Cloudy Qilin Clan has gathered here for so many years and so many disciples in the clan had taken part in the refinement so there should be a way to leave. As long as the refinement is completed, they should be transmitted out somehow.”","Li Moying’s guess was logical and reasonable which left her unable to rebuke him.","Furthermore, Huang Yueli knew clearly in her heart that Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement was exceptionally important towards Li Moying’s lift in his abilities.","Even if Li Moying wasn’t from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, he was an exceptionally talented thunder attributed practitioner.","As long as he was able to pass the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement, the rewards which he could reap in the end was unimaginable! Even if it wasn’t to leave this place, he should not give up on such a heavenly golden opportunity!","Danger or whatever was not in Li Moying’s boundary of consideration.","In his past life, the reason why he was able to become Soaring Heavens Continent’s number one top expert, other than the fact that he had absolute outstanding innate talent, more importantly he had always looked forward not fearing any challenges and definitely not letting go of any chance at all!","Huang Yueli understood him the best so she didn’t bother with any gibberish as she immediately stood up and followed him closely.","“Then let’s go!”","She thought for a moment and opened her mouth again, “But, you’d better put these on first.”","She retrieved some pieces of Profound Armament from the Sky Phoenix Ring and passed it over to Li Moying.","These items were obtained in Sage Wu Ding’s cave the other day and at that time, Huang Yueli kept it all with the intention of doing research on it. But as the situation now was slightly more urgent, Li Moying needed to prove his ability to pass the refinement with his best standard, hence she had no choice but to bring it out.","Li Moying accepted it from her hands and gave her a grin, “Finally willing to give it to me?”","Huang Yueli rolled her eyes at him.","Li Moying then smiled and speedily put on the Profound Armor, then wearing the Profound Artifact and pulled out the Amethyst Light Sword.","Huang Yueli’s fingers moved deftly and very quickly, the array to the cave was shut.","The minute the array’s barrier vanished, the magical beasts which laid in wait outside the cave immediately surged upwards!","They had already been blocked out of the cave by the array for three days and had starved for a long time! They were obviously blocked by an array and could still sense two exceptionally delicious people with overflowing Profound Energy but they could only watch with their eyes and were not able to devour them!","This feeling was especially annoying and the magical beasts hungered for the two of them even more.","Hence when the restraint was set free, those magical beasts seemed as though they had gone mad, fighting to be the first as they pounced over towards them!","Li Moying’s foot stepped hard and he swiftly moved in front to block Huang Yueli. The Amethyst Light Sword swung out several bright rays in mid-sky as though it was a piece of unregulated pattern but in actual fact, he had already struck out more than a hundred strokes within an instant!","The foremost few magical beasts were heavily injured and shocked beyond senses as they hastily retreated backwards!","If it was before, Li Moying would usually not bother to chase after the injured magical beasts.","Because there were simply too many magical beasts around and it was necessary for him to continue fighting so he couldn’t waste his Profound Energy. Anyway after these magical beasts were injured, their Profound Energy would dissipate and they would turn into a meal for their common species, being swallowed cleanly."]},{"number":1523,"title":"Chapter 1523 - Free cultivation giveaway (1)","paragraphs":["But now, after he read Sage Wu Ding’s manuscript, his heart was suddenly moved upon looking at those escaping magical beasts.","The manuscript mentioned that the more magical beasts which were killed in the refinement, the more advantages he would derive...","If he wanted to get a good result in the refinement, just forcing them to retreat wasn’t enough, he must strike them down one by one!","Li Moying’s thoughts flashed past swiftly as his footwork allowed him to catch up to them swiftly!","These magical beasts escaped really quickly and they headed towards different directions while fleeing. Luckily Li Moying had decisively decided on a direction immediately as he pursued and as several bolts of lightning flashed past, a sixth grade magical beast died under his sword!","With a loud “Boom”, the magical beast’s body laid limp on the ground.","Li Moying withdrew his sword and was just about to leave when his gaze suddenly grazed past the magical beast’s corpse for a moment as he stood stunned.","“Hmm?”","Seeing the magical beast’s body suddenly smoking with bursts of bluish purple current, little small light balls started to float out from its body as it slowly rose upwards into the sky.","Those magical beasts which were not too far away all got excited as they ferociously pounced over upon seeing these little light balls!","Li Moying was in a daze for a breath’s time when he suddenly understood the entire meaning.","These light balls were thunder attributed energy which had been accumulated in that magical beast’s body and following its death, these energies were unable to be contained in its body so it could only dissipate out, returning back to the valley once again....","Meanwhile these energy itself was extremely pure, even purer than those intentionally gathered Heaven and Earth Profound Energy by those ancient practitioners, even denser by a hundred or thousand times!","Seeing the surrounding magical beasts about to pounce towards him, Li Moying’s right hand suddenly rose up as he waved gently.","Those light balls instantly changed its direction and like an invisible hand guiding it, it flew towards his side.","The other magical beasts seemed as though they had gone crazy as they bared their fangs and pounded ferociously towards Li Moying.","Li Moying’s expression didn’t change at all as he steadily guided those light balls.","It merely took a couple of breath’s time when the light balls all fell into his palm.","The minute it laid on him, Li Moying felt a stream of warm energy entering his meridians. This energy was not only pure and powerful, it was also extremely compatible with his Profound Energy!","Originally it was a difficult talk to combine external energy internally and it usually required a long time to medicate and refine but these light balls seemed to merge with his internal Profound Energy immediately and the process was extremely fast. So fast that Li Moying had yet to sense it obviously and the energy from the light balls had already become a part of him!","Li Moying’s face lit up with a joyous and shocked expression the minute the light balls’ energy entered his body!","The him who was usually calm and composed suddenly felt perturbed right now.","These light balls contained that sixth grade magical beast’s Profound Energy which he had just killed. Besides that, it was maintained rather perfectly, almost equivalent to fifty percent of the sixth stage magical beast’s Profound Energy while it was still alive!","One must know that the magical beast core which they usually killed could only retain less than thirty percent of the magical beast’s Profound Energy when it was still alive. During absorption, they were usually only able to refine half of it.","As compared to that, the light balls in this valley which magical beasts gave out after their deaths contained energy which was simply too powerful, and it could even be absorbed instantly.....","This simply was akin to free cultivation giveaway!","No wonder Cloudy Qilin Clan tried ways and means to create such horrifying and sinister refinement grounds."]},{"number":1524,"title":"Chapter 1524 - Free cultivation giveaway (2)","paragraphs":["These magical beasts that Cloudy Qilin Clan reared, although they were extremely dangerous as this kind of model, attracted chain attacks which could instantly take away a weak practitioner’s life.","But to a strong practitioner, these magical beasts were simply offering their Profound Energy. Though killing them to obtain Profound Energy, it was a kind of cultivation method which was faster than any other kind of training!","Li Moying’s spirit jolted as the gaze he casted upon those few magical beasts pouncing towards him changed entirely.","The magical beasts were running swiftly in mid-air when they suddenly felt a chill running down their spines.","They somehow felt that this human’s gaze wasn’t quite right.... Looking at them as though they were a scrumptious meal?? Was there something wrong, obviously he was their scrumptious meal alright?","Li Moying’s Profound Energy within him was incomparably abundant right now and the surging Profound Energy seemed to be seeping out from his meridians! The light balls earlier not only replenished the Profound Energy which he lost in the battle earlier, in fact it even reaped additional rewards for him.","He grabbed his sword with his backhand and his Profound Energy within him poured out in torrents! His sword qi warp and weft in weaving, overbearing and assertive!","Those magical beasts which pounced up were grazed by his sword qi and were instantly scorched while giving off miserable shrills! Some of them fled for their lives immediately but some which were injured turned even more savage and ruthless as they howled wildly while pouncing towards Li Moying!","Li Moying looked at those injured ones which had escaped and he suddenly felt a sense of regret.....","He had finally injured some... alright, it was actually easy to injure them... but those were his Profound Energy, his cultivation! They just ran and ran and ran off like that....","Although he thought in that way but he was rather steady in differentiating the consequences.","The few magical beasts in front were evidently the strongest among those which had pounced over earlier.","Li Moying’s Amethyst Light Sword kept waving as it absorbed the surrounding Heaven and Earth Profound Qi, all gathering towards him.","It seemed as though with every strike of his sword, a magical beast would fall beneath his feet!","Whereas for the light balls from those deceased magical beasts, it was all absorbed into his body!","His Profound Energy was hence replenished and the aura around him grew stronger and stronger, as the speed of his moves became faster and faster!","Very soon, another magical beast became a dead soul under his sword and the light balls....","Li Moying totally didn’t restrain himself any further as he intentionally unleashed the Profound Energy within him recklessly without any scruples. This was because his motive had already changed from evading the magical beasts’ attacks to attracting the magical beasts’ attacks! He wished that more magical beasts would gather around him!","The flow moved in circles and Li Moying felt his own cultivation rising in an evident speed. With this speed of killing, he didn’t need to wait till the sky turned dark and he would be able to advance!","But this little region of magical beasts was rather limited and a large portion of magical beasts had already lost interest when Huang Yueli and Li Moying first hid into the array, departing long ago.","So after an hour plus or more later, Li Moying’s feet laid many high levelled magical beasts corpses and the surrounding magical beasts, other than those few which had escaped earlier, the rest of them had all been killed by him cleanly.","Huang Yueli had also left the array long ago and her mouth had turned into an “O” shape with an extremely dazed expression on her face.","“You.... you, you....”","Was there something wrong with this? Although her own fiancé was indeed powerful but... these were all sixth and seventh grade magical beasts!","To ordinary seventh stage realm practitioners, just meeting with one was already very tough to deal with.","Li Moying actually killed a large heap of them in such a short amount of time?","Moreover it felt much simpler than killing chickens....."]},{"number":1525,"title":"Chapter 1525 - Free cultivation giveaway (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying saw her walking over and waved to her.","“Li’er, come try and absorb these light balls’ energy too.”","His speed of taking down those last few magical beasts was extremely fast and there were some light balls which he had yet to absorb as it was still floating in mid-air.","Huang Yueli walked over and asked, “These light balls are formed out of Profound Energy gathered within those magical beasts?”","Li Moying nodded, “Should be. I finally understand why Sage Wu Ding’s manuscript recorded that the more magical beasts are killed, the greater the rewards reaper! This valley is basically the farm for those magical beasts which Cloudy Qilin Clan reared and their motive is to provide Profound Energy for the clan’s geniuses to absorb.”","Huang Yueli stretched out her hand and absorbed a light ball which was floating.","When the light ball touched her palm, it quickly melded into her body.","But a few moments later, she frowned.","“Thunder attributed Profound energy... doesn’t seem too compatible with me.”","Her innate talent was fire attributed and she could be considered as a heaven grade talent in that aspect but her thunder attributed innate talent was merely at ninth grade.","Ninth grade innate talent in the entire Soaring Heavens Continent was considered as a peerless genius which was a rare talent but as compared to the geniuses in the ancient God clans geniuses, it was rather unremarkable.","So when she was absorbing the Profound Energy, there was an evident difference between her and Li Moying. Her absorption speed and effect were much weaker as compared to Li Moying.","Li Moying smiled and said, Dual attribute Thunder and Fire’s Profound Skills damage power is much higher. Usually you don’t have the time to cultivate thunder attributed cultivation methods so why not take this chance to absorb a little, half the work and twice the effect.”","Huang Yueli nodded.","She originally wasn’t very interested in Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement. After all she was a god grade genius of the Sacred Phoenix Clan and if she was able to get to the final inheritance in the Cloudy Qilin Clan, that would be like meeting a living ghost! Just how blind were Cloudy Qilin Clan’s seniors whereby they weren’t able to judge her clan’s bloodline? If she went up to try out the refinement process, the advantages which she got would be limited and perhaps her identity might even be exposed.","But looking at those light balls filled with energy lying on the ground, she was tempted by it.","Especially now that she had an exceedingly unsurpassed top exponent Li Moying right beside her, killing magical beasts was such an easy feat so absorbing Profound Energy to her was just as simple as lifting a finger.","Having thought of this, her face revealed a sweet smile, you’re working so hard to kill the magical beasts and if I were to absorb the energy away, it’s not very nice of me to do that.....”","Li Moying couldn’t help but laughed as he pinched her face, “Are you really feeling sorry or just pretending to be so? It’s originally my duty to take care of my wife so sharing some Profound Energy with you is just a small matter.”","Huang Yueli’s lips lifted in satisfaction as she ran off to absorb the rest of the light balls.","Finding out about the regulations of the valley’s refinement, the two of them need not continue hiding in the cave.","They roamed around the valley hand in hand and the minute they saw thunder attributed magical beasts, they immediately went up to kill it while absorbing the energy in the light balls.","In order to allow Huang Yueli to obtain a little more Profound Energy, Li Moying practically beat up the magical beasts till they were on their last breath and dragging it all the way till Huang Yueli reached and allowed her to give them the last blow. During the actual combat, they discovered that the practitioner who last killed the magical beasts would yield a higher rate of absorbing the light balls.","However, even so, the speed of Huang Yueli’s cultivation advancement couldn’t be compared to Li Moying’s!","When Li Moying first entered the valley, his cultivation was merely at seventh stage realm fifth level but it had only been seven days since they came and he had already broken through three small realms continuously, arriving at seventh stage realm eighth level!"]},{"number":1526,"title":"Chapter 1526 - Free cultivation giveaway (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Li Moying was just twenty one years old this year and he had already reached seventh stage realm eighth level.","If this matter was spread out, it was absolutely an achievement which had never been fulfilled since the dawn of time.","Ever since ten thousand years ago when the change in Soaring Heavens Continent occurred causing the thinning of Heaven and Earth’s Profound Qi, no one had been able to achieve such cultivation speed! He had already far surpassed all the geniuses in the past ten thousand years!","Huang Yueli’s advancement speed couldn’t catch up to his but she had reaped great benefits as well.","When she first entered this place, she was only at fifth stage realm first level. She had barely broken through to the fifth stage realm in just under one month ago.","Whereas now, her cultivation had already broken through to fifth stage realm fourth level!","Of course, although the two of them had been promoted by three small realms, but as Li Moying’s cultivation was much higher, the difficulty of promotion for him was ten times or more than for Huang Yueli!","But Huang Yueli had not felt disappointed because of this.","This valley originally was the Cloudy Qilin Sect’s refinement grounds and as a member of the opposing energy of Cloudy Qilin Sect being able to gain all the advantages here was already a stolen fact.","A young Sacred Phoenix Race’s lass actually followed their own clan’s genius into the top rated refinement grounds which only Cloudy Qilin Clan’s peerless geniuses could enter based on their mixed Profound Energy. Furthermore she only needed to stay behind her man, didn’t need to use much energy and Profound Energy would automatically be sent to her. If the seniors of the Cloudy Qilin Clan found out about this, they would probably explode from fury immediately!","However she was having such a good life now because someone had let her find such a great fiancé like Li Moying?","Furthermore, there weren’t only magical beasts in the valley. There were plenty of secret rooms in this place, like the ones which Sage Wu Ding left behind. All these were all historical remains left behind by those Cloudy Qilin Sect’s top exponents when they went into closed door cultivation. In those rooms were Profound Armaments, medicinal pills and manuscripts which were left behind by those top exponents. As time went by, those items were no longer owned by anyone.","The mechanisms and restraint outside the historical remains wasn’t an obstacle to Huang Yueli.","Hence while they were killing magical beasts to cultivate, they also entered plenty of other secret rooms and caves, retrieving all those treasures.","These things were all kept away by Huang Yueli.","Unknowingly, the two of them had stayed for several days in the valley and the designated date to leave the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region had reached but they were still unable to find a way to leave this place.","However, the both of them weren’t overly anxious because the cultivation speed in the valley was just too fast!","Huang Yueli and Li Moying were both knowledgeable people and they naturally knew that as long as they had enough ability, there would be a way to leave the mystic region. But chances like this to raise their cultivations quickly were rare. It was evident which was more important.","But although they weren’t too mindful of this, their disappearance had already caused a huge commotion between the two Sects.","...","Outside the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, Murong De and Cui Yuan Shan both led their Elders and stood in place according to the array’s position, preparing to reactivate the mystic region once again in order for those disciples who went in for training to leave.","Before the activation of the mystic region, everyone present was in anticipation and nervous.","Entering the ancient mystic region was indeed a heavenly opportunity but chance and crisis often co-existed and every time they entered a mystic region, there would be a number of talented disciples who would meet with their demise within.","If the demised talents were too many or too powerful, then to the Sect it would not be an opportunity but rather a huge loss incurred!","Murong De turned his head back to take a look at Cui Yuan Shan only to discover that his expression was steely green, apparently much more anxious than himself."]},{"number":1527,"title":"Chapter 1527 - Disastrous losses (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1527: Disastrous losses (1)","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","This time entering the mystic region, the risks of Green Cloud Sect was much higher than Celestial Light Sect.","Because the number of quota which Green Cloud had gained was a total of thirty percent of the total number of people so if anything were to happen, their mutual support possibility was very minute and of course they would be at a disadvantage as compared to the side with more people.","Moreover this time round, Celestial Light Sect’s leader was Li Moying!","A number one genius in South Sky Region, not only did he have exceeding innate talent, he also had abundant experience in terms of experience training. So with him leading the team and with a high levelled Armament Master like Huang Yueli to aid him, Celestial Light Sect basically had no worries in terms of safety. If there were any truly great chances, Green Cloud Sect would not be able to win him at all.","Thinking of this, Murong De’s heart couldn’t help but feel complacent.","Just at this moment, intense shaking could be felt from the ground.","The auspicious time was up and all the Elders injected their Profound Energy, reactivating the entrance of the Cloudy Qiling Mystic Region.","Very soon, one after another disciple started to walk out of the entrance.","Cui Yuan Shan hurried up to welcome them and started to do a tally on the number of people while enquiring on their rewards in the mystic region.","Murong De, on the other hand, was very unhurried because with Li Moying around, he was extremely at ease.","But not too long later, he realised that things were not right.","Those Celestial Light Sect disciples who walked out of the mystic region were all looking pale, as though they had suffered a huge setback without any sliver of joy from gaining opportunities within the mystic region.","The entrance was only activated for two hours and as time went by, two hours was going to be up but none of the top talents which Murong De was most concerned about had appeared at all.","He originally thought that Li Moying and the rest were all at the back but there was no one else who walked out from the entrance and there was no sight of them as well.","Murong De’s expression finally changed and he called a direct disciple dressed in blue as he asked anxiously, “What’s going on? Why is Young Sect Master, Young Miss and the rest still not out yet?”","The blue robed disciple trembled and lowered his head, his voice started to shake.","“Reporting.... to Sect Master, Young Sect Master he.... he didn’t manage to come to the gathering point. He seems... seems to have gone missing in the mystic region.....” Read more chapter on v ip novel. com","Murong De originally had some wild guesses in his mind but he somehow felt that he must have guessed wrongly. Li Moying had always been rather reliable and never made any mistakes at a crucial point of time so how could he possibly fall in a mere mystic region?","But from the looks of it now.....","There was a greater shock waiting for him as that blue robed disciples paused for a moment and clenched his teeth then braced himself to continue, “Not only Young Sect Master, Young Miss, Junior Sister Bai, Senior Brother Li, they have all disappeared..... Senior Brother Luo originally came to the gathering point but he left when the mystic region reactivated just to go search for Young Sect Master....”","When Murong De heard that, his eyes rolled over and instantly fainted.","An Elder who was standing behind him reacted quickly to catch hold of him and fed him with a medicinal pill thus allowing him to regain consciousness.","Although he was conscious, but Murong De was still shaking totally in fear and shock, not daring to believe what he heard was true.","“You... explain to me clearly.... The few of them are all top rated talents so how is it possible that they.... all went missing?”","Hearing those interrogative questions, the blue robed disciple immediately started to sweat.","He had heard Luo Jiyun and Fang Shaoning’s words earlier and knew that Li Lingchuan had conspired with the others to scheme Li Moying, and were killed instead."]},{"number":1528,"title":"Chapter 1528 - Disastrous losses (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","But he wasn’t sure if Murong De would believe in these kinds of words because it implicated his biological daughter Murong Fei!","Moreover, Green Cloud Sect’s disciples were around as well and this matter concerned Green Cloud Sect’s eldest disciple Leng Yi Feng.","The blue robed disciple was only an ordinary direct disciple and if this matter turns into a huge commotion he was worried that he would be the one who had to take on the anger from them.","But he hesitated for a moment and decided to tell the truth.","Just as he was about to open his mouth, a bustle of commotion was suddenly heard coming from the crowd.","“Look quickly! There’s some movements from the entrance, someone’s coming out again!”","“This is just too timely! Merely another ten over breaths and the entrance will be shut so this is the last opportunity to leave!”","“I wonder who has such good luck? Could it be Young Sect Master?”","“It must be him! I don’t believe that with Young Sect Master’s kind of ability, he would really fall to his demise like that!”","Everyone turned their heads towards the entrance of the mystic region and Murong De and Cui Yuan Shan agitatedly walked towards the front of the mystic region.","At the entrance were two ashen faced figures, almost as though they crawled and rolled out from there.","Their clothes on them were tattered and stuck with mud and dust and furthermore they had serious injuries inflicted upon them. Some wounds were so deep which the bones could be seen and there were some where their skins were evidently scorched, cutting an extremely dishevelled state.","But no matter what they were two live beings.","Everyone leaned close and cried out in joy.","“It’s Senior Sister Murong and Senior Brother Li! They’re actually not dead and have managed to come out successfully at the last minute!”","“No matter what, at least they’re still alive.....”","Just as Murong Fei and Li Lingchuan got out, the entrance to the mystic region started to close up slowly.Read more chapter on v ip novel. com","“Quickly look! The entrance to the mystic region is going to disappear!”","“That’s it, this time it’s really the end! Young Sect Master he really didn’t come out! And that Leng Yi Feng from Green Cloud Sect! They.... are they really...”","Amidst the crowd who were in shock, the ones with the ugliest expressions on them were the two Sect Masters Murong De and Cui Yuan Shan.","They were the most outstanding eldest disciples under their wings and they had not come out from the mystic region whereas now, the mystic region’s entrance was going to close up! This meant that they were not able to come out anymore. So even if they had not died, they were destined to die inside the mystic region!","They urged the Elders at the same time, “Try to hang on for a moment more, to let the entrance shut a little later!”","But the Elders’ Profound Energy were extremely limited and no matter how hard they tried to drag on the time, but the entrance still shut eventually.","This meant that the mystic region experience training this time had really completely ended.","Li Moying and Leng Yi Feng, really didn’t manage to come out of there....","Murong De’s feet turned into jelly and almost fainted once again!","Celestial Light Sect’s losses are simply too severe!","A peerless genius like Li Moying in South Sky Region died just like that! He was the greatest hope who could possibly bring Celestial Light Sect to the peak! Murong De placed all his hopes onto him!","In the end... he actually had such an ending??","This kind of peerless genius, shouldn’t he have extra luck on him and no matter what difficulties he met, he would be able to turn ill luck into good luck? How could he have died so easily?"]},{"number":1529,"title":"Chapter 1529 - Disastrous losses (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Furthermore, Celestial Light Sect’s losses weren’t just this.","Li Moying’s fiancée Bai Ruoli also didn’t manage to come out. Although this young lass wasn’t nurtured by Celestial Light Sect, but she was an accidental reward. But such a talented Armament Master with such good cultivation innate talent was so rare that even Li Moying couldn’t hope to be compared with her!","Murong De was feeling delighted secretly for taking in such a peerless genius because of Li Moying.","But he had not expected that this treasure had just fallen into their hands for only a few days and even before it warmed up, it also disappeared together with him?","And Luo Jiyun as well, although he wasn’t a peerless talent as compared to Li Moying and Huang Yueli, but he was still an eighth grade talent and was one of those outstanding disciples whom he could entrust his hopes onto! There were only three or four eighth grade talented disciples in Celestial Light Sect and to have one fallen right here made Murong De feel an extreme heartache!","But the lucky thing among the misfortune was that Murong Fei and Li Lingchuan were still alive.....","Murong De looked at the both of them and hurriedly summoned the Sect’s doctors over to render first aid upon seeing their serious injuries.","“Quick, Divine Doctors, please take a look at Fei’er and Master Li, their injuries are not light so we cannot afford to delay any treatment!”","“Sect Master please be assured. Eldest Young Miss and Master Li’s injuries may be serious but they have not reached a life and death situation and as long as they spend more time resting, they should have hopes to recuperate.....”","Murong De heaved a sigh of relief as he knew that both of them should be alright but recalling about Li Moying and the rest who had completely disappeared, he couldn’t help but feel bouts of heartache.","Murong De turned towards that blue robed disciple as he continued on the topic which was interrupted.","“You come back here, earlier this Sect Master has yet to finish my interrogation! What on earth happened to Young Sect Master and the rest? Tell me everything you know!”","Blue robed disciple cried out in pain silently as he was thinking that he had finally managed to evade a crisis earlier but why was it that Murong De had to remember about him now.","But now that things were in such bad state, Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei were just by the side so how was he supposed to reply?","“This... about this... ughh, actually, Young Sect Master he.....” Blue robed disciple hemmed and hawed.","Just at this moment, a weak voice was heard butting in from the side.","“Mas.... Master, Eldest Senior Brother.... When something happened to him, Fei’er and I were right there.....”","Li Lingchuan opened his mouth and Murong De immediately walked up to him agitatedly while questioning in detail, “What? You witnessed it? What on earth happened to your Eldest Senior Brother? Could he really... really had a mishap? Cannot be, with that kind of innate talent and his cool and composed manner, surely it wouldn’t turn out in that manner right?”","He stared at Li Lingchuan and hoped to see him nod his head!","However Li Lingchuan sighed and said softly, “Master, this time Eldest Senior Brother he.... really.... I had not expected this to happen, but.....”","Murong De saw black!","He stumbled and clutched his chest as he took deep breaths and stabilised his emotion.","“Not right, how could this be possible? You really witnessed it with your own eyes?”","Li Lingchuan nodded, “Master, please restrain your grief and accept fate.....”","Murong De was still unwilling to accept the truth but continued chiselling at it, “You... tell me clearly in detail, what exactly happened to your Eldest Senior Brother? What situation was that even he couldn’t handle it at all? He still has Bai Ruoli next to him!”","When Li Lingchuan heard his questions, he frowned slightly as his gaze floated towards Cui Yuan Shan while bearing an expression which seemed as though he wanted to say something but was hesitant about it."]},{"number":1530,"title":"Chapter 1530 - Disastrous losses (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Murong De was feeling extremely flustered as he asked, “What on earth do you mean? Tell me quickly?”","“But... Master, it’s best that we discuss this in private. This occasion... is not suitable.....”","While Li Lingchuan was saying that, he intentionally casted a look at Cui Yuan Shan.","This time round, Murong De finally understood that he had a hidden meaning in his words as he frowned, “What do you mean by that? What can’t you say out openly? Don’t tell me, that Moying’s death.... Has something to do with Green Cloud Sect?”","“This.....” Li Lingchuan gave a shocked look as though his thoughts had been poked with a hole.","Murong De’s expression sunk, “So it’s really like that? I was just saying... Moying’s ability is so excellent, how was it possible that he would meet with his demise here. Looks like it’s really the Green Cloud Sect who had been playing tricks!”","Cui Yuan Shan heard that and took quick steps over with a stern look in his eyes, starting fiercely at Li Lingchuan.","“Little fellow, how dare you sprout nonsense and malign us Green Cloud Sect? Obviously there are more Celestial Light Sect people so how would our Sect have the ability to harm you guys? Make things clearly on what exactly happened! This Sect Master also suspects that Yi Feng’s death.... is related to Li Moying!”","Cui Yuan Shan’s mood was originally very bad and Green Cloud Sect’s losses were quite big as well.","Leng Yi Feng wasn’t able to leave the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region alive.","He wasn’t just Green Cloud Sect’s eldest disciple that simple, his backing was from Sky Emperor City’s Leng family!","Although Leng Yi Feng had met with a mishap during the experience training but to a super powerhouse like Leng family, they need not talk reason with him and if they insisted on venting their anger on Green Cloud Sect, Cui Yuan Shan just simply could not take on this responsibility!","Cui Yuan Shan was already feeling heartache and was on the verge of eruption.","He had not expected that Li Lingchuan would cast a pot of dirty water over. Whatever he tried to say meant to hint that Green Cloud Sect’s people had caused Li Moying’s death! This made him explode completely!","Although Li Lingchuan was prepared, but under the suppression of a well-established ninth stage realm top expert, his sweat started to sprout and taking on the opponent’s impact, Li Lingchuan’s internal injury which had just gotten slightly better worsened again as he couldn’t help but spat out mouthfuls of blood.","Murong De hurriedly stood in between the two of them.","“Enough Brother Cui, let’s talk things out properly! Bullying a junior like that, what ability is that considered to be?”","Cui Yuan Shan laughed coldly, “I want to hear what rubbish he has prepared to cook up!”","Li Lingchuan coughed several times and his voice became even weaker, “Mas... Master, Sect Master Cui, you two... stop arguing, please listen to what I have to say. Ten days ago in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, Third Junior Sister and I partnered together to go on experience learning and when we heard fighting sounds from the mountain nearby, we headed up to check it out. In the end we saw Eldest Senior Brother and Mister Leng arguing and were about to fight it out!”","“What? They really started to fight?” Murong De frowned.","Li Lingchuan nodded, “That’s right, I went up with Third Junior Sister to mediate in their quarrel then we discovered that the both of them were on loggerheads over who a spot of treasure belongs to. Eldest Senior Brother and Mister Leng both stuck to their own version of the story and I was thinking since our two Sects are usually on good terms, naturally it would be best if we can place harmony as the priority so I suggested splitting the treasure equally. Whoever knew that both of them didn’t agree and upon disagreement, they started to fight!”","“Third Junior Sister and I originally wanted to mediate but whoever knew we were both affected by their Profound Energies and out of carelessness, both of us sustained serious injuries!”","Murong De cried out in surprise, “What? Your injury is also caused by Leng Yi Feng?”"]},{"number":1531,"title":"Chapter 1531 - Disastrous losses (5)","paragraphs":["When Cui Yuan Shan heard that, he gave a sneer, “Brother Murong, are you deaf? Didn’t you hear this little fellow say that he was injured by the impact? Perhaps it was Li Moying who hurt his own junior brother so how could you blame it on Yi Feng? Simply shameless!”","Murong De answered back sarcastically, “How would Moying possibly deal such a hand on his own junior brother? I think this is obviously your Green Cloud Sect’s trap!”","The two Sect Masters originally were on loggerheads and now that the both of them were fuming, they felt terrible on thinking back about the losses that their Sects suffered. Now they just felt that each other was unpleasant to the eye and immediately started quarrelling.","An invisible cold smile flashed past on Li Lingchuan’s lips.","But he quickly concealed his smile as he opened his mouth weakly, “Master, Sect Master Cui, stop quarrelling.... This is really an accidental injury, absolutely not something that Eldest Senior Brother or Mister Li did on purpose.... At that time, the both of them were fighting till they lost their senses so it was impossible to consider other people when they fought, which was why Third Junior Sister and I were hurt by the scattered Profound Energy! To tell the truth, I’d never imagined that Eldest Senior Brother and Mister Leng’s ability had exceeded us among the same generation by so much!”","Cui Yuan Shan still didn’t quite believe his words. To be honest, in the depths of his heart, he didn’t quite believed that Leng Yi Feng could engaged in a battle with Li Moying for such a long time but if he were to cast such suspicious words out, it would cause damage to Green Cloud Sect’s reputation hence he refrained himself from speaking out these words.","Li Lingchuan said this and immediately added on, “At that time, Mister Leng held out a piece of Profound Armament and its might was extremely powerful. Eldest Senior Brother was injured because of it. Moreover when the two of them crossed hands, we’re not the only two who suffered from it. Even Miss Bai was also injured from that!”","Cui Yuan Shan suddenly recalled that Leng Yi Feng had a Profound Artifact which the Leng family had given him as a last resort to preserve his life. This fact was known by very few people and since Li Lingchuan could say this out, could it be that... What he said was true?","He frowned and stared intently at Li Lingchuan, “What was the result? After my disciple and Li Lingchuan fought, what was the result?”","Li Lingchuan continued, “The matter happened like this. Although the two of them started to argue initially, but it wasn’t considered as a life threatening fight. But as the Profound Energy emitted during the battle was too strong and Miss Bai was impacted by it. Not only was she injured, she was also sent flying off, down the cliff! Eldest Senior Brother pampered Miss Bai so much, this is something which everyone could see with their own eyes. His expression immediately changed and after killing Mister Leng, he jumped down the cliff along with Miss Bai! Later Junior Brother Luo heard about that and wanted to climb down the cliff to save them but in the end he was surrounded by magical beasts and also got into an accident.....”","“What??”","“It’s actually really him who did it??”","Both Sect Masters cried out at the same time in shock.","But very quickly, Cui Yuan Shan laughed coldly, “Good, very good, extremely good! There is enough evidence that my disciple Yi Feng was indeed killed by Li Moying! This fellow is just too audacious! He dares to even kill the Leng family’s direct descendant! Simply looking for death!”","He was so angry that he couldn’t restrain himself and with a wave of his right hand, a burst of Profound Energy shot out afar and directly turned a large part of the forest on the front right into a patch of ruins!","Murong De’s expression was as silent as water, “Sect Master Cui, what so you mean by this? It’s common for disciples in the mystic region to engage in battles. Moreover even though your disciple had met with a mishap, Moying had also jumped down the cliff and died because of that! If we are going to talk about losses, your Green Cloud Sect had merely lost a Leng Yi Feng. But we Celestial Light Sect had lost three eighth grade and above talented super geniuses!”"]},{"number":1532,"title":"Chapter 1532 - Complete secrecy (1)","paragraphs":["Cui Yuan Shan stared at him coldly as the rage in his heart was boiling!","“Li Moying looked for death himself! But my disciple.... Was beaten to death by him!”","Murong De’s was also feeling annoyed as he blamed Li Lingchuan slightly; how could he say such things out openly? Since he was the only witness, he should just push the entire blame to Leng Yi Feng instead. Why did he need to be so honest for?","However, now is not the time to berate him.","Murong De laughed coldly, “There’s no point in deciding who is in the right or wrong now. Moying is now demised in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region and even if you want to settle the debt with him, you can’t find him now!”","Cui Yuan Shan had been keeping it in his heart, as he couldn’t wait to go on a killing spree!","But as what Murong De said, Li Moying was already dead! Even if he looked for people to seek revenge, he wasn’t able to find the person to exact revenge on!","Of course, he could also seek Celestial Light Sect for revenge.","But Celestial Light Sect’s total ability, although couldn’t be matched up to Green Cloud Sect but the disparity between the two weren’t considered very huge. If it really boiled down to a life and death gamble, it wasn’t certain who might be the eventual winner! Even if Green Cloud Sect could win, it would definitely shake the entire Sect’s foundation, ending up in a lose-lose situation and they would not stand to gain anything at all!","“Although Li Moying is already dead, this Sect Master will not involve the innocent but if the Leng family received the demised news of their talent in the family, whether they are as reasonable as this Sect Master will be a question! You’re on your own!”","Cui Yuan Shan stifled for a long time as he balanced out the pros and cons and eventually decided to swallow this anger.","Anyway when the Leng family found out about this matter, they would definitely seek revenge so Celestial Light Sect wouldn’t have that many good days ahead of them!","Cui Yuan Shan finished what he had to say and brought his men away as he flicked his sleeves furiously!","Li Lingchuan saw Green Cloud Sect’s people getting away further as his lips couldn’t help but surfaced a smile.","That day, he almost died after being severely injured by Li Moying.","Luckily he had with him, an eighth grade medicinal pill Nine Lives Reversal Pill which he had gotten during an experience learning trip. This pill’s effect was extremely powerful; as long as the injuries weren’t shattered meridians or primordial spirit being split, it would forcibly allow the practitioner to recuperate by a large margin.","He originally couldn’t bear to take this sort of great stuff, preparing to sell it off at an auction in Sky Emperor City for a huge fortune so that he could exchange for his cultivation resources.","But since things had come to such a pass with death standing at his doorstep, he could only clench his teeth to swallow it down. Nothing was more important than preserving his life!","Right after Li Moying jumped down the cliff to follow Huang Yueli, after a long while later, Li Lingchuan finally regained ten percent of his Profound Energy as he climbed up from the ground.","By this time, Luo Jiyun had already regained consciousness and had disappeared.","Li Lingchuan first went over to check on Murong Fei’s injuries. After she was struck flying off by Li Moying’s attack, she fainted and Li Moying was only concerned about saving Huang Yueli so he didn’t bother to check on her. Hence the injuries on her wasn’t too serious but as she had been hurt by thunder attributed Profound Energy, a long scar was left on her face, not knowing if it could be cured in future.","Following that, he headed over to check on Leng Yi Feng’s condition.","In comparison, Leng Yi Feng’s injury was the most serious of them all. As Li Moying was extremely angered at that time, hence he had vented all his anger onto him.","If it hadn’t been for Murong Fei’s sudden appearance who pushed Huang Yueli down the cliff, he would probably have been killed by Li Moying then!","Now he was hanging on his last breath and it looked like even if he didn’t die, his cultivation would have suffered a huge drop.","Li Lingchuan bent over and called out, “Master Leng, Master Leng? Can you hear me talking?”","Leng Yi Feng’s brows creased slightly as he slowly opened his eyes."]},{"number":1533,"title":"Chapter 1533 - Complete secrecy (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“You.....”","The moment he opened his eyes, Leng Yi Feng recalled how Li Lingchuan betrayed him and a sliver of hatred flashed past his eyes.","But he quickly recalled his current predicament and concealed his own emotions as he spoke brokenly, “Li.... Moying.... he.... left?”","Li Lingchuan replied in a hushed voice, “Li Moying has already fallen down the cliff, and it’s all thanks to my Third Junior Sister! Our initial motive has finally been fulfilled!”","Leng Yi Feng finally gave a smile.","Although their boats almost flipped in a narrow alley and all of them almost died in Li Moying’s hands, but they had not expected that in the end, they actually reverted back to the same route and Li Moying actually really fell down!","Even though he was heavily injured, but as long as he could get Li Moying killed, it was considered a success.","“That’s... that’s great.... Master Li, I have a medicinal bottle in my pocket, help me.... take it out....”","Leng Yi Feng actually brought along his medicinal pills but a pity that he was injured so badly that he couldn’t even move a finger. So even if he had medicinal pills, he had no way to eat it so he could only plead with Li Lingchuan for help.","However, Li Lingchuan didn’t head over to help him.","Leng Yi Feng waited for a moment and when he didn’t get a response, he frowned and urged, “Li... Master Li.... Why are you....”","Li Lingchuan suddenly laughed and suppressed his voice, as he spoke in an extremely gentle voice, “Master Leng, I forgot to tell you earlier that it wasn’t only Li Moying who fell down the cliff. Earlier, it was Bai Ruoli who fell down first hence Li Moying jumped down after her! So your sweetheart.... Had also become a dead person!”","“Wh... What??”","Leng Yi Feng was stuck deeply as his eyes opened wide in disbelief!","He came over just for Li Huang Yueli and if she died just like that, then why did he brave through fire and water, even going up against Li Moying causing himself to be seriously injured for?","Just as he was in a state of extreme astonishment, Li Lingchuan started to speak again.","“So your plan had failed completely. So even if you lived, you’re not able to get that young lass, it’s really such a pity.... Since that’s the case, just treat that your plan has failed completely! Originally, you almost died under Li Moying’s sword wasn’t it? Then why don’t you just treat yourself as really dead then.....”","Leng Yi Feng’s heart started throbbing violently, as a bitter coldness arose from his spine!","“You... you....”","He instantly understood what Li lingchuan was trying to do!","However, it was all too late.","The dagger in Li Lingchuan’s hands dropped out and in a moment, it already landed on his heart.","Although Leng Yi Feng’s ability was very strong but right now, his protective Profound Qi had been dispersed by Li Moying entirely and his meridians were completely shattered, totally with no resistance power of any kind.","He struggled a few times but that didn’t change anything at all. Soon the whites of his eyeballs rolled over and he completely became a dead corpse.","Li Lingchuan then kept his dagger and wiped off all the blood traces as a smile of ridicule appeared on his lips.","When Leng Yi Feng opened his eyes, that vengeful sight was noticed by him earlier. His running away at the very last minute and betrayal of Leng Yi Feng was evident that the two of them could no longer be friends.","Moreover, Leng Yi Feng cooperated with him today because of Li Moying’s fiancée. Now that the young lass was dead, Leng Yi Feng gained nothing at all and suffered such huge losses. There was a possibility that he would fly into a rage out of humiliation and betray himself to exact revenge!","Li Lingchuan knew this deep in his heart and when he saw Leng Yi Feng on his last breath, evil intent immediately arose in his heart."]},{"number":1534,"title":"Chapter 1534 - Complete secrecy (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Now he only needed to wave his dagger lightly and he would be able to end Leng Yi Feng’s life.","Moreover, no one would ever find out that he was killed by him, Li Lingchuan.","Even Murong Fei was currently unconscious.","When Murong Fei had hurried over, she witnessed Li Moying and Leng Yi Feng’s fight hence she definitely would not doubt the truth over Leng Yi Feng’s death.","Killing Leng Yi Feng now was an easy feat with no repercussions hence he didn’t need to worry about his own self betraying himself.","Furthermore, the scapegoat to take on this murder could be pushed perfectly onto Li Moying!","Adding on, a disciple like Leng Yi Feng who came from a large family would probably have a lot of valuable treasures in his realm ring. As soon as he died, he would be able to lay his hands onto these! This was a huge fortune which Li Lingchuan could never hope to get in his entire life!","The thoughts in Li Lingchuan’s mind flashed past quickly and just within a few seconds, he already decided to kill him!","What’s more, he quickly carried out the ideas which he had in mind.","After Leng Yi Feng died, Li Lingchuan searched his body and his realm ring for all his treasures, before he woke Murong Fei up.","Murong Fei caused Li Moying to jump down the cliff and had been death with a huge blow as the setback led to a total collapse, totally unable to think properly as per normal. After being terrorised by Li Lingchuan for some time, she got worried that Murong De would pin Li Moying’s death onto her, hence she immediately agreed to perjury for Li Lingchuan.","The two of them spent ten days in seclusion to recuperate and finally managed to recover around twenty to thirty percent of their Profound Energy and directly raced towards the gathering point.","They had actually arrived very early but they were afraid of Luo Jiyun noticing them hence they kept hiding in the darkness.","The minute the entrance of the mystic region was about to close, they finally appeared from a dark corner and left the mystic region.","Originally, Li Lingchuan had prepared plenty of excuses, prepared to debate with Luo Jiyun.","In the end, Luo Jiyun decided to stay in the mystic region to search for Li Moying and was simply a help from Heaven for them! This made Li Lingchuan extremely ecstatic!","Although the other Celestial Light Sect disciples had heard Luo Jiyun spoke out the truth, that was only on Luo Jiyun’s part. No one else were the main parties involved so they couldn’t guarantee that what Luo Jiyun said was the truth and Li Lingchuan’s was false.","Moreover speaking, even if Luo Jiyun’s version was the truth, so what about it?","Li Moying was already dead and Li Lingchuan’s ability in the entire Celestial Light Sect was second to none, far surpassing the other same generation disciples, so the position of future Young Sect Master would naturally belong to him.","If the other disciples wanted to continue mingling around, who would dare to offend Li Lingchuan who wielded power, over a dead man?","Murong De had totally not expected Li Lingchuan to be the mastermind who came out with so many schemes. After he questioned Murong Fei, he believed what Li Lingchuan said.","“You! How could you tell the entire matter out in such a matter! Haven’t you taken a good look at Sect Master Cui’s expression? I’m afraid that from now onwards, the Green Cloud Sect and us will totally become enemies!”","Li Lingchuan said, “But the truth is that... moreover speaking, Sect Master Cui apparently wanted to find out what was going on so it wasn’t that easy to botch the facts. Anyway Eldest Senior Brother is already..... Green Cloud Sect would be unable to find someone to seek revenge on, right?”","“Sigh, Green Cloud Sect would not come bother us but Leng family.... Might not necessarily be so!”","Leng family’s power was on a different level from Celestial Light Sect. They could extinguish Celestial Light Sect with a mere gesture of waving their hand so naturally they wouldn’t have those kinds of worries which Green Cloud Sect had.","Murong De’s face was filled with sorrow as he felt extremely melancholic.","Li Moying.... really died like that? He even left such a huge trouble for Celestial Light Sect"]},{"number":1535,"title":"Chapter 1535 - Heading In Deeper (1)","paragraphs":["But now that things have already happened, there’s no point in getting frustrated over it.","The only thing worth getting happy over was that Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei had managed to return alive. Both of them were eighth grade talents and if it wasn’t for Li Moying, their fame would definitely have spread throughout the entire South Sky Region.","Thinking of this, Murong De’s heart got slightly at ease as his gaze towards Li Lingchuan became extremely amiable.","Right, Celestial Light Sect wasn’t totally finished.....","“Lingchuan ah, your Master is feeling frustrated so I’ll be heading back to the Sect first. I’ll leave the aftermath here for you to handle.” Murong De gave a long sigh and after he gave out his instructions, he led the few Elders and left the scene.","When Li Lingchuan heard that, he shook violently as an indescribable joy arose in his heart! He was so happy that he had even forgotten about the injuries on him.","He had waited just too long for these words from Murong De.","Letting him represent the Sect Master to administer matters, wasn’t it the foreboding signs of promoting him to become the new Young Sect Master?","Li Moying.... indeed died a good death!","After he died, everything now belonged to him, Li Lingchuan!","...","Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.","Huang Yueli and Li Moying had unknowingly stayed for ten over days in the central region.","Their cultivations had risen significantly in such a short span of time and Huang Yueli was already at fifth stage realm fifth level whereas Li Moying.... had reached seventh stage realm ninth level! He was just one step away from the eighth stage realm.","But Li Moying’s Profound Energy kept on increasing right until he reached seventh stage realm peak and then suddenly stopped right there.","In order to aid Li Moying breakthrough, the two of them increased their speed of massacring the magical beasts and they practically spent all their time searching for magical beasts daily. As long as they met with one, they would kill it and absolutely not let it slip away.","But not knowing why, no matter how many magical beasts they killed, Li Moying’s cultivation just wouldn’t increase.","Eighth stage realm’s doorstep was right in front of him but no matter how he tried, he wasn’t able to step over it.","“Heavens, why is it like this? You really don’t get any feeling that you’re about to advance?” Huang Yueli was despondent as she blinked her large eyes while staring at Li Moying.","Li Moying shook his head at her while feeling funny, “Nope, really no signs of advancement at all.... but why is it that you’re even more impatient than me?”","Huang Yueli heard that and rolled her eyes at him, “I’m worried about you! Forget it if you don’t feel grateful at all!”","“Don’t... I appreciate it, why won’t it?” Li Moying hurriedly pulled her from behind, pulling her into his embrace as he said in a deep voice, “But there’s no other way out even if I’m feeling anxious. There is definitely something which we hadn’t thought of. Perhaps the promotion of the cultivation of this refinement is limited.”","Huang Yueli frowned, “How could this be possible! According to Sage Wu Ding’s manuscript, when he shut himself into close door cultivation, his cultivation was already at ninth stage realm peak! Even so, he was still able to find a chance for breakthrough in the refinement grounds. Whereas for you, you’re not even at eighth stage realm yet, so how could you possibly meet with a restriction?”","Li Moying replied, “What you said seems reasonable...”","“What do you mean by seems? It’s very reasonable alright!” Huang Yueli bit her lips as she frowned and thought for a moment. Suddenly her eyes lit up, “Right, now I remember. Recently we had been searching on the outer boundary for magical beasts and had not stepped into the core region... you definitely need to penetrate deep inwards before you’d get the chance to breakthrough!”","She turned back and grabbed Li Moying’s lapel as she cried out excitedly, “What are you still waiting for? Let’s change our direction!”"]},{"number":1536,"title":"Chapter 1536 - Heading In Deeper (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli had always been action packed and the minute she finished her words, she prepared to set off immediately.","Whoever knew that the man behind her didn’t move an inch as his muscular and powerful arm was locked tightly on her waist, not allowing her to leave.","Huang Yueli turned back her head in astonishment and saw Li Moying gazing deeply at her.","“You.... what’s wrong with you?”","Li Moying opened his mouth calmly, “The magical beasts are already seventh tier and if we head deeper in any further, the magical beasts’ tier would definitely be much higher. It’s too dangerous!”","Huang Yueli quipped curiously, “That’s of course! Exactly because those magical beasts tiers are much higher which is why they will be able to give you more Profound Energy! Although it’s dangerous but in order to boost your ability, it’s worth it to take this risk. You aren’t someone who is afraid of the slightest thing usually, why.....”","Her words came out halfway and she suddenly understood what was going on.","“You... actually you knew long ago that you need to head in deeper into the refinement grounds before you can advance right? Is it because my ability is too weak hence I’m dragging you down so you’re not willing to enter?”","When Li Moying heard these words, his sharp brows creased together as the arm which locked onto her grew tighter as he lowered his head unpleasantly while blowing air into her ear.","“Since when have you dragged me down? If it wasn’t for you, I’d had been heavily injured on several occasions when I accidentally trodden into the mechanisms which the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s seniors set up!”","“But...”","“But what? Hmm?”","Li Moying suddenly leaned in close to her face as his scorching warm breath blasted against her delicate face.","Huang Yueli suddenly saw the magnified face in front of her and her face let her down and flushed a shade of red.","Her large eyes blinked, “You...”","Li Moying gave a light laugh, “Be obedient, Li’er, you have to trust me.”","Saying that he closed his eyes slightly as he leaned in closer to Huang Yueli.","Just as their lips were about to stick to each other, Huang Yueli suddenly regained his senses as she shoved his face to one side.","“You, you, you.... stop thinking of using the handsome male scheme! I’m telling you, I... I won’t fall for it!” Huang Yueli raised her chin as she cried out unconvincingly.","Heaven knew that she almost got hooked earlier, forgetting the important matter!","This man was simply too scheming!","She bit her lip and emphasized, “You’re acting like that because I’ve said out your inner thoughts so you’re trying to divert the topic eh? No way, you can’t go on like this! The magical beasts on the outer region area already almost all killed by us so you can’t continue wasting time like this!”","Li Moying was seen through by her as he could only helplessly shook his head, “Then what do you want to do? I know your potential far surpasses an ordinary fifth stage realm practitioner and you are even able to fight with a seventh tiered magical beast! But there’s a what-if for everything. What if something happened to you, have you considered how worried I am?”","His vision filled with condemnation fell onto Huang Yueli.","Huang Yueli started feeling a sense of guilt from his gaze.","But after a moment later, she suddenly recalled something as she said, “Even if you’re worried about me, we still need to enter the refinement grounds inner region! If we continue staying in the outer region, your ability will not be able to ascend then how will we leave this ghastly place? So evidently, in order to pass through the refinement successfully, you must go into the inner region of the refinement grounds eventually! There’s no meaning in dragging on time like now!”","Li Moying uncontrollably frowned.","Of course he knew that what Huang Yueli said was right.","But the problem now was, Huang Yueli’s weaker cultivation wasn’t the only problem, she was also a practitioner from the Sacred Phoenix Race!"]},{"number":1537,"title":"Chapter 1537 - Heading In Deeper (3)","paragraphs":["As a member of the family feud clan of Cloudy Qilin Clan, Huang Yueli’s suppression of her ability in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region would probably only allow her to display around seventy percent of her total battle power.","In such a dangerous place like the valley, her cultivation was also one of the weaker one, even if she tried her utmost best, she might not be able to guarantee her own safety, moreover when her battle power had been suppressed?","Furthermore, he was worried that if this refinement grounds repelled people from the Sacred Phoenix Race, would Huang Yueli be hurt because of this?","In this way, how could Li Moying possibly rest his mind and go ahead with his experience learning?","As a man who loved his wife more than his own life, Li Moying felt that his own ability’s advancement as compared to his fiancée’s safety, it really wasn’t important at all.","Huang Yueli looked at his expression and knew what he was thinking of.","Her mind turned quickly and a light bulb lit up as she suddenly cried out, “I’ve got it! How about this, leave your little Qilin to me! It is a genuine thunder attributed spiritual beast so although it’s still young, but the spiritual beast awe coming from it is still there. It should have some deterrent force against those thunder attributed high tiered magical beasts.”","Li Moying’s eyes lit up, “You’re right, how come I didn’t think of it?”","“Perhaps it’s because... you haven’t contracted a magical beast for a very long time.....”","Li moying smiled, “I’ll let it out right now. But it’s age is still very tender and still in an infancy stage so its ability is limited so don’t you bully it!”","Huang Yueli’s lips pursed in unhappiness as she gave him a stare upon hearing his words.","“What do you mean by that? Since when had I ever bullied it? I’ve always been the gentle, lovable and amiable Mistress, alright?”","Li Moying shook his head wordlessly as he recalled the last time of little Qilin’s terrible state when it was molested by her throughout its entire body, as he couldn’t help but shed a sympathy tear for this little thing.","But, no matter how pitiful this little thing was, the Mistress of the house had her own commands so as the number one future wife-chitis, he could only betray it to please his fiancée.","Very soon, little Qilin was summoned out.","It’s character was lively and sticky so when it saw Li Moying , it immediately pounced over and leaned towards his neck as it kept rubbing against him!","It really really liked this handsome and suave Master! It felt that he was more handsome than the previous old man Master by one to ten thousand times!","Li Moying was rubbing the little thing’s spine, apparently adoring it very much, totally not sensing that he had been taken advantage of by an immature spiritual beast.","The man and beast were acting intimately when little Qilin suddenly felt a chill running down its spine. Following that, it sensed someone lifting it up and brought to an embrace.","“Aiyo, exactly this little thing! It seemed to have grown slightly larger a little than the last time we saw it. Its Profound Energy fluctuations also seemed to have grown stronger.... Come, let Sister check if you’re grown fatter?”","Huang Yueli’s sneaky hand stretched out towards little Qilin’s tummy as she pressed on it to rub it!","Little Qilin was almost about to cry out! Mamamiya, really so hateful, so horrifying, it was actually ravaged by a little Lolita from the Sacred Phoenix Race!","What was most scary of it all was that its Master had no intention of saving it.","“Not bad, this little thing indeed has a powerful kind of presence. Even though it hasn’t grown up fully, but ancient spiritual beasts indeed live up to their name!” Li Moying continued speaking, “Later when we enter the inner region of the refinement grounds, you definitely have to bring this little thing along. Ordinary magical beasts would not dare to approach you!”"]},{"number":1538,"title":"Chapter 1538 - Heading In Deeper (4)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli nodded her head obediently, expression that she would listen to him.","Li Moying then let her go as he held her little hand and headed towards the inner region of the refinement grounds.","...","A month later.","The duo had already headed several miles towards the core region of the refinement grounds.","As what they had initially expected, every time they advanced towards the core region, the power of the magical beasts which they met would increase in strength!","This power was strong and not only was it expressed in the grade and Profound Energy, it was also reflected on the magical beasts’ attack power, defence and speed.","Luckily, Huang Yueli had little Qilin in her arms and it had an intimidating effect on most magical beasts. A large portion of the magical beast, when they caught a whiff of little Qilin’s presence, they would automatically stop far away or even turn around and ran off. A few of them even prowled down far away, showing their respect to little Qilin.","But Li Moying entering the refinement grounds inner region was to increase his ability so this scene wasn’t something which he wanted to see.","Hence he could only pull a distance away from Huang Yueli as he charged into the depths of the valley.","Huang Yueli carried little Qilin as she set off on a steady pace following behind him while occasionally striking out those star struck magical beasts, absorbing the Profound Energy from their body or stopping to collect those ores or medicinal herbs along the roadside casually.","Seeing its own Master walking further and further away, as though he was about to disappear into the wilderness, little Qilin was extremely anxious!","“Aw aw aw aw—!!”","Help! Master you can’t abandon me like this!! Couldn’t you see this fiendish female demon about to deal a heavy move on your baby here??","Little Qilin tried its best to wave its little claws, trying to struggle free from Huang Yueli’s arms, as it didn’t mind exhausting all of its Profound Energy, as the pressurizing aura it gave out became stronger and stronger.","Under this pressure, not one magical beast could be seen around several miles near Huang Yueli!","However, Huang Yueli herself didn’t lay down limp on the ground like what little Qilin hoped. In fact the hand which carried little Qilin didn’t even show any signs of shaking.","She caressed little Qilin’s scales as her eyes turned into crescent moon shape as she smiled sweetly, “Wa, Fa Cai, your ability is becoming strong and stronger! My Wang Cai is much bigger than you but in terms of the same attribute magical beast aura, it totally cannot be compared to you! You indeed have great innate talent! Quickly let Sister give you a kiss!”","Little Qilin, “Aw...?” Who was Wang Cai?","Just as it was in a daze, Huang Yueli had already lifted it up, towards her face.","Little Qilin finally reacted as it tried its best to struggle but it was still forcefully kissed by the Sacred Phoenix Race’s female demon.","“Aw aw aw.....” Little Qilin was inconsolable with grief and indignation!","Why didn’t it’s Master care about it? Why did he leave it in the hands of the female demon?","What was most infuriating was that this female demon’s soul trace was so powerful that she actually wasn’t affected by it’s pressurizing aura? She was obviously only in the fifth stage realm?","Little Qilin was still young hence it wasn’t able to deduce that Huang Yueli’s innate talent.... was also god grade! She was also one of the top super geniuses in Sacred Phoenix Race!","Spiritual beasts’ infants mostly had powerful innate talents but the abilities were very ordinary. They mainly relied on their innate bloodline to intimidate other magical beasts and people.","But when they met with god grade geniuses in terms of bloodline, they could only tuck their tails between their legs and wait to be contracted.","Hence when Little Phoenix Wang Cai saw Li Moying, it acted like it was a mouse meeting a cat. Hence little Qilin’s bitter experience wasn’t just a chance event....."]},{"number":1539,"title":"Chapter 1539 - Heading In Deeper (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli had been teasing little Qilin as she slowly walked towards the deep end of the valley.","The further she walked, the more careful she became.","Because little Qilin was still in its infancy stage so although it had a natural born awe, but it didn’t have the corresponding ability.","Magical beasts grades which were slightly lower were easily scared off by it but magical beasts in eighth or ninth grades weren’t that easy to deal with.","Especially for ninth grade magical beasts, some of them had an instinct in their bones to want to challenge the spiritual beasts. On seeing little Qilin, they might not even ride or hide. On the contrary, they might just rush up for a challenge!","On their way, there were many high grade magical beasts carcasses. Initially it was all seventh grade but as they continued to walk, eighth grade magical beasts carcass started to appear and further up, there were even a few ninth grade magical beasts with zero stars.","Some bluish purple light balls were still floating on top of these carcasses, apparently left behind by Li Moying for her.","Huang Yueli’s lips rose as she stretched out her hand and waved, while immodestly taking it all in.","After all, she was a ninth grade talent in thunder attribute hence when thunder attributed Profound Energy entered her body, it made the Profound Energy within her median expanded by a large chunk in an instance, as her body was filled with abundant Profound Energy, almost seeping out!","As there was too much Profound Energy and it was too pure, when it entered her dantian, it seemed like a hot knife through butter as it easily charged through the advancement channel.","Huang Yueli immediately sat down and worked up her cultivation method.","Not long after, she broke through the fifth stage realm sixth level checkpoint.","She opened her eyes and looked upwards, as she thought little Qilin would have taken the opportunity while she wasn’t noticing and had escaped as it worked its short legs, trying its very best to seek its Master to save it. In the end, the truth was that little thing sprawled on the ground totally not moving as its body was shrouded with a bluish purple dim light.","Apparently the energy in the light balls could be absorbed by little Qilin as well.","But this little thing was a tat too greedy as it forgot to take into consideration that it was still very young and unable to absorb so much energy at one go, which would cause indigestion!","Hence it was giving off this intoxicated look.","Huang Yueli grabbed the soft scale on the back of its neck as she lifted it up.","“This is the result of eating on the sly, understand? Quickly say a hundred times that this Sister is the most beautiful and most adorable then I’ll help you absorb off the excess Profound Energy.”","Little Qilin lifted up its eyelids as it looked at her in indignation, “Aw.....”","Profiteering while it was down, how utterly shameless!","Huang Yueli’s brows rose and was just about to continue teasing this little thing.","Suddenly an earth shattering explosion was heard not too far away and the ground kept on shaking. Huang Yueli missed a step and almost fell flat on her face as she swayed around.","She finally managed to steady herself as she raised her head up and saw bolts after bolts of lightning in the sky, striking downwards continuously!","The surrounding thunder attributed Profound Energy seemed to be led by an invisible big hand, as it flowed towards the valley’s deepest end!","Huang Yueli’s expression changed, “No good, could Li Moying have met with trouble?”","She picked up little Qilin with one hand and ran towards the inner region of the refinement grounds!","She ran on for quite a while before she found herself in the center position of the valley.","Li Moying had already killed off a large portion of the magical beasts in the refinement grounds in the inner region within a short span of one month and directly threaded into the deepest core region of the entire territory.","On her way running over, there were very few magical beasts carcasses. There were a total of slightly over ten carcases and every single one gave off a shockingly powerful aura!"]},{"number":1540,"title":"Chapter 1540 - Heading In Deeper (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The nearer the core, the stronger the magical beasts’ ability!","Without any exception, all of these were the existing leaders among the ninth grade magical beasts!","Furthermore, from the injuries on these magical beasts, it looked different from those low grade magical beasts, all of them which died under one blow or within a few blows.","But the injuries on these carcases were extremely heterogeneous as the slashes were all disorderly.","It was easy to tell that they had gone through a tough battle before they laid down in extreme irreconciliation under Li Moying’s sword.","Huang Yueli knew that the further she delved in, the more dangerous it would get so every single step she took was with utmost prudence as she surveyed the surrounding situation.","After walking in for a distance, she finally met Li Moying.","That man was dressed in a black coloured long robe and he was shrouded by electricity currents. Behind him was a pair of huge thunder wings as it stretched outwards, causing his body to float in mid-air and his speed increased by a huge margin!","Right now, he was facing three ninth grade magical beasts!","Ninth grade magical beasts’ battle power far surpasses ninth stage realm practitioners and even for Murong De that kind of long established top expert, wanting to kill a ninth grade magical beast was an extremely tough mission to undertake.","Whereas right now, Li Moying was facing a total of three such magical beasts!","When Huang Yueli saw this, her expression turned grave.","She could sense the Profound Energy fluctuations from Li Moying and it was still in seventh stage realm peak condition but the Profound Energy in him was filled to an incredulous stage, ready to charge to an even higher realm anytime!","But Li Moying seemed to be seeking a perfect breakthrough hence he had been suppressing his Profound Energy.","Huang Yueli’s scope was high and that was naturally understandable. Li Moying wanted to use the difficult battles to purify his own Profound Energy to be even purer so that when he advanced, it would make his foundation even more secure, hence making up for the impact of his speedy advancement during this period.","But in this way, his situation was even more precarious.","Seventh stage realm peak, against three ninth grade magical beasts.","Even for Huang Yueli who deeply understood his ability and potential broke out in cold sweat for him.","The battle was extremely intense and Li Moying was facing magical beasts’ group attack which had far surpassed his own. It could be described as him being surrounded by perils and he sustained several serious injuries. Not only was his body filled with ghastly injuries, there was once when he was even struck flying off while throwing up blood!","Seeing that handsome looking face turning paler by the minute, Huang Yueli’s heart wrenched into a bundle.","If possible, she would love to rush up immediately, rendering aid to Li Moying. Even if her ability couldn’t match up to his, or she might even face the danger of being killed by those magical beasts, she would not hesitate to do so!","But right now, she could not go over.","Because Li Moying’s motive was refinement and for him to breakthrough, the chance would only appear in a life and death situation hence he took the risks out of desperation, risking all he had to challenge magical beasts whose abilities were far stronger than his own!","She could not spoil this man’s plan.","Furthermore, she and Li Moying had gone through many experience learning before and those years of experience told her that this man had never left her disappointed. Every single time, he was able to win himself while obtaining achievements and breakthroughs which ordinary people could hardly imagine!","As what she hoped, even after Li Moying had been forced to retreat several times by the magical beasts, but there wasn’t a single time when he had turned weak or given up hope. However it spiked his determination as there was an inexhaustible supply of the Profound Energy in him as it flooded out!"]},{"number":1541,"title":"Chapter 1541 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (1)","paragraphs":["Moreover, the electric currents surrounding him had slowly turned from bluish purple into a pure purple colour. It was extremely eye catching and extremely dazzling.","The speed of his moves were extremely fast as the hand which gripped his sword became even stable.","Eventually, after sustaining the bitter battle for several hours, Li Moying successfully killed those three magical beasts to obtain the final victory.","He gave a long huff as he felt the Profound Energy within his body was almost depleted and his body was about to collapse.","Just as he felt totally drained of energy, he suddenly heard a shrill coming from his back not too far away.","“Moying, Moying, are you alright? Are you hurt anywhere?”","The familiar sweet voice was filled with worry.","Li Moying turned back in a hurry and saw a petite young lady speeding towards him as she pounced into his arms!","He originally didn’t have much energy left and after being pounced on by her, he fell back totally the two of them fell onto the ground.","“Hay—!”","Huang Yueli fell onto his chest and her face was totally embarrassed as she pushed his chest and tried to get up.","Whoever knew, this push coincidentally hurt his wound making him suck in deeply as his face contorted in pain.","Huang Yueli immediately got tensed, “There are so many wounds on you and it’s all so deep! Earlier you threw up blood as well, are you internally injured as well? Quickly take the medicinal pills, I’ll bandage up your wounds!”","She hastily retrieved the ceramic bottles as she poured out the medicinal pills, stuffing it into his mouth in handfuls.","After that she took out the ointment for external injuries and treated his wounds.","Li Moying obediently let her do as she wished as his lips revealed a smile. To be tended to so anxiously by his beloved woman, anyone would feel extremely happy!","Suddenly he sensed a slight pain on his thigh as he hurriedly lowered his head to take a look.","Little Qilin squatted along his thigh as its little claw kept rubbing against his feet, using its gem shaped large eyes brimming with tears as it looked at him in grievance.","On seeing Li Moying noticing it, little Qilin immediately used its claw to point towards Huang Yueli, as though it was complaining about him it had been tortured by her.","Li Moying gave a light laugh as he shook his head and stretched out his hand placing it on top of little Qilin’s head.","Just at that moment, a bright ray of light flashed past both of them and that ray of light was simply too bright, so striking that the two of them weren’t able to open their eyes.","“This... what’s going on?” Huang Yueli covered her eyes.","“I don’t know. Stay close to me a little, be careful!”","Li Moying stretched out his arm to grip her wrist and at the same time, putting on a secured front immediately, prepared to continue battling anytime.","But after the bright light disappeared, the two of them discovered that a stone tablet appeared right in front of them.","This stone tablet was extremely grand and ancient. It was a huge block of rectangle like a tall mountain standing right in front of the two of them, steady and firm.","The entire stone tablet was refined out of an extremely special material. The black stone radiated a bluish purple colour, making it seem even more mysterious and dangerous.","This material was something which even Huang Yueli had not seen before. But she judged that this was a kind of higher tier thunder attributed material where it’s tier was even higher than ninth grade.","The two of them exchanged an astonished glance.","Li Moying frowned slightly as he sized up this piece of stone tablet, “What is this thing? Why did it suddenly appear out of nowhere?”"]},{"number":1542,"title":"Chapter 1542 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was also observing the stone tablet, “The material used to create this stone tablet is simply a perfect thunder attributed material! Have you noticed that every inch of the stone tablet was overflowing with a powerful thunder attributed energy but it had totally been enveloped up without any bit of it being leaked out. I wonder where the Cloudy Qilin Clan found this material from, and if I can just break off a small piece from it.....”","Li Moying’s brows twitched.","His Li’er was simply an Armament Weapon nut. Every time she saw some material, she would hope to dig it out to hide it.","Huang Yueli went round the stone tablet once and suddenly cried out excitedly.","“Moying, quickly take a look! The other side of the stone tablet has a Qilin totem inscribed on! This should be an important mechanism of the Cloudy Qilin Clan right?”","Li Moying hurriedly chased up to her as he turned to the other side.","An extremely large Qilin totem was inscribed on that entire piece of stone tablet. This Qilin was not only large, but also looked extremely real and lively, perfectly reliving the Qilin vitual image which he and Huang Yueli had seen in Sage Wu Ding’s cave.","Furthermore, from the thunder attributed energy in the stone tablet, this Qilin’s surroundings gave off a powerful energy, as though it was going to jump out from the stone tablet the very next moment, coming to life.","Even little Qilin pounced over excitedly, as though it had seen its relative.","Huang Yueli continued talking, “I’ve once seen this same kind of huge spiritual beast totem in the Sacred Phoenix Race’s inheritance tower but the totem for Sacred Phoenix Race is a Phoenix! Looks like these God Realm large families have the habit of rearing the spiritual beasts and using them as their clan’s symbolic representation!”","Li Moying turned around and asked, “Since you’ve seen a similar totem previously, then do you know what this is used for?”","Huang Yueli started to contemplate as she said a while later, “The last time I entered was the inheritance tower. Could it be that this stone tablet is also used for inheritance? Speaking of this, have you noticed it yet? We’ve already delved deep into the hinterland of the valley so this should be the most central position of the valley! This stone tablet appearing right here definitely had its uses!”","Li Moying muttered softly, “In this case, when I walked over earlier, at the position of the stone tablet, there were three magical beasts prowling here. I originally wanted to lure them away individually to kill them but in the end, all three magical beasts noticed me quickly and all of them came right up together! Looks like this isn’t by chance. Only after defeating these three ninth grade magical beasts would this stone tablet descend at this place!”","When Huang Yueli heard that, she clapped her palms hard.","“That’s right! This stone tablet must be the reward for the refinement!”","“Reward?” Li Moying frowned, “What kind of reward is this? Surely it can’t be like what you said, to knock down this stone tablet and bring it back right!”","Huang Yueli shot him a glance and lifted up her chin with a pampered arrogant look.","“Look at you, you don’t even know all these! Do you even need to ask this kind of question?”","Li Moying looked at him in amusement but without a smile as he replied to her, full of indulgence, “I indeed don’t understand so will Grandmaster Huang please teach me.”","Huang Yueli then replied, “Actually it’s very simple. The last time I saw the totem on the door of the inheritance tower and that time I had no way to open up that door. But later after I injected my own blood into it, filling up all the chinks of the totem entirely, then the door immediately opened up!”","Li Moying went into a blank, “You mean.....”","“My meaning is, the totem should be related to bloodline so you can try smearing your blood on it to try and see what effect it would produce.”"]},{"number":1543,"title":"Chapter 1543 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (3)","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Li Moying’s lips twitched as he revealed an incredulous expression.","“I saw... Li’er, are you serious? Fill all the chinks of the totem with blood?? Are you certain? The last time you saw the Phoenix totem on the door, was it really that huge??”","The huge sized stone tablet was at least twenty meters in height and the Qilin’s totem was extremely huge. If he wanted to use his blood to fill in all the chinks in the sculpture of the Qilin totem, it was an impossible mission. Even if he let off all his blood in his body, he probably wouldn’t be able to even fill up one quarter of it—!","Huang Yueli looked at the stone tablet’s Qilin and then looked at him as her lips curled up slightly, revealing her two tiger fangs.","“That I don’t know! Perhaps the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s blood is especially a lot, and is able to fill the entire Qilin totem full!”","Li Moying pinched her cheek as he scoffed at her, “No matter what I’m your fiancé, how can you bully me like this?”","Huang Yueli blinked, “Since when did I bully you? What I said is the truth! Ancient God Realm clans’ innate talent are all based on invigorating the blood vessels so naturally they valued the clan’s bloodline a lot.. you can try.”","Li Moying knew that although his Li’er was a little arrogantly pampered, but with regards to important matters, she absolutely would not harm him.","Since she made it out so clearly, then she should be somewhat certain of it.","So Li Moying nodded and unhesitatingly walked over to the stone tablet.","His right hand turned and the Amethyst Light Sword appeared in his palm. The sharp blade pierced into his left hand’s wrist and blood immediately gushed out.","Li Moying brought his blood filled hand and pressed it on the Qilin totem.","The blood on his palm slowly seeped into the chinks of the sculpture.","It took only an instance when the stone tablet’s colour changed. Originally it was black with a hint of purple shade and now, the black colour had started to wane away as the purple shade of the entire stone tablet became even obvious. Electric currents flickered occasionally, as though it was going to split open the entire piece of stone tablet, causing an explosion at any point of time!","Li Moying’s blood seeped into the stone tablet and turned into a bluish purple electric current as it swiftly flashed past the Qilin sculpture’s chinks and very soon, it had already flashed past every single chink and returned to its original spot.","When Li Moying saw the stone tablet’s change, his heart lifted up as he wanted to withdraw his hand.","But then he realised that his hand seemed to be stuck to the stone tablet, totally unable to withdraw it at all.","Whereas his blood and Profound Energy in his body kept on pouring out in torrents with no way to stop it. It was as though the stone tablet had a kind of mysterious energy which automatically drew away his Profound Energy and blood.","After a long time, he sensed that the stone tablet’s absorbing ability started to decrease in speed.","He tried to withdraw his hand once again and this time, he succeeded.","“This.... is a little too magnificent!” Huang Yueli walked next to him as they lifted up their heads to look at the stone tablet.","The stone tablet’s colour had once again darkened, resuming back to the mysterious lustre of black with a hint of purple but the lively looking Qilin sculpture had totally been filled with thunder attributed Profound Energy as it turned into an eye piercing bluish purple colour. The thunder attributed energy kept on flowing around, giving off an endless vitality to this totem.","Li Moying turned back to take a look at his fiancée and was just about to speak when suddenly, he felt that he saw black!","Immediately following that, his body disappeared from the original location.","“... Moying, why are you ignoring me?”","Huang Yueli blinked her large eyes and upon turning back, there was no more sight of Li Moying’s whereabouts?"]},{"number":1544,"title":"Chapter 1544 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (4)","paragraphs":["Above the millions and millions of stars, there was a vast sized continent, which was even larger by hundred times and above of Soaring Heavens Continent. The density of the Heaven and Earth’s Profound Qi was much higher by at least ten times.","This was God Realm, where the lower world’s top exponents desired most to arrive at.","In a cave in God Realm where magic qi enveloped it, two old men were playing chess when one of them suddenly gave off an astonished expression, as the chess piece in his hand dropped on the chess board.","“Old Man Wu Ding, what’s the matter with you? Don’t tell me that you know that you’re going to lose to me so you are intentionally trying to find an excuse to slip away?”","The white haired Sage Wu Ding was so infuriated that he blew his beard and widened his eyes in anger when he heard that.","“Old Man Dong, what nonsense are you sprouting! Am I the kind of person who cannot afford to lose? Since when had I intentionally slipped away on purpose?”","“Really? Then why are you acting so flustered?” The elderly man surnamed Dong had a suspicious look all over his face.","Sage Wu Ding gave him a stare and said, “Old Man Dong, do you still remember? Several hundred thousands of years ago when I was still in Soaring Heavens Continent, I had once been the overall in-charge of the clan’s refinement grounds.”","Old Man Dong replied, “How could I possibly not know? Do you really think my memory is failing because of my age? We were already working together then! That year, Soaring Heavens Continent’s Violet Sun Valley was our Cloudy Qilin Clan’s biggest refinement grounds. So many peerless geniuses fought head over heels just to gain a quota to enter into the Violet Sun Valley!”","“Isn’t that so! When we were young, hadn’t we also undergone refinement in the Violet Sun Valley?” Sage Qu Ding spoke while reminiscing about the past.","Old Man Dong looked at his expression and asked curiously, “What’s the matter? Why have you suddenly recalled the Violet Sun Valley? Ever since the change in Soaring Heavens Continent took effect and the Profound Energy dissipated, all the direct descendant clansmen of Cloudy Qilin Clan had all moved away from Soaring Heavens Continent and Violet Sun Valley had become an abandoned ground. These are matters which had happened several hundred thousands of years ago and you still remember about it!”","Sage Wu Ding shook his head and said, “Actually the Violet Sun Valley isn’t completely abandoned but as the density of the Profound Qi in Soaring Heavens Continent isn’t enough, so there is no way to operate as per normal. After every few thousand years, it would have stored enough energy and would show up.....”","“Even if Violet Sun Valley could show up, so what about it? There are no longer any clansmen from Cloudy Qilin Clan there so it’s impossible to have a peerless genius appearing like several hundred thousands of years ago! As for ordinary practitioners, even if they might have the fate and opportunity, entering it would only mean that they didn’t have a chance to return! It was impossible to get any chance in the Violet Sun Valley, not to mention that they would just end their lives there instead!”","The old man named Dong spoke with a certain tone.","This was because he had lived for a long time because at an age of several hundred thousands years old, what strange things had he not experienced? He naturally would know what kind of situation it was like at that kind of abandoned refinement grounds.","Whoever knew, when Sage Wu Ding heard that, he fiddled with his beard and shook his head while smiling, “Old Man Dong, you’ve guessed it wrongly this time round. I was feeling astonished earlier just because I had suddenly sensed that someone had intruded into Violet Sun Valley.....”","“So what if they had intruded into it, what’s the big deal about it?” Old Man Dong picked up his teacup in a disapproving look.","Sage Wu Ding continued, “Why can’t you hear me finish my sentence? Intruding into Violet Sun Valley isn’t rare, but what if that person successfully activated the Qilin tablet?”","Old Man Dong had already sipped a mouthful of tea and upon hearing that, he directly spat out the mouthful of tea out of his mouth!","His eyes opened up wide with a look of disbelief on his face.","“What did you say?? Someone activated the Qilin tablet in Violet Sun Valley??”"]},{"number":1545,"title":"Chapter 1545 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (5)","paragraphs":["Sage Qu Ding nodded, “That’s right.....”","Old Man Dong went into a blank for a moment before gradually regaining his composure as he leaned back against the chair once again.","“I think it must be your misperception! Soaring Heavens Continent and God Realm’s distance is several thousand miles and furthermore, Violet Sun Valley has been abandoned for such a long time. The sense that you, the Valley Master of Violet Sun Valley might not be accurate... .otherwise, there simply isn’t any way to explain, how such a thing could be possible?”","After Sage Wu Ding had been assigned as Violet Sun Valley’s Valley Master several hundred thousand years ago, he had established a spiritual connection with the valley’s formation and no matter what happened in the valley could not be hidden from him.","When Cloudy Qilin Clan departed from Soaring Heavens Continent, even though that kind of spiritual connection had not been erased, but following the passing of time, the link would become weaker and weaker.","Several hundred thousand years wasn’t considered a short time so now that Sage Wu Ding could no longer sense most of the situation in Violet Sun Valley.","When ordinary Sects activated the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, he just had a hazy sensation.","But this time, Sage Wu Ding appeared to be extremely serious and grave.","“This... shouldn’t be my misperception! You know that the activation of the Qilin tablet, even if it was several hundred thousand years ago, it was a huge matter which could shock the entire clan! Because this means that a god grade genius is born! A genius who would excel in the entire God Realm had appeared! This feeling is extremely intense and very distinct. The feeling of it against ordinary people intruding into the valley is totally different.”","Old Man Dong’s mouth was agape as his tongue was tied, “So.... So you feel that this is real?? There’s really a genius who had activated the Qilin tablet?”","Sage Qu Ding nodded his head vigorously.","“That’s right. Actually some days ago, when this person entered the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s historical remains, I’d already sensed it. He had also activated a cave which I stayed in and even took away the baby Qilin which I had sealed up in the cave. But that time I thought it was a misperception so I didn’t bother about it. Later on I sensed that he had entered into Violet Sun Valley. His ability should be very strong because the Profound Energy fluctuations in the valley were seriously influenced by him! If my feeling wasn’t wrong, around eighty percent of the magical beasts in the valley had all been killed by him! It had merely been just over a month’s time.....”","“Now he had once again successfully entered the core region, passing the test and even letting Qilin tablet appear on this earth once again....”","Hearing Sage Wu Ding’s words, Old Man Dong didn’t know what he should say!","Cloudy Qilin clansmen had all moved to the God Realm and reconstructed a new refinement ground.","The new refinement ground was similar to Violet Sun Valley, with only a minute difference.","For so many years, there were plenty of Cloudy Qilin Clan’s geniuses and they had even become the leading top ten families in God Realm, as there was no lack of strong practitioners in the clan!","However, among so many geniuses, for several hundred thousand years, there were only a handful of people who could activate the Qilin tablet.","In the past ten thousand years, there was none at all!","Old Man Dong’s voice was shaking as he cried out emotionally, “If what you said is true... then... then that would be too shocking, too incredible! The clan had not appeared such a powerful god grade genius in the last hundred thousand years! Yet one actually appeared in Soaring Heavens Continent?? The disciples in God Realm clans are all nurtured under large amounts of resources and in that ghostly place like Soaring Heavens Continent where even Heaven and Earth’s Profound Energy was so scarce, not to mention that the other resources were such a pitiful amount.....”"]},{"number":1546,"title":"Chapter 1546 - Cloudy Qilin Clan’s bloodline (6)","paragraphs":["“If under this kind of situation, there was someone who could pass the various tests in Violet Sun Valley and successfully entering the core region to successfully activate the Qilin tablet... then his innate talent is simply unimaginable! Perhaps he had even surpassed god grade genius’s standard!”","“If.... if all these are true, then wouldn’t our Cloudy Qilin Clan.... Have run into great luck??”","In God Realm, the fights between various powerhouses were intense.","Even though Cloudy Qilin Clan was now the first seat among the top ten families but this was only temporary. Many clans were eyeing them and the minute Cloudy Qilin Clan’s entire ability dropped, they would be replaced by someone else easily.","Whereas the most important factor when deciding on a clan’s ability was the clan’s practitioner’s ability!","Indeed, Cloudy Qilin Clan’s overall ability was very strong and there were plenty of heaven grade geniuses around. After so many years of accumulation, the clans’ elders and guardians in authority, had much stronger abilities than the other clans’ practitioners in the same positions!","But this was not enough. The other clans were not vegetarians and the number of heaven grade geniuses they had in their clans weren’t little as well.","The real deciding factor in the clan’s future, was actually a god grade genius in the clan!","Only one would be born every few ten thousand years, and that was enough to fire up the entire clan!","In the past ten thousand years, there was no heaven grade genius in the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","If Sage Wu Ding’s senses weren’t wrong, in the clan’s branch in the lower realm, a god grade genius was actually born, then it was a serious matter which was worth rejoicing over! It was enough to stir up the entire clan!","Just thinking of this alone, Old Man Dong’s body was so excited that it started to shake.","“With this god grade genius, as long as we can bring him to God Realm and nurture him properly, once he grows up, the position of our Cloudy Qilin Clan in the future ten thousand years in God Realm would be guaranteed! That’s simply great! This matter ought to be reported to the clan leader as soon as possible!”","He got more agitated as he spoke however, Sage Wu Ding didn’t smile because of that.","On the contrary, he suddenly recalled something as the expression on his face turned extremely terrible, even starting to sprout sweat.","“Old Man Dong, don’t be in such a hurry... if there really is such a god grade genius... then he would probably in in huge trouble this time round!”","Old Man Dong went into a blank as he turned back while asking curiously, “What do you mean?”","Sage Wu Ding’s complexion turned paler by the minute, “You don’t know about this. All the mechanisms and array’s operation in Violet Sun Valley required strong Heaven and Earth Profound Qi to support it. But now Soaring Heavens Continent’s Profound Qi isn’t enough to support the entire Violet Sun Valley’s operation as per normal so a portion of the mechanism would be ineffective.....”","Old Man Dong seemed to have recalled something as he revealed a terrified look on his face.","“Su...Surely not right? You mean.....”","“My meaning is the Qilin tablet requires a huge amount of energy to exhaust and moreover, it usually could not be activated for hundred thousand of years so under insufficient Heaven and Earth Profound Qi, the first to become ineffective is the Qilin tablet.....”","“You are saying that the Qilin tablet would become ineffective because of the lack of energy? But hadn’t that genius successfully activated the Qilin tablet earlier?” Old Man Dong evidently don’t believe in his words.","Sage Wu Ding continued, “Qilin tablet would not lose its ability to be activated because of this. But it would lose a portion of its effect...”","“A portion of its effect?” Old Man Dong suddenly had an extremely bad premonition."]},{"number":1547,"title":"Chapter 1547 - Only two paths (1)","paragraphs":["“Right, a portion of its use.....”","Sage Wu Ding took a deep breath as he explained, “You haven’t activated the Qilin tablet before so you’re probably not aware of the situation in the Qilin tablet. Actually, that is another refinement ground but limited only to god grade geniuses to enter! God grade geniuses might face the most terrifying life and and death crisis in there and according to their final performance, they would obtain different kinds of rewards.”","“To the past god grade geniuses, if they failed the refinement, they would obtain the corresponding rewards and be expelled from the Qilin tablet which meant the end of the refinement. But now that a portion of the mechanism became ineffective, then.....”","Sage Qu Ding’s voice was cold as he continued, “If he failed the refinement, whether he would be expelled from the Qilin tablet or not, there would be only two paths in front of him— either he completes the refinement totally and obtain the reward for completing the refinement perfectly, otherwise...”","His voice paused and Old Man Dong’s heart jumped to the back of his throat, “..... Otherwise what?”","“Otherwise, only death awaits!”","Hearing that, Old Man Dong nearly jumped out of his chair, “What? How could there be such a thing? In the past, how many of those god grade geniuses had successfully passed through the Qilin tablet refinement perfectly?”","Sage Wu Ding took a look at him and his voice turned chillier, “In all the historical books which recorded the history of Cloudy Qilin Clan, among those god grade geniuses who activated the Qilin tablet, the highest completion rate in the refinement was only eighty percent. The number of them who had passed through the stage perfectly was – Zero!”","...","In Violet Sun Valley.","After Li Moying injected his blood onto the Qilin tablet’s totem, the Qilin tablet was activated.","He was caught unaware and his eyes saw black as he instantly lost consciousness.","When he finally reopened his eyes again, he found himself in a dark room where he couldn’t even see his fingers in front of him, not to mention that there was no sight of his Li’er.","Li Moying cried out loudly, “Li’er! Li’er? Where are you? If you hear me, make a sound and let me know your position! I wonder where we are right now? Why is this place so pitch dark!”","However, no one replied to him.","Li Moying frowned as he raised his voice once again, “Li’er?! Li’er!!”","But what responded back to him was complete silence.","Li Moying was extremely worried. He wasn’t especially worried if he himself had met with danger but when the matter concerned Huang Yueli, he totally couldn’t calm himself down.","After all, this valley’s inner portion was the core region and it originally was filled with dangers. There were so many ninth tier magical beasts lying in wait and he was worried that Huang Yueli would run into danger and was unable to deal with it.","His right hand drew out a ball of flame as he wanted to use the light to check out the surrounding situation.","Whoever knew the minute the flame lit up, a sharp cold wind came pouncing towards his direction!","Li Moying sensed an intense crisis and his heart jerked violently!","This feeling was exceptionally terrifying and this was the first time Li Moying had felt such a life threatening threat so distinctly!","His experience in facing battles was rich and he reacted swiftly as he immediately evaded towards the opposite direction!","However, the attacker behind him was even faster in reaction. On seeing him switched directions, he immediately followed him like his shadow!","Bolts of lightning kept striking out towards him from the back and Li Moying tried his hardest but was still unable to evade it totally. He was then struck on his right shoulder.","“Ssssss—” He immediately drew in a mouthful of cold air!"]},{"number":1548,"title":"Chapter 1548 - Only two paths (2)","paragraphs":["This bolt of lightning penetrated through his shoulder however no blood poured out.","A sharp pain seemed to radiate out from his bones as it speedily extended to the surroundings from the position of the wound and very quickly, his entire arm started to turn painful.","Li Moying frowned as he realised the severity of the matter.","It wasn’t a good thing when it didn’t bleed. That meant that he was not only hurt in the flesh, even his meridians and bones were impacted heavily so what he was losing wasn’t just blood but.... life source!","Li Moying was feeling mortified, just who was chasing him from behind? How could he be so strong to such an extent?","He rarely met with this kind of situation, totally unable to strike back upon being beaten.","Luckily, Li Moying wasn’t thrown into a disorder as he maintained his shocking calm even in such a situation.","He swiftly congealed the Profound Energy in his body and after a few sudden evasions, he suddenly turned around and casted an attack with the surging thunder attributed energy from his body!","“RAWR—!!!”","An earth-shattering howl rang.","Li Moying stared intently to the front to find a huge Qilin slowly appearing from the darkness.","It’s entire body was shrouded with dazzling crystal like scales and its bluish purple light flowed around its body. The powerful and magnificent aura started emitting out from its body.","The image of this spiritual beast was exactly the same as what he saw on the huge stone tablet.","To the point that when they faced each other, he could distinctly feel that this Qilin had an irresistible pressure on it. This pressure was much stronger by ten times or more than the pressure which radiated from the totem earlier!","Li Moying’s expression was cold as he gripped the Amethyst Light Sword in his arms, paying full attention to prepare for battle!","Evidently, this Qilin was not totally the same as the one which he had met in Sage Wu Ding’s cave.","The one in the cave was obviously just a virtual image and although it had been imitated by the use of secret arts and could revive the traces of the original spiritual beast’s battle method and energy, but it was after all not a real spiritual beast.","So its battle power was merely ninth tier end stage magical beast standard, which was something which Li Moying was still able to deal with.","But the one in front of him was much stronger!","On seeing it at the first instance, Li Moying’s heart shook vigorously as he felt that he was almost not able to take on the overbearing and prestigious pressure!","This heaven defying aura was something which a true matured ancient spiritual beast was capable of.","But.....","Li Moying frowned.","Was this possible? The one who attacked him... was a matured Qilin?","Matured Qilins were the clan’s most important fortune, so how could it possibly have been abandoned here?","Just at this moment, Li Moying suddenly sensed a “buzz” in his mind and felt slightly dizzy. At the same time, a sinisterly cold voice rang in his mind.","“Human...”","Li Moying abruptly lifted up his head.","In the darkness, the Qilin spiritual beast ray seemed especially radiant.","“Young fellow from the Cloudy Qilin Clan, you’re not bad. It had been several hundred thousand years since anything had activated the Qilin tablet.”","Li Moying was first bewildered but he quickly reacted as he hurriedly asked, “You mean to say.... I’m now inside that piece of huge tablet now? That stone tablet is called the Qilin tablet?? What is the situation now? This Qilin tablet or something, what is it for?”"]},{"number":1549,"title":"Chapter 1549 - Only two paths (3)","paragraphs":["“Qilin tablet.... It’s Cloudy Qilin Clan’s ultimate refinement assessment! Only god grade geniuses are able to summon the Qilin tablet out.”","A scratchy sound came from the Qilin’s body.","“God grade genius?” Li Moying’s brows rose in astonishment.","If it was any other person in Soaring Heavens Continent, they probably wouldn’t had any concept on this at all.","But Li Moying had heard about the different grades of geniuses in God Realm from Huang Yueli and knew that the so called god grade geniuses of the clans in God Realm were very different from their understanding in Soaring Heavens Continent. To be acclaimed as god grade in Cloudy Qilin Clan, that would be a peerless genius who called the shots in God Realm!","Even if it were those top rated powerhouses like Cloudy Qilin Clan or Sacred Phoenix Race, there weren’t too many of such people.","Hearing the Qilin saying that he was god grade, Li Moying’s heart was secretly delighted because this was the greatest affirmation towards his ability!","Even if he knew that he had outstanding talent, but hearing this conclusion still made him feel extremely happy.","Qilin said, “God grade geniuses.... Will only appear once every few ten thousand years and the Qilin tablet would only be activated once every ten thousand years. In the recent ten thousands of years, this is the first time it has been activated. Young fellow from Cloudy Qilin Sect, you’re not simply eh.... One fine day when you return to the clan in God Realm, you’d definitely cause a sensation.”","Li Moying went into a blank and replied, “I haven’t considered things which are that far yet. After all, I’m only in the seventh stage realm now. Reaching God Realm.... will at least take ten years or more.”","Qilin’s voice was mixed with some laughter, “Based on your innate talent, you might not need to wait ten years that long.”","Li Moying didn’t bother explaining further.","After all, he wasn’t alone and if he had to ascend alone, then whatever would happen to his Li’er?","Although Huang Yueli had outstanding talent, but she had started cultivating rather late in this lifetime, wasting quite a number of years.","He asked again, “Then, how can I complete the refinement?”","Qilin replied, “Very simple, you only need to kill me and you’d be considered to have passed through the Qilin tablet’s refinement!”","Li Moying’s eyes widened as he asked in disbelief, “What? Kill you??”","He simply could not believe his own ears!","Qilin immediately explained, “I’m a sealed spiritual body in the Qilin tablet and I will not die or be eliminated but I am still able to utilise ninety percent of my ability when I was still alive! Even if you managed to kill me successfully, the Qilin tablet will restore my spiritual body after thousands of years later.”","Li Moying then understood that the Qilin in front of him was actually long dead.","No wonder it had been left behind by the Cloudy Qilin Clan in the Qilin tower, to be used for refinement purposes.","But Li Moying was still shocked because the condition for completing this refinement was simply too ridiculous!","A matured spiritual beast: It had genuine god grade ability! Even if it was a sealed spiritual body, its cultivation was slightly discounted so it definitely was still nearer to tenth stage realm!","Even in his past life’s peak, to deal with this kind of magical beast required him to undergo a tough battle.","Whereas for him now... his potential in this lifetime as compared to the past was a huge gap.","Moreover, killing and defeating.... Was totally two different matters.","Defeating the opponent sometimes required a certain percentage of ability, luck and meticulous observation which would be possible.","But towards this grade of battle, to kill the opponent, it definitely wasn’t based on skill or luck which could be materialised. It was necessary to rely on absolute power.","Generally speaking, only with absolute overwhelming power would one be guaranteed a chance to kill the opponent."]},{"number":1550,"title":"Chapter 1550 - Only two paths (4)","paragraphs":["Now Li Moying’s cultivation was at the weaker end and he had to kill a spiritual beast?","This was really an impossible mission!","Qilin immediately said, “Once the refinement has started, I will not stop it in the middle. But If you feel that you are not able to continue, you can request for the refinement to end! But in this way, it is impossible for you to enter the Qilin tablet again, do you understand?”","Li Moying had already calmed himself down and his gaze was even more profound than usual.","“I understand.”","Qilin swept him a glance and said, “As you’re the only practitioner who had successfully activated the Qilin tablet in the past several hundred thousands of years, I shall break the exception to give you a reminder. During the refinement, the injuries that I caused upon you are real, and that is to say that.... there is a possibility that you may die! I hope you must remember this point and if you can’t continue, ask to leave by yourself. In the past there were quite a number of god grade geniuses who obviously couldn’t pass the refinement but still hung on tightly. In the end they met with their demise right here.... This was a huge loss to the entire clan.”","This time round Li Moying remained silent for a very long time.","He had not expected that this Qilin seemed to know how to read one’s mind as it saw through what he was thinking about at one glance.","Peerless geniuses usually never met much opponents who were able to defeat them so even if they met someone who was much stronger than him, he would not easily admit defeat! He... naturally wasn’t an exception!","Since he had entered the refinement, then he would definitely try his best till the last drop of blood in him, not wanting to give up any chance of passing the stage, disregarding his own life and death.","If it wasn’t for Qilin which reminded him, he would definitely have done so.","But now hearing what Qilin said, his first reaction was to think of Huang Yueli immediately.","His Li’er was still waiting for him outside the Qilin tablet!","If he wasn’t able to leave this place, based on Huang Yueli’s ability even if she was that intelligent, there was still some difficulty for her to leave this valley safely. Furthermore the two of them had finally understood each other’s feelings and if he were to just die like that..... Li’er would definitely die of sadness?","He was already a family man so he could no longer be like how he was in the past.","Thinking of this, he nodded, “I know. Thank you Senior for the pointer! But this junior still has something to ask.....”","“What is it?”","Li Moying said, “This junior would like to ask an impromptus question. How many of those god grade geniuses in this Qilin tablet had managed to pass through the refinement successfully?”","Qilin replied coldly, “None at all!”","“None.... At all?” Li Moying went into a blank, “But weren’t those practitioners who entered the ultimate refinement all god grade geniuses?”","“That’s right, what do you think that the ultimate refinement was? Did you think that spiritual beast’s ability is just what you see on the surface? God grade innate talent is only a temporary expedient to enter this place. So the ultimate refinement isn’t some embarrassing matter. Alright, are you done with the nonsense? Then... the refinement shall officially begin!”","When Li Moying heard that, his entire body shook as his right hand gripped the Amethyst Light Sword tightly and the purple electric currents on the sword blade had already flown up to the skies!","At the same time, the Qilin spiritual beast’s figure also turned into a bolt of purple light, pouncing towards him speedily!","...","God Realm.","Cloudy Qilin Clan.","Old Man Dong stared at Sage Wu Ding in shock, “What? Don’t tell me that in the past, no one had been able to pass through the Qilin tablet refinement perfectly?”"]},{"number":1551,"title":"Chapter 1551 - Only two paths (5)","paragraphs":["“That’s impossible, right? No matter what, to be able to activate the Qilin tablet, those people are all god grade geniuses! In our history, Cloudy Qilin Clan also had geniuses who had innate talents above god grades, don’t tell me that even they.... were unable to pass through the stage successfully? I don’t believe such a thing!”","Sage Wu Ding said, “What’s so strange about that? That year, old Clan Leader joined hands with God Realm’s top ten Armament Master before they were able to refine this piece of Qilin tablet successfully, and even subdued the spiritual beast which had just died in a battle sealing it into that tablet! To you and me who had been cultivating for several ten thousands of years, wanting to kill a matured Qilin also wasn’t an easy matter. Whereas for those geniuses who entered Violet Sun Valley, their ages cannot be over thirty!”","“Try to recall when we were thirty years old, what kind of potential did we had? Don’t talk about killing a Qilin, probably just a breath from the Qilin would result in us incurring a serious injury and throwing up blood! If these god grade geniuses were at least able to deal with the Qilin for a while or even seriously injuring the Qilin, it would already be an extraordinary ability!","Old Man Dong answered, “What you said isn’t wrong. But... But haven’t you said this earlier yourself? This time, the Qilin tablet had not absorbed enough Heaven and Earth Profound Energy and if the genius who had entered wasn’t able to pass through the stage successfully, then death would await him! Now you say that no one had ever passed through this refinement, doesn’t it mean that.... the lower realm’s branch had finally appeared a god grade genius but he’s going to fall right there?”","Sage Wu Ding was worried about this matter and hearing that, his forehead creased even tighter.","“Isn’t that so? The clan hadn’t had such a genius like this in a long time! What’s more that person appeared from the lower realm! Under such scarce resources and still able to have such achievement, his future is limitless and if he really died there, it would be such a waste! But.... but he’s already entered the Qilin tablet so we already have no chance to stop him!”","Old Man Dong said, “Then what should we do? No way, we must report this matter to the Clan Leader! Every god grade genius is the hope for the clan’s future so we cannot allow him to fall like that! Perhaps the Clan Leader has a way!”","“Yes, you’re right! Let’s go now! Let’s hope that the young fellow who had entered the Qilin tablet could last a little while longer, otherwise.... there’s really no one who can save him!”","Sage Wu Ding seemed as though he suddenly attained enlightenment as he patted his thigh hard and stood up from his seat.","The two elderly men got up swiftly and headed towards the Clan Leader’s cave dwelling.","However the two of them had just reached the cave entrance when they were stopped.","“Sage Wu Ding, Sage Dong, please hold on!” A fierce looking fatty blocked the duo’s path as he gave a smile which didn’t reach his eyes.","Sage Wu Ding’s expression sank immediately, “Steward You, what are you trying to do?”","Steward You sneered, “I’m the one who should be asking you what you want to do? Haven’t you heard at all? Clan Leader has entered closed door cultivation in the cave, preparing to break through to the Life Realm! This is the most important matter in the entire clan, even the few Grand Elders don’t dare to come disturb him yet you two just want to rush in like that? Whoever gave you the guts?”","Sage Wu Ding’s expression was extremely ugly.","This Steward You was the Clan Leader’s cave dwelling’s housekeeper, responsible for Clan Leader’s personal matters.","Although his cultivation wasn’t high and his position in the clan wasn’t considered high, but he used the fact that he was reporting to Clan Leader directly to show off a proud and arrogant look.","Usually, other than the clan’s Elders who held the most power, the other people who wanted to meet the Clan Leader had to undergo all kinds of obstacles by Steward You."]},{"number":1552,"title":"Chapter 1552 - Only two paths (6)","paragraphs":["If they didn’t come out with something to bribe him, then they definitely would not get past this stage.","If it was usual times, although Sage Wu Ding didn’t like Steward You but he would still patiently deal with him.","But this matter today was simply too urgent!","This lower realm genius had already entered the Qilin tablet!","They didn’t know what level was his ability right now? If it was slightly off, probably within a quarter of an hour, he would be beaten to a half dead condition by the Qilin but yet still unable to stop the ultimate refinement.....","And this time along was enough to turn him into a fresh new corpse!","Whereas from what Sage Wu Ding saw, lower realm practitioners who were able to reach god grade innate talent was already an unimaginable miracle. Then among the god grade geniuses, he should be of a lower standard so one he entered the Qilin tablet, he would definitely not be able to hold on!","He would probably be finished within a few breaths of time.","Of course, now that Sage Wu Ding hadn’t sensed any news regarding the lower realm genius’s death, but that didn’t represent that he had time to waste on that Fatty You!","Perhaps at the very next moment, that genius would not be able to hold on any longer!","This was absolutely a crucial timing to catch hold of!","Sage Wu Ding clenched his teeth as he retrieved a verdant dark green gemstone from his realm ring. That piece of stone was connected at the head and tail and was sculpted into two interconnecting toroidal.","He passed the gemstone to Fatty You and lowered his voice as he whispered, “Steward You, this is a little appreciation from me. Will you please do us a favour, we really have a very important matter and need to meet with the Clan Leader!”","Fatty You saw his performance and was first slightly astonished but immediately following that, he gave off a sinister smile.","He was good in knowing what’s what and the toroidal stone which Sage Wu Ding brought out was priceless!","That was a priceless and rare Profound Artifact which could raise one’s cultivation speed.","It was rare to see Sage Wu Ding so cooperative, looked like... he really had an urgent matter to deal with today. This was a great chance to sweep in a fortune!","Fatty You immediately said, “Sage Wu Ding, what are you trying to do? Trying to bribe me? Take it back, take it back! What sort of man do you think I, You Da Zhuang is? I’ve told you several times that it’s not that I don’t wish to inform, but Clan Leader is really in closed door cultivation! If we were to disturb Clan Leader now, if he is just about to break through to the Life Realm and the chance is spoiled by us, who will take up the responsibility for this?”","He shook his head and although his mouth was saying “take it back”, but the fingers on his right hand gripped onto the toroidal stone, totally not wanting to let go.","Sage Wu Ding got anxious, “Steward You, please do us a favour! In future, I will think of ways to repay you so will you please help us pass the message!”","However, Fatty You had already set his mind on being pretentious, totally ignoring how anxious he was.","On the contrary, the more Sage Wu Ding was, the happier he got!","This meant that... this big fish was hooked!","The two of them were in a deadlock hence Sage Wu Ding got more and more frustrated as close to an hour had passed! That genius in the lower realm..... wouldn’t die immediately right?","No Way! This was Cloudy Qilin Clan’s hope for the next several hundred thousand of years!","He finally couldn’t tolerate it any further as he hollered, “You Da Zhuang! I really have a very important matter and today you’re blocking the entrance holding up the major event! In future when the Clan Leader were to put the blame, you totally are not able to take it up because killing you is not even enough to pay for it! Don’t blame me for not reminding you! Still not going to hurry and move aside?”"]},{"number":1553,"title":"Chapter 1553 - Only two paths (7)","paragraphs":["Sage Dong also hurried over to speak in support.","“What Brother Wu Ding said is correct. Steward You, we really have an extremely important matter, one which concerns the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan’s future! We really can’t delay this any further!”","When You Da Zhuang heard that, he somehow felt that something was amiss as he questioned them with a face filled with suspicions, “What matter do you really have?”","Sage Wu Ding was going to die of anger but he knew that if he didn’t manage to dismiss this fatty, he would definitely not be able to see clan leader.","He could only force down his attitude and, using the fastest speed he could, to briefly explain the entire matter.","In the end, before he could finish his story, You Da Zhuang couldn’t help but burst out into laughter.","“HAHAHAHA, really laugh die me! What did you say earlier? There’s a god grade genius in the lower realm which has extremely scarce Heaven and Earth Profound Qi? Sage Wu Ding, I think you must be getting on in age that you’ve even developed hallucination! How could this be possible?”","Sage Wu Ding was both angry and anxious as he emphasized, “This is not my hallucination, it’s real! I was once the valley master for Violet Sun Valley and I had been sensing whatever happened in the valley!”","You Da Zhuang didn’t think much of it as he continued laughing, “So what about that? How many years has Violet Sun Valley been abandoned for? Moreover Soaring Heavens Continents and God Realm is so far away so how could you still accurately sense it? I think this must really be a kind of illusion! Don’t you even consider just how much resources we had been spending in God Realm, filtering out the clans’ geniuses layer by layer and we are only able to come out with a god grade genius in several hundred thousand years! That lower realm practitioner hadn’t even sensed much Heaven and Earth Profound Qi so just how good of an innate talent did he have before he could become a god grade genius?”","“If there’s really such a person, then even if it was in God Realm, he would really be a peerless genius who was second to none!”","Sage Wu Ding hurriedly said, “Isn’t that do? If there really is such a person, then Cloudy Qilin Clan’s position for the next hundred thousand years would be secured. We cannot let him gall in the Qilin tablet! So that’s why I’m here to report to the clan leader! Steward You, have you understood everything? Quickly help us.....”","“Help?” You Da Zhuang stopped smiling as his expression sunk, “What’s wrong with you? Just because of you two old man’s absurd hallucinations, I have to go report to the clan leader saying that the god grade genius on that god-forsaken Soaring Heavens Continent is going to die soon? Who will believe this sort of nonsense? Do you really treat me like an idiot?”","“You.....” Sage Wu Ding was so infuriated that he almost couldn’t breathe!","You Da Zhuang scoffed, “Anyway, clan leader’s closed door cultivation absolutely cannot be interrupted, especially not by this kind of senseless joke! Both Sages please kindly return, send the guests off!”","Saying that, he waved his hand to dispatch two servant boys to dismiss them and he shut the door to the clan leader’s cave dwelling.","“Wait!”","The two Sages wanted to chase up to him but were stopped by the guards.","Based on both their abilities, defeating these guards was as easy as lifting a finger but even if they did chase away these guards, the clan leader’s residence was surrounded by various mechanisms and there were genuine top exponents watching over so it absolutely wasn’t a place where they could just run freely without any restraint.","The two of them exchanged glances and sat on the ground in disappointment.","“Finished! We’re all finished this time! This lower realm genius is a goner! I’m really afraid that I would sense the news of his death at the very next minute!” Sage Wu Ding put on a miserable look.","Sage Dong however had an astonished look, “What? He actually managed to last till now and is still hanging on? From the time that you sensed him entering the Qilin tablet until now, it’s already been more than two hours isn’t it! He could actually persist that long a time in front of the spiritual beast Qilin??”"]},{"number":1554,"title":"Chapter 1554 - Find a way out of an impasse (1)","paragraphs":["Hearing that, Sage Qu Ding was also stunned.","“If you didn’t mention it, I actually didn’t notice it at all... that’s right, it’s already well over two hours and this lower realm genius is actually.... still alright??”","He jumped up right from the ground, “No way, I can’t just let it go like that! He actually managed to stay in the Qilin tablet for such a long time. Even if Violet Sun Valley hadn’t been abandoned then, no one had ever managed to do it! If this kind of genius really died... ai, that’s a huge loss to our clan!”","The two of them hurriedly looked for others to help. Other than the clan leader, they also visited several Grand Elders.","A large portion of them had the same reaction as You Da Zhuang, totally not believing their words, feeling that the genius in their words were just too ridiculous and absolutely not possible for such a person to exist.","Only a small portion of people were sceptical.","“This.... it’s not that I don’t want to help you guys, but to influence the Qilin tablet’s battle is just too tough! Even if clan leader is willing to activate the clan’s teleportation array to send you guys there, there’s no way for you to enter the Qilin tablet!”","“Are we.... Just going to let him perish on his own? Just how rare do we even come across such a genius!”","“But, Wu Ding, you’re not totally certain if there’s really such a person right? It’s just merely a possibility. We are millings of miles apart and if you sensed it wrongly, you’ve wasted a huge amount of the clan’s resources so you’d have to bear the responsibility as well! I think let’s just forget about it!”","For the next three days, no one was able to help.","This afternoon, the duo were chased away by Fatty You once again and they were disheartened.","After being in the Qilin tablet for three days, that lower realm genius still hadn’t died so just what kind of outstanding talent did he had!","“Damn it! This kind of genius... could it be that he was going to be ruined just like that?!”","Sage Wu Ding smashed his fist against the wall but immediately following that, his movements halted as an extremely shocked expression appeared on his face!","“Hea... Heavens... such a thing actually happened!”","Sage Dong hurriedly asked, “What’s the matter?”","“That lower realm genius.... He seems.....”","...","In the Qilin tablet.","Right after spiritual beast Qilin announced the start of the refinement, it immediately pounced towards Li Moying, not even giving him a chance to prepare himself.","But Li Moying was also an established practitioner so while they were conversing, he had already placed himself on high alert hence he was able to enter a state of battle immediately.","However after crossing hands, Li Moying realised that the ability of the spiritual beast in front of him... was simply too powerful!","It was totally different from those ninth grade peak magical beasts which he had once fought in his past life!","Spiritual beasts and magical beasts were different by only one word but in terms of physique, the former had already entered a new realm.","Although the Qilin tablet’s Qilin’s Profound Energy was suppressed to ninth grade peak, but its ability was much, much stronger than ordinary ninth grade peak magical beasts!","The paw which unleashed it’s Profound Skill, the innate response and speed as well as the mighty aura from a spiritual beast were all a grim challenge towards Li Moying!","Li Moying was beaten till he kept on retreating as he could only maintain defence for the entire duration with no chance to strike back at all!","Actually, this could not be helped.","Although his innate talent in Cloudy Qilin Clan was god grade and was considered outstanding.","But he was after all still too young.","The oldest age where practitioners could enter Violet Sun Valley was actually thirty years old and below. To God Realm’s practitioners whose longevity went past several ten thousands of years, not to mention thirty years old, even three hundred years old was considered very young."]},{"number":1555,"title":"Chapter 1555 - Find a way out of an impasse (2)","paragraphs":["Even if Cloudy Qilin Clan’s practitioners entered Violet Sun Valley when they were twenty years old, they would go into closed door cultivation for a number of years in the valley. Only after their potential reached the peak and when they had reached the age limit then would they attempt to activate the Qilin tablet, accepting the ultimate refinement.","However, Li Moying totally didn’t know about these and just rushed in like that.","Based on his age at twenty, entering the Qilin tablet for the challenge was a fascinating thing, even in the early historical times.","Of course, this also had something to do with Violet Sun Valley’s insufficient Profound Qi.","In the past, the magical beasts in Violet Sun Valley grew and multiplied without end and allowed many geniuses to cultivate simultaneously.","But now, Li Moying had just spent an entire month and he nearly cleared all the magical beasts in the valley. This wasn’t just because he had outstanding ability but also because Violet Sun Valley had long lost the ability to reproduce hence it no longer was a place for long term closed door cultivation for a genius like him.","But in this way, he was at a complete disadvantage!","Qilin’s attacks were faster and faster, and the moves it made were smoother and smoother.","Li Moying was extremely steady and even though he had been struck flying over and over again as the injuries on his body became heavier and heavier, but his mind became clearer and clearer. He had been observing the Qilin’s attack pattern, especially the rhythm of its body’s Profound Qi’s fluctuations.","Under Qilin’s swift attacks, Li Moying started to bleed non-stop and he had even felt the meridians in his body being seriously damaged.","But a smile gradually grew on the corners of his lips.","Because what he guessed wasn’t wrong. Spiritual beast Qilin’s spiritual body, as a form of energy body, it indeed was supplied by thunder attributed energy.","As his observation deepened, he could distinctly sense that every single time Qilin struck, the path of the flow of the Profound Energy within its body.","Li Moying’s gaze turned deeper as he gathered all the Profound Energy within his body.","He was very clear of this, that the absolute disparity between him and Qilin was simply too huge! He didn’t have many opportunities and there was only this one chance! He must gather all his energy and try his best to deal Qilin with heavy damage!","“Amethyst Light Sword, unsheathe!”","The bluish purple electric currents on Amethyst Light Sword suddenly expanded, dazzling up the narrow small space in the Qilin tablet with extremely bright lights!","Li Moying observed Qilin’s path of attacks and just as it charged once again, he suddenly moved and appeared right beside its body and at the same time, used up all his energy to pierce sharply towards the Qlin’s left back position!","This position.... Was something which he had observed for a very long time, spiritual beast Qilin’s weakest part of its Profound Energy! It was also the most possible position in which he could make a breakthrough!","As expected, following his attack, Qilin suddenly rose its head towards the sky as it gave out a miserable howl!","Amethyst Light Sword pierced deeply into the Qilin’s back and Li Moying immediately felt an incomparably powerful Profound Energy passing through the sword blade, causing his arms to turn numb and the long sword in his arms to almost fell!","He hurriedly held his breath with rapt attention as both his hands gripped onto the sword handle tightly, took in a deep breath and tried his best to plunge the Amethyst Light Sword deeper into the spiritual beast Qilin’s body.","Qilin howled for a short time and started shaking its body violently, trying to shake him and the Amethyst Light Sword away!","Li Moying sensed that the pressure he was bearing increased by the minute and the spiritual beast’s Profound Energy awe came raining down on him so tightly that he couldn’t even breath!","But he continued to hang on, refusing to let go no matter what!"]},{"number":1556,"title":"Chapter 1556 - Find a way out of an impasse (3)","paragraphs":["Qilin kept on howling as the degree of its shaking movements got even more vigorous!","Li Moying could clearly sensed that after Qilin’s lower back was pierced, it’s Profound Energy kept on routing out at a speed which could be seen as it followed along the sword body, leading back to its body.","Initially he was impacted by the Qilin’s Profound Energy and almost couldn’t handle the pressure as he threw up blood on the spot. But after he got adjusted to it, he gradually caught the rhythm and started to direct that portion of Profound Energy actively.","Li Moying believed that since the valley’s other magical beasts’ Profound Energy could be absorbed by him, then the spiritual beast’s would naturally be able to as well! But the process would definitely be tougher than the other magical beasts. Without outstanding determination and guts, the result would not be him absorbing Profound Energy but ending up with his meridians being cut into pieces.","Luckily Li Moying was gutsy enough and he had enough innate talent.","As one of the excellent god grade geniuses, his meridians intensity and capacity had far surpassed ordinary practitioners.","Spiritual beast Qilin’s powerful and pure Profound Energy which was invasive poured into his body and kept on expanding. If it was any other ordinary person, their meridians would have split broken by this but Li Moying was able to take on the first wave of attack!","A sliver of joy appeared on his face – he had placed the right bet!","As long as he wasn’t struck down at the first moment when the Profound Energy entered his body, he was sure that he could use his own determination to use the Qilin’s Profound Energy for his own use!","Li Moying bore with the pain of the Profound Energy invading deep into his meridians as he held his breath and congealed his senses, starting to concentrate on directing the thunder attributed Profound Energy in his meridians!","Spiritual beast Qilin howls were getting louder and louder!","“Little brat of the Cloudy Qilin Clan, get off from my back! You dare.... dare to absorb the Profound Energy from me! Ever since the Qilin tablet had been constructed successfully for several hundred thousand years, you’re the first practitioner who dared to do so! But stop dreaming, you are not able to merge my Profound Energy successfully. You will explode and die!”","Li Moying’s eyes were slightly shut as he totally ignored that Qilin which flew into a rage out of humiliation.","At the present moment, he had placed all his energy into directing the Profound Energy into his body and had no time to be concerned about other matters, what’s more about answering Qilin.","He was very clear that he must devote himself entirely and not be distracted. As long as there was a single bit of hesitation, there was a possibility that he would have a Qi Deviation!","Qilin had spoken out right now exactly because it wanted to sway his determination, to divert his attention.","Qilin saw that he wasn’t tricked as it continued, “Don’t think that I’m trying to trick you! Who do you think you are? You’re merely a practitioner from the lower realm and you had not received one of the Three Big Inheritances from the clan right? What cultivation method are you intending to use to direct the Profound Energy into your body? My Profound Energy impacts the meridians too much and even with the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Three Big Inheritances, it’s impossible to neutralise it. You’re forcing yourself to absorb it so the only outcome would be the explosion of your body!”","Its words weren’t simply an alarm.","In order to absorb the intense energy, firstly intensity of the meridians was of utmost importance and secondly, that would depend on the practitioner’s grasp of cultivation methods.","The higher the grade of the cultivation method, the stronger it could direct the absorption of the energy. For example the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s Three Big Inheritances; even if it was a spiritual beast’s Profound Energy, there were hopes of merging it with that.","But, that was merely a hope....","Success of nor, it would still depend on the practitioner’s cultivation and innate talent."]},{"number":1557,"title":"Chapter 1557 - Find a way out of an impasse (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Assuming that Li Moying was now a ninth stage realm practitioner, pairing with his outstanding innate talent and strong intensity of his meridians to cultivate a Cloudy Qilin Clan’s inheritance cultivation method, then there was an eighty percent possibility of taking in the Qilin’s energy for his own use.","If he was in the tenth stage realm, he could totally absorb all the energy cleanly!","However he was merely at seventh stage realm peak now.....","The most important thing was, after crossing hands, spiritual beast Qilin sensed that the cultivation method which he learnt was only barely half God grade. It was considered an incredible feat in the lower realm but among God Realm’s large clan, it was totally unremarkable, not to mention that it totally couldn’t be compared to the Big Three Inheritances cultivation method!","Based on Li Moying’s current conditions, although he had enough innate talent but his other conditions were rather bad and yet he still wanted to absorb the spiritual beast Qilin’s Profound Energy?","This was simply daydreaming!","“Stinky brat, did you hear me or did you not? Quickly scram off me!”","Qilin clamoured loudly.","However, Li Moying remained silent. Of course he knew that he was taking a huge risk by doing so and if he wasn’t careful, surely he would be consigned to eternal damnation?","But he had no other choice. Moreover his instinct told him that – he would definitely be able to do it!","He only used a breath’s time to discover that the cultivation method he was mastering could not handle the current situation, and there was no possibility of directing these Profound Energy!","If it were other people, they would have already become despondent but Li Moying hung on as he clenched his teeth!","Since the cultivation method was of no use, then.... he would base on his own understanding to absorb these Profound Energy!","Time passed by slowly and under his highly concentrated great effort, the violent Profound Energy really settled down slowly, as it went past his meridians, slowly combining with his body’s Profound Energy, flowing into his dantian.","Qilin shook his body for a long time but was still unable to throw the man down, so it decided to stop wasting its breath.","Anyway this fellow was looking for death so his body exploding was just an instantaneous matter! A god grade genius trying to show off, so if he was full to the point of bursting, it was his own problem!","However, after a moment, Qilin realised in astonishment that... Li Moying was actually alright!","After a long time later, it discovered again that Li Moying was actually really absorbing its Profound Energy and the speed of it was getting faster and faster!","“What? How could this be possible? This little fellow is still not dead? He absorbed so much Profound Energy... could it be that he had really successfully merged with my Profound Energy? How could it be possible? That cultivation method which he was mastering obviously was a trashy thing in God Realm’s streets! How could he possibly be that incredible? Or perhaps... he didn’t use his cultivation method, but based on his own understanding to complete the merging process?”","When the second idea popped out, it made Qilin’s heart jump with shock!","This.. this shouldn’t be possible right? If it was true, then the power of understanding of this handsome younger junior in front of him was simply shocking! Even in God Realm, it had never met with such an abnormal genius with such strong power of understanding!","Right, not possible, this was impossible....","But other than that, there was no other way to explain how the Profound Energy was merged successfully.....","Just as Qilin was in extreme shock,, it suddenly sensed a burst of violent Profound Energy fluctuation emitting from its back, as it started to radiate swift towards the surroundings!","The surrounding thunder attributed Energy were raging up by the minute, as though it was going to burst the Qilin!","Qilin’s eyes widen increduously, “S...Surely not? This little fellow is actually going to advance... now??”","Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, Li Moying only felt as though his body was soaked in boiling water as extreme pure Profound Energy surged inwards, repeatedly crashing against his dantian.","This sensation was something that he wasn’t unfamiliar with – advancement, was right in front of him!","He was originally at seventh stage realm peak, just one step away from eight stage realm and right now under the provocative Qilin’s Profound Energy, he was unstoppable and very soon, he broke through to the last boundary.","His surrounding aura rose up faster and faster....","Finally, amid a burst of piercing ray, he successfully advanced into the eighth stage realm!","Spiritual beast Qilin was simply shocked beyond words.","“Seriously? Does it need to be that exaggerated? Based on this young fellow’s bone age, he’s just merely twenty over years old. An eighth stage realm at twenty years old... even in God Realm, he’s also considered as a top rated genius. Furthermore that would require the clan’s heavily invested resources before they were able to do it... this fellow.....”","Just as Qilin was in a daze, Li Moying had speedily re-adjusted his condition.","He had been on the verge of advancement for several days now and as he had been accumulating everything for quite some time, so this time round, success followed naturally when all the conditions had been fulfilled.","After advancement, he immediately entered a battling posture as the Amethyst Light Sword in his hand shone even brighter than before! The speed of the absorption of Profound Energy also became faster!","Qilin was completely angered as the scales on its back all started to give off blaring electric currents!","At the same time, Li Moying also discovered that the Profound Energy which he could absorb had already reached the limit and if he continued on his meridians weren’t able to accommodate it at all.","With no choice, he could only choose to give up.","A burst of electricity flashed past his hand and following the Amethyst Light Sword’s sword blade, it shot into the lower back of the spiritual beast Qilin.","“You.... you little fellow.... Despicable.... AH—!”","Qilin had totally not expected Li Moying to reverse the flow of the Profound Energy so it tried its best to take back it’s Profound Energy but as it was caught unaware, the two Profound Energies layered onto each other and instantly it suffered an intense backlash as the Profound Energy shot right to its heart, sending it flying!","Furthermore, it spat out a blue coloured fluid in mid air.","This was formed from Qilin’s Profound Energy and once it got in contact with air, it dissipated into thunder attributed energy.","But it’s action meant that it had already suffered a heavy injury, which was no different from spitting out blood.","Qilin was heavily injured by Li Moying but he himself wasn’t in any great shape either.","As the spiritual beast’s potential was just too powerful, he didn’t dare to show any mercy as he used up all his power to strike back. All of the Profound Energy which he had absorbed during advancement was thoroughly exhausted!","Earlier when he was merging with Qilin’s Profound Energy, his meridians were already hurt and right now, he was totally depleted of his energy and his body instantly felt as though he had been emptied.","Li Moying’s complexion turned extremely pale and his sword blade pointed downwards, piercing onto the ground.","On the other side, spiritual beast Qilin sprawled onto the ground as it panted heavily, as though it totally couldn’t climb up anymore.","Every breath it took, it would spray out blue coloured energy mass, evidently it was injured very seriously.","But.... it was still alive.","Li Moying had not forgotten his own mission. It wasn’t to defeat spiritual beast Qilin, but.... to kill it!","If it was just to defeat the other party, then the victory was already clear and he could be considered to pass the stage.","But now the aim was to kill.....","Earlier he had used ninety percent of his Profound Energy and had gained an unexpected huge advantage which was why he dealt the Qilin with such a heavy injury but that blow was unable to kill it!","However, Qilin was heavily injured now and he still gained the absolute advantage.","Li Moying silently thought quickly but at the next moment, his eyes turned wide with shock."]},{"number":1558,"title":"Chapter 1558 - Find a way out of an impasse (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At this moment, Li Moying only felt as though his body was soaked in boiling water as extreme pure Profound Energy surged inwards, repeatedly crashing against his dantian.","This sensation was something that he wasn’t unfamiliar with – advancement, was right in front of him!","He was originally at seventh stage realm peak, just one step away from eight stage realm and right now under the provocative Qilin’s Profound Energy, he was unstoppable and very soon, he broke through to the last boundary.","His surrounding aura rose up faster and faster....","Finally, amid a burst of piercing ray, he successfully advanced into the eighth stage realm!","Spiritual beast Qilin was simply shocked beyond words.","“Seriously? Does it need to be that exaggerated? Based on this young fellow’s bone age, he’s just merely twenty over years old. An eighth stage realm at twenty years old... even in God Realm, he’s also considered as a top rated genius. Furthermore that would require the clan’s heavily invested resources before they were able to do it... this fellow.....”","Just as Qilin was in a daze, Li Moying had speedily re-adjusted his condition.","He had been on the verge of advancement for several days now and as he had been accumulating everything for quite some time, so this time round, success followed naturally when all the conditions had been fulfilled.","After advancement, he immediately entered a battling posture as the Amethyst Light Sword in his hand shone even brighter than before! The speed of the absorption of Profound Energy also became faster!","Qilin was completely angered as the scales on its back all started to give off blaring electric currents!","At the same time, Li Moying also discovered that the Profound Energy which he could absorb had already reached the limit and if he continued on his meridians weren’t able to accommodate it at all.","With no choice, he could only choose to give up.","A burst of electricity flashed past his hand and following the Amethyst Light Sword’s sword blade, it shot into the lower back of the spiritual beast Qilin.","“You.... you little fellow.... Despicable.... AH—!”","Qilin had totally not expected Li Moying to reverse the flow of the Profound Energy so it tried its best to take back it’s Profound Energy but as it was caught unaware, the two Profound Energies layered onto each other and instantly it suffered an intense backlash as the Profound Energy shot right to its heart, sending it flying!","Furthermore, it spat out a blue coloured fluid in mid air.","This was formed from Qilin’s Profound Energy and once it got in contact with air, it dissipated into thunder attributed energy.","But it’s action meant that it had already suffered a heavy injury, which was no different from spitting out blood.","Qilin was heavily injured by Li Moying but he himself wasn’t in any great shape either.","As the spiritual beast’s potential was just too powerful, he didn’t dare to show any mercy as he used up all his power to strike back. All of the Profound Energy which he had absorbed during advancement was thoroughly exhausted!","Earlier when he was merging with Qilin’s Profound Energy, his meridians were already hurt and right now, he was totally depleted of his energy and his body instantly felt as though he had been emptied.","Li Moying’s complexion turned extremely pale and his sword blade pointed downwards, piercing onto the ground.","On the other side, spiritual beast Qilin sprawled onto the ground as it panted heavily, as though it totally couldn’t climb up anymore.","Every breath it took, it would spray out blue coloured energy mass, evidently it was injured very seriously.","But.... it was still alive.","Li Moying had not forgotten his own mission. It wasn’t to defeat spiritual beast Qilin, but.... to kill it!","If it was just to defeat the other party, then the victory was already clear and he could be considered to pass the stage.","But now the aim was to kill.....","Earlier he had used ninety percent of his Profound Energy and had gained an unexpected huge advantage which was why he dealt the Qilin with such a heavy injury but that blow was unable to kill it!","However, Qilin was heavily injured now and he still gained the absolute advantage.","Li Moying silently thought quickly but at the next moment, his eyes turned wide with shock."]},{"number":1559,"title":"Chapter 1559 - Find a way out of an impasse (6)","paragraphs":["In the other corner, spiritual beast Qilin laid on the ground, totally not moving.","But not knowing when, suddenly specks of blue light surrounded the Qilin.","Those light spots were very weak and sparse initially but in an extremely short span of time, it grew concentrated and became brighter and brighter!","Li Moying’s expression changed, “No good, this is.....”","Before he could react over, these light spots had formed into a cluster and were absorbed by the spiritual beast Qilin immediately!","Immediately following that, the wounds on Qilin’s body started to heal and not long after, it climbed up from the ground and stared at Li Moying with its shining eyes. It’s tall and robust body looked like a little hill filled with intense might....","Evidently, it had already recovered back to its normal state.","“Damn!!”","Even for someone who was as calm as Li Moying, he helplessly hurled out a vulgarity.","Did it need to play around with him like that? Is this spiritual beast an undead? Even with such a heavy injury, it could instantly restore itself then what’s there to continue fighting? What’s called killing the Qilin and they would be able to pass the stage. Is this really something that can be achieved by a human?","All the efforts which Li Moying had put his hard work into had all turned to naught and he was extremely upset over it!","But he didn’t have any time to ponder over it as a bitter cold glow flashed past spiritual beast Qilin’s eyes and it immediately charged towards him!","This time round, although Qilin’s attack was roughly the same as the last time round, but Li Moying sensitively noticed that Qilin’s power had dropped slightly. It could only utilise around ninety percent of its total power earlier. It meant that his attack earlier wasn’t totally ineffective.","If he could repeat that kind of strong intensity attack around ten times or above, there was a possibility of wearing this Qilin down.","But Li Moying had no energy to complete this for the second time.","The Profound Energy within him had turned totally void as the consumption used was far more than spiritual beast Qilin and it was getting obvious on who was stronger and weaker. Not long after, Li Moying was riddled with heavy injuries on his entire body and he wasn’t able to continue holding on.","“Young fellow, you’re still not giving up?” Qilin’s voice reverberated around the tablet.","Li Moying clenched his teeth tightly!","He indeed wasn’t willing to give up. As long as there was a sliver of hope, he wanted to persist till the very end without any regrets!","But at this instance, his mind flashed an image of Huang Yueli’s sweet smile. That delicate and adorable young lass was still waiting for him to leave this place... he could not afford to die right here!","“Alright, I admit defeat!” Li Moying hissed these few words out of the slits of his teeth.","With that out, he heaved a sigh of relief.","He was no longer unresigned about giving up because making such a decision for his Li’er, it was worth it.","Li Moying shut his eyes and waited to be transported out.","The thought of being able to see Li’er immediately made his lips curled up into a smile. He wondered if the young lass had been anxiously waiting for him? Him suddenly being transported into the Qilin tablet should have shocked her badly?","No, she probably hadn’t been shocked. After all, his little fox was a peerless Armament Master who had plenty of knowledge in these than him!","Li Moying waited for a while but the expected darkness did not arrive.","On the contrary, the lightning flashes and spiritual beast Qilin’s attacks had not stopped!","A bolt of lightning shot towards his chest.","Li Moying hurriedly opened his eyes to evade hastily and at the very last moment, that mighty electric bolt brushed past him!","He broke out into cold sweat in shock and asked in alarm, “What’s going on? Haven’t I already admitted defeat? Why can’t I leave this place??”","Qilin’s voice rang, “Transportation failed, Qilin tablet’s refinement shall continue.”"]},{"number":1560,"title":"Chapter 1560 - Find a way out of an impasse (7)","paragraphs":["“What??” Li Moying didn’t believe his own ears, “Wait! Haven’t I already given up?”","Qilin continued to attack him continuously.","Li Moying had already planned to admit defeat but was forced to defend himself right now as he was surrounded by perils.","Spiritual beast Qilin spoke as it attacked, “But you have not been transported out of the Qilin Tablet isn’t it? That means that the refinement shall continue!”","Li Moying totally couldn’t accept this kind of result, “Wait, earlier you said if I simply cannot pass through the refinement, then I can automatically choose to give up and now I’ve already admitted defeat! Why are you still forcing me to continue??”","“Haven’t I already said the reason? Because you’re not transported out of here!”","“What do you mean?” Li Moying frowned.","“My spiritual body is blocked by the Qilin tablet and I must follow the old clan leader’s series of regulations which he had set when he refined the Qilin tablet. Once the refinement starts, there is no way to end it, unless you’re transported out!”","Another dazzling lightning descended from the sky and under the lead from the spiritual beast Qilin, it gathered into a piece of bright screen, casting out towards Li Moying!","Li Moying was originally heavily injured and his speed and defence had dropped by a huge notch. Right now although he tried his best to evade it, but he was still struck.","He was sent flying as he crashed onto the wall in the Qilin tablet and blood started to trickle down from the corner of his lips.","“Damnit! What on earth is going on? Haven’t I already given up? Why can’t I leave this place?”","He clenched his teeth and shouted loudly three times, “I give up! I give up! I give up! Let me out!”","But there were no changes in the surroundings at all.","Qilin tablet remained motionless as though it wasn’t a piece of mechanism Profound Armament but just an ordinary room.","“Stop struggling, it should be because the Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in Soaring Heavens Continent is just too low and Qilin tablet didn’t get sufficient energy hence leading to the failure in transportation.”","Li Moying raised his head up, “Since that’s the case, this is the Qilin tablet’s problem! I want to give up the refinement so stop chasing after me! I have to find a way to go out!”","Qilin walked nearer to him slowly and the electric aura from its body became stronger and stronger!","The injuries on its body kept on healing with the help of the Qilin tablet’s array.","Right at this moment, as time went by, the heavy injury which Li Moying had casted upon it had mostly healed up.","This made Li Moying even sure that his hope of victory was vague. Unless there was a way to kill it in one strike, otherwise this Qilin in the Qilin tablet was almost invincible.","Qilin;s voice appeared to be cold and emotionless, “Since you’re still in the Qilin tablet, if I don’t attack you, I’d suffer from suppression and torture! So I will not stop, be prepared!”","With that, earth shattering electric currents attacked from all areas, enveloping Li Moying within.","Li Moying persisted on as the spirit was willing but the flesh was weak and the injuries he incurred were getting heavier and heavier. In the end, his consciousness started to become blurry.....","...","Violet Sun Valley, outside Qilin tablet.","Huang Yueli hugged her knees as she sat under a big tree right in front of the Qilin tablet as she gazed at the stone tablet from afar, with little Qilin lazing around her feet.","Ever since the day when Li Moying used his blood to activate this huge stone tablet, he vanished instantly.","Huang Yueli had encountered similar experiences before so she wasn’t too surprised, knowing that Li Moying had definitely been sucked into the stone tablet."]},{"number":1561,"title":"Chapter 1561 - Unacceptable ending (1)","paragraphs":["For Li Moying, it was a rare chance!","This was a once in a blue moon chance and even casually thinking about it and she knew that there must be an absolutely secretive inheritance hiding inside the stone tablet. If Li Moying was able to get this inheritance, by the time he came out, his ability would have a huge improvement!","Moreover, perhaps with this inheritance, this lifetime he would be able to surpass that door which he had been unable to surpass in his past life – tenth stage realm!","Thinking of these, Huang Yueli was feeling excited for her own fiancée as she happily sat down beside the stone tablet as she meditated and cultivated while waiting for him to appear.","Based on her experience in the Sacred Phoenix Race’s inheritance tower, to obtain the clan’s recognition and to get the best inheritance, they must pass through various assessments and the time spent on it was absolutely not short.","Hence from the start, she wasn’t too worried. Every day she would tease the little Qilin and then enter the Sky Phoenix Ring to tease little Phoenix and after that cultivate a little. Other than the thunder attributed energy in the atmosphere which was a little too strong which made her uncomfortable, all other conditions went along rather smoothly.","However, on the third day after Li Moying entered the stone tablet, the sky suddenly flashed as a bolt of lightning struck the top of the stone tablet.","That bolt of lightning was extremely bright and very thick. When it landed, strong thunder attributed energy charred all the surrounding trees.","Although Huang Yueli managed to evade in time, but she was still sent flying as her face was smeared with dust and dirt.","The stone tablet’s colour turned purple, interconnecting with the lightning as the electric currents in the air kept on being absorbed into it.","“What situation is this? What on earth happened inside the stone tablet?” Huang Yueli saw this and instinctively felt that things were not right as she started to feel worried.","Even though she knew that Li Moying’s ability innate talent and his response were all not lacking. He was a genuine peerless genius with the ability to adjust to various different changes in situations and was definitely much stronger than her.","But Huang Yueli’s heart was still unsettled as an ominous feeling crept up in her heart.","” No, surely not right? Nothing must happen to you! Even I am able to pass the Sacred Phoenix Race’s inheritance, Moying is so powerful so there’s definitely no problem!”","She repeatedly reassured herself but not knowing why, that flustered feeling in her heart did not disappear.","On the contrary, it became more and more serious.","Huang Yueli kept on pacing up and down nearby, one minute ago she was on the east side, next minute she was at the west.","Little Phoenix was in the Sky Phoenix Ring and sensed her flustered feelings as he took a dig at her, “I say, female demon, what are you worried about? As the saying goes, Good people do not live long while scourge stays for thousands of years. Your family’s big demon lord is a badass who bullies those small animals so he will absolutely live on well alright, what are you afraid of? Moreover speaking, from the way that these electric currents energy are gathering, perhaps.... big demon lord is just advancing!”","Even though little Phoenix was whining and his tone wasn’t good at all, but Huang Yueli somewhat felt a little comforted.","“Hope this is so.....”","Luckily the situation of the lightning striking the stone tablet maintained for around one hour and finally stopped.","The huge stone in Huang Yueli’s heart finally dropped when she saw little Qilin which had been sitting by her feet suddenly leap upwards, pouncing towards the direction of the Qilin tablet!","“Aw aw aw!! Aw aw aw aw—!!!”","It’s little claw threaded in disarray as it kept clawing at the stone tablet with its might but unfortunately, it only left a slight mark.","Not only that, it moved its head with huge movements and the scales on its body were almost all poking out. Anyone could tell that it was anxious to the max right now!"]},{"number":1562,"title":"Chapter 1562 - Unacceptable ending (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli immediately pounced over, wanting to lift it up.","But before she had even touched Little Qilin’s body, this little thing’s head twisted to one side as it landed onto the ground.","Huang Yueli’s heart fell into the depths of the abyss as a bad premonition surfaced in her heart.","A contracted magical beast like Little Qilin not only were linked in their minds and thoughts with its Master, but were also connected in life and death.","Now Little Qilin turned out into such an abnormal state for no rhyme or reason and later on just fainted. This meant that Li Moying had met with an extremely grave crisis in the stone tablet! Furthermore..... there was a possibility that something had happened to him!","But this was merely a refinement. Li Moying’s innate talent was so high and his battle experience was so rich so what was it that he couldn’t possibly deal with?","Huang Yueli didn’t want to believe that something had happened to him but the truth was placed right in front of her eyes.","Even Little Qilin had fallen so Li Moying’s situation shouldn’t be any better.","Huang Yueli’s feelings were heavy as she slowly squatted down, placing Little Qilin onto her knee and touching its chest.","Luckily.... It was still breathing....","This little thing had merely fainted and not died on the spot.","Huang Yueli rested her heart slightly because this at least meant that Li Moying was still alive? But Little Qilin was struggling on whilst at death’s door and this again represented that he was just one step away from death.....","How could this be possible?","Huang Yueli hugged Little Qilin tightly as she bit her lips, praying repeatedly.","“Li Moying, nothing can happen to you! No matter how big the waves are in the past, you’ve braved it all so how could you possibly die in the middle of a refinement? Moreover speaking, you said you’d marry me.... are you thinking of abandoning me when we just got started? Stop dreaming.....”","...","God Realm.","“Heaven... Heavens... how could such a thing happen! That lower realm genius.... He seems...” Sage Wu Ding’s eyes widened.","Sage Dong inquired hastily, “Seems like that? What on earth happened!”","Sage Wu Ding frowned, “I’m not entirely clear on what happened but for an instance, I seem to have felt a huge amount of energy gathering in the Qilin tablet and I wonder if it was my misperception... If not, wouldn’t it be a little too strange?”","“What’s strange?”","“This kind of Profound Energy fluctuation, if it was real.... Then wouldn’t it represent that the lower realm genius... had advanced in the Qilin tablet?”","Sage Dong replied disapprovingly, “I thought what was the matter! Just this.... is it worth it for you to make a fuss out of it? Practitioners with outstanding innate talents suddenly breaking through the bottlenecks and advance while in the middle of a battle is originally a very common matter isn’t it?”","“Sigh, you know nothing!” Sage Wu Ding explained, “The huge amount of energy in the Qilin tablet is completely controlled by the sealed Qilin’s spiritual body. Logically, whether refinement practitioners would not be able absorb that much energy, to the point of advancing! To have such a matter happening only meant that the lower realm genius had heavily injured the spiritual beast and Qilin is unable to control the Profound Qi in the tablet hence he got the chance to advance!”","“What? In this case.....” Sage Dong’s eyes lit up, “Could it be that the lower realm genius really could kill the Qilin, to become the first person to pass the Qilin tablet’s refinement?”","“That’s hard to say.....” Sage Qu Ding muttered, “But no matter what, his innate talent is much stronger than what I had imagined at the beginning!”"]},{"number":1563,"title":"Chapter 1563 - Unacceptable ending (3)","paragraphs":["“No way, such a ridiculously strong genius, we can’t just let him die like this! We cannot give up! Brother Wu Ding, let’s think of other ways!” Sage Wu Ding set up his mind.","The two of them arrived at the Clan Leader’s residence again to welcome them but it was still You Da Zhuang’s greasy face facing them.","“Both Sages, you still haven’t given up?”","Sage Dong quickly replied, “Steward You, on account that we have visited so many times, please let me meet with Clan Leader!”","You Da Zhuang had started to waver because honestly speaking, Sage Wu Ding and Sage Dong were respectful Elders in the clan. They tried to meet with Clan Leader for several times and with so much determination, could it really be some urgent matter?","“I’ve told you many times that Clan Leader is in close door cultivation! If you really don’t believe me, then go knock on Clan Leader’s courtyard door which he is in closed door cultivation in. If you disturb Clan Leader’s cultivation, bear the consequences yourself!”","His words were equivalent to giving up.","Sage Dong gave a gleeful expression, “That’s great! Wu Ding, let’s hurry in!”","He strode in with big steps but after walking for a few steps, he discovered that the person behind didn’t follow him at all.","He turned back and asked doubtfully, “Brother Wu Ding, what are you doing? Still not going to hurry and grab hold of time?”","“It’s too late.....” Sage Wu Ding suddenly gave out a long sigh.","Sage Dong went into a blank and lifted his head to see his complexion turning green as his brows knitted tightly together, with a discouraged look.","“What’s the matter??”","Sage Wu Ding’s voice was filled with deep regret and remorse, “It’s already too late! Earlier the Profound Energy fluctuations in the Qilin tablet had completely stopped!”","Sage Dong asked in astonishment “What? How could that be possible? Have you got it wrong? Haven’t that young fellow just advanced, it’s just a short time since then and he.... not possible right?”","Sage Wu Ding shook his head, “I’ve already tried to sense it repeatedly so there’s no way I’d get it wrong. In the Qilin tablet, there indeed has no more fluctuations and there’s only one explanation for this kind of scenario. That is the practitioner taking on the refinement has already lost his life in the tablet! Too late, we’re really too late! All gone now!”","Sage Dong also seemed as though he was struck by lightning as he stood dazed at the original spot.","In a large family clan like Cloudy Qilin Clan, the clan’s honour had long been set deeply into each family member’s bones and blood.","Recalling that the peerless genius who was able to hold up the Cloudy Qilin Clan’s future for the next several ten thousands of years within a few mere days, was discovered but before they were able to celebrate this fact, he had abruptly died! Their hearts were filled with pain!","Sage Wu Ding clenched his fists as he shot a penetrative glare towards You Da Zhuang who was standing right by the side.","“You Da Zhuang, the clan’s future has been ruined in your hands! In future if Cloudy Qilin Clan declines along the way, then you will be the greatest sinner of the entire clan! I will find a chance to report this to Clan Leader, just you wait!”","Saying that, he flicked his sleeves and left.","Sage Dong heaved a long sigh as he followed closely.","You Da Zhuang looked at their departing backs and a puzzled look was left on his face, mixed in with fury, “What is this! Merely just two old has-beens and still dare to threaten me? Do you really think Clan Leader will listen to you? Hah Hah, simply daydreaming!”","...","At the present moment, all the disciples were gathered in front of Celestial Light Sect’s main door.","The disciples gazed at the people on the stage and started whispering into one another’s ears as they started to discuss secretly.","“What’s going on? Why did Sect Master suddenly gather all the disciples, and in such a formal manner? Could something big be happening?”"]},{"number":1564,"title":"Chapter 1564 - Unacceptable ending (4)","paragraphs":["“What other big matter could it be?” Someone raised his head and used his chin to point towards the direction of the stage, “Can’t you see? Someone’s delightful look? Ever since Young Sect Master went missing in Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, he’s been swaggering about!”","“Hush, stop talking already!” The Senior Brother hurriedly nudged him as he looked left and right before lowering his voice, “What guts you have! Don’t you want to live anymore? You dare to gossip about Senior Brother Li like that!”","“I... what I say is the truth isn’t it? Haven’t you taken a look at him? Standing right beside Sect Master’s side at the gathering. Those who don’t know would think that he’s Celestial Light Sect’s Young Sect Master!”","Senior Brother gave him a stare and said, “What do you mean by ‘think’? Senior Brother Li is going to become the Young Sect Master immediately!”","“Wh... What?” Junior Brother’s tongue was tied, “How could this be? Not possible right?”","“Why is it not possible? I’m telling you, today’s gathering is exactly to announce Senior Brother Li to become Celestial Light Sect’s new Young Sect Master. Moreover they are going to announce Senior Brother Li and Eldest Young Miss’ wedding!”","Junior Brother’s eyes turned wide with his entire face filled with shock, “N.... No right? Senior Brother, you must have got it wrong! Young Sect Master he’s just been missing for a month over and Senior Brother Li is going to replace him? His innate talent, potential, character, which one of these are able to match up to Young Sect Master? He... what rights does he have?”","“Shut your mouth! With these words of yours, do you really not want your life anymore? You know Senior Brother Li’s methods and if his subordinates were to hear this, even our Master will be implicated by a little fellow like you!”","Junior Brother was berated badly and could only hush up.","But after a while, the more he thought the more unresigned he got as he inched closer to Senior Brother again and said softly, “This matter... this matter, how would Sect Master he ever agree to it? In the past when Young Sect Master was around, Sect Master obviously liked him.....”","Senior Brother sighed and knew that if he didn’t make things clear, this Junior Brother of his who madly worshipped Li Moying would absolutely not give up so he could only put it out in the open.","“Sect Master indeed liked Young Sect Master the most but he’s after all no longer around! Moreover, if he was missing in some other places, there was still a possibility to save him but now Young Sect Master has died in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region! For the next thousands of years, the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region cannot be reactivated and even if Young Sect Master manages to escape death, there is absolutely no possibility of him leaving that place!”","“Sect Master’s body isn’t in good shape and many years ago he no longer wanted to bother about the affairs of the Sect. Under such circumstances, Celestial Light Sect definitely needs a new Young Sect Master. Senior Brother Li’s potential is unreservedly number one in the entire Sect so he naturally is the number one choice. Moreover, I heard that he had already won Eldest Young Miss’s heart and the both of them are going to get engaged. Sect Master would naturally pass on the position of Young Sect Master to his own future son-in-law!”","“What?” Junior Brother had once again got shocked, “But doesn’t Eldest Young Miss like Young Sect Master? She had obviously chased after him for so many years! Now he had just died for how many days? And she had a change of heart? This.... how could she be like this?”","“Enough, stop asking! Is Eldest Young Miss’ matters something that an immature brat like you can comment about?”","Senior Brother gave his Junior Brother a fierce stare and Junior Brother could only shut his mouth aggrievedly.","However among the crowd, there were plenty others who were commenting about Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei as well."]},{"number":1565,"title":"Chapter 1565 - Unacceptable ending (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Many of them could not believe that such a thing was happening and they were both shocked and sad.","“I heard others say that Senior Brother Li and Young Sect Master’s death is related and he was possibly the one who caused Young Sect Master to die. This matter hasn’t been investigated properly so on what basis can he become the Young Sect Master? Just because his innate talent is the highest? Actually, he’s not any higher than other people!”","“Isn’t that so? Junior Brother Luo’s innate talent is much higher than his but he’s merely younger than him hence his cultivation wasn’t as high as his.”","“I don’t believe it, I don’t believe it! This cannot be possible!”","“Sect Master definitely won’t be cheated by Li Lingchuan like that! And Eldest Young Miss, absolutely wouldn’t possibly have a change of heart to like this kind of hypocrite who hides a dagger in his smiles!”","In the depths of their hearts, the disciples were determined to stand on Li Moying’s side.","After all, Li Moying’s abnormal innate talent and potential were something which everyone knew and the entire Sect’s disciples were clear of what that universally shocking peerless genius meant and were hoping that he could lead Celestial Light Sect to a better future.","Furthermore, Li Moying relied on his own ability to gain victory for Celestial Light Sect numerous times, pulling strongly against a crazy tide to crush his opponent thus allowing Celestial Light Sect to gain the current status today.","It could be said that Li Moying’s Young Sect Master’s position was not dependent on anyone passing it on to him but it truly was fame following merit for him.","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples all worshipped him like an idol.","Li Moying suddenly died in the mystic region and many of them had still not come around it, feeling that all these were unreal. To the fact that even though some people knew that Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region could not be activated but they were still secretly hoping that Li Moying would suddenly return!","But, now...","Sect Master actually was going to designate a new Young Sect Master?","Moreover, it was that sinister villain Li Lingchuan!","Celestial Light Sect’s disciples all expressed that they could not accept this but no one dared to voice it out!","Because not only was Li Lingchuan’s ability above them, his character was also sly and sinister as he would certainly take revenge against those who went against him!","In the past when Li Moying was around, he didn’t dare to go overboard but now that the only person who could suppress him wasn’t around anymore.....","The disciples could only entrust their hopes onto Murong De, hoping that he wouldn’t be brainwashed by Li Lingchuan.","However, the development later totally left them disappointed.","In the early morning at seven o’clock sharp, Celestial Light Sect’s huge bell rang and the sound was sonorous and mighty, reverberating towards the mountain below announcing for Celestial Light Sect’s gathering to officially start.","Everyone quietened down as they looked towards the stage.","With Murong Fei’s support, Murong De faltered as he walked up the stage.","Just a short duration of a month had barely passed and his black hair which was originally in good condition had almost turned totally white and the wrinkles on his face had deepened as he looked thin and pallid. As though he had aged a number of years in an instant.","One could tell that Li Moying’s death had really dealt him with a heavy blow.","He walked to the front of the stage and looked at the disciples below as he took a deep breath, remaining silent for a moment before he opened his mouth.","“Celestial Light Sect’s Elders, Protectors and disciples, this is something that you all might have already known some time ago. Our Sect’s Young Sect Master Li Moying, had unfortunately met with his demise over one month ago in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region.....”","Murong De choked for a moment and stopped.","Towards Li Moying, there was affection for him. After all he had brought him back since young and raised him up by himself, throwing in a large amount of meticulous care to nurture him."]},{"number":1566,"title":"Chapter 1566 - Unacceptable ending (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","As compared to Li Lingchuan who joined Celestial Light Sect when he was ten over years old, Murong De naturally liked Li Moying more.","But no matter how much he liked him, Li Moying was after all already dead.","A dead person could not be revived.","So no matter how much heartache and regretful he felt, he still had to pass the days.","Celestial Light Sect was riddled with various problems within and outside the Sect and it indeed required a Young Sect Master who could aid him to deal with the Sect’s matters. Li Lingchuan had proven his ability within this period of time to prove that he had the ability to deal with such matters.","Of course, most importantly was Murong Fei had repeatedly cajoled Murong De with Li Lingchuan’s capability and even raised the intention to marry him.","Murong De simply could not understand why his eldest daughter would have a change of heart in such a short period of time. But she could walk out the shadow of Li Moying’s passing away to find someone who mutually loved one another, Murong De who loved his daughter with his heart, felt that it was a good thing hence he tried ways to satisfy her.","So combining various elements, Murong De still made the painful decision...","“..... Additionally, this Sect Master still has two other important matters to announce.”","“Firstly, this Sect Master’s second disciple Li Lingchuan, had been aiding me in dealing with the Sect’s matters ever since Li Moying passed on. He had exhibited outstanding performance and further, his innate talent and ability is something which many of us had witnessed. Hence from today onwards, he will become Celestial Light Set’s new Young Sect Master, and his status in the Sect is just beneath mine.”","“Secondly, my daughter Murong Fei and Young Sect Master Li Lingchuan are in love with each other and this Sect Master is deeply gratified by it so we shall be holding the engagement ceremony in the near future.”","“By then, Young Sect Master’s assumption and engagement ceremony will be held on the same day...”","Murong De’s words on the stage were passed down into the disciples’ ears.","Every single one of them bore an expression of disbelief as they were shocked emotionally.","“It’s real, those hearsay are really real.....”","“How could this be? Li Lingchuan actually really became the Young Sect Master!”","“Not only that, Eldest Young Miss is really going to be engaged with him?”","“Why did this happen? The only Young Sect Master in my heart, is forever Senior Brother Li only!”","However, no matter how shocked, displeased, upset the crowd were, it was of no use.","Li Lingchuan stood behind Murong De on his right as his lips curled upwards. Anyone could tell that his expression was filled with determination.","His gaze surveyed the grounds around the mountain as he observed everyone’s expression as he memorised all those people who were obviously discussing about him.","“Hmph, ignorant brats, still missing Li Moying? Too bad... he’s already dead! No matter how incredible or how genius he was, he’s only a dead person. How can a dead person.... even fight with me? Could he even possibly hold on to the position of Young Sect Master and not let go?”","Li Lingchuan’s heart was extremely complacent right now!","He had cooperated with Leng Yi Feng this time round and although he had experienced quite a lot of danger, but eventually based on his own luck, he became the one who gained the most out of this situation.","Not only had he managed to get rid of Li Moying, he had even replaced him to become Celestial Light Sect’s Young Sect Master.","Furthermore, he had successfully taken the advantage of the situation and obtained Murong Fei’s heart when she was at her most vulnerable point.","Of course, what he was most complacent about was his sudden intentions to kill the nearing death Leng Yi Feng.","Leng Yi Feng’s realm ring had simply too many and too valuable treasures; it was no wonder he was a descendant of a large family from the Soaring Heavens Continent!","All these now all belonged to him Li Lingchuan!","What’s more, he need not bore any responsibility because the dead man Li Moying had already been made into his scapegoat."]},{"number":1567,"title":"Chapter 1567 - Unacceptable ending (7)","paragraphs":["Li Lingchuan felt that he was simply too intelligent!","Not only had he not felt ashamed of his own actions, instead he self-assumed that he had grabbed the right opportunity to obtain today’s result, all these were because of his shockingly great guts and luck.","“Li Moying, hadn’t you always been arrogant and unexcelled in the past? But what use is that? The last person to obtain everything is still me isn’t it? Your position, your authority, your woman, don’t they all belong to me in the end? So to speak, whoever laughed the last would have the best laugh of all!”","He was feeling complacent while he was thinking and at the same time, he waved to a protector next to him.","“Those few under the tree shade had been presumptuously commenting about the Sect’s matters so capture all of them!”","Don’t think that these people were still thinking about Li Moying but not too far later on, Li Moying would become a part of everyone’s memories and not be able to cause any waves.","Murong Fei stood behind Murong De on his left as the expression on her face looked melancholic but very quickly, she revealed a smile.","No matter how great Li Moying was, he was already dead and could no longer bring her any glory.","Originally she wanted to get married to Li Moying because of his outstanding innate talent. He would definitely become a peerless top exponent in future and marrying him would allow her to become the target of every woman’s envy.","But, he’s dead and everything has turned into passing clouds. So it wasn’t wrong for her to look for a new man!","...","Violet Sun Valley.","Inside the Qilin tablet.","Under the brutal attacks from spiritual beast Qilin, Li Moying’s Profound Energy was nearly exhausted.","He held on miserably for a period of time but this was a battle which could not possibly be won so no matter how long he dragged it out, there would be no change to the result.","His consciousness started to become blurry.","Finally, after yet another time of being sent flying off by the spiritual beast Qilin, he fell onto the ground and laid there motionless.","Qilin’s attack stopped for a moment, “Little fellow from Cloudy Qilin Clan, get up!”","However, Li Moying did not give any response. On that perfectly sculpted good looking face, there was no hint of colour as his eyes were shut tightly with a sliver of blood on the side of his lips.","Spiritual beast Qilin suddenly felt that something was amiss as he cried out again, “Quickly get up, stop playing dead! Don’t think that you can get over this by playing dead!”","It still did not get any response.","Qilin threw Li Moying up into the sky and observed his condition carefully.","Li Moying’s breathing and pulse had stopped completely and although there was slight Profound Energy fluctuation coming from his body, but it was so weak that it could be ignored.","This was the display of the total depletion of Profound Energy.","Under such circumstances, a practitioner could be said to be in a critical stage.","The only possibility of survival was to get treatment immediately. Not only did one need to take several sixth level and above pills, he also needed a same attribute practitioner on a higher grade than his to inject Profound Energy into his body to help him fully unblock all the broken meridians, to make up for the loss of Profound Energy.","All these needed to be completed within two hours otherwise the practitioner whose Profound Energy was depleted completely would really become a dead person completely, totally unable to be revived.","However, to Li Moying, this method of treatment was equivalent to no cure at all.","According to the refinement rules in the Qilin tablet, spiritual beast Qilin would not possibly save him.","His current condition was equivalent to being sentenced to death, with no possibility of revival.","When Qilin saw this, it couldn’t help but sigh.","Such an exceptional genius and he actually met with his demise like that?"]},{"number":1568,"title":"Chapter 1568 - Full moon again (1)","paragraphs":["Not knowing if his luck was simply too great or just too bad.","Under such scarce Heaven and Earth Profound Qi in Soaring Heavens Continent, to be able to have god grade innate talent and to successfully activate the Qilin tablet, it originally was his fantastic luck but unfortunately, Qilin tablet’s energy wasn’t enough and it led to him being unable to leave.....","“Sigh, if it was several hundred thousand years ago, such a peerless genius entering the Qilin tablet would absolutely not have such a result. You can only blame yourself for being born several hundred thousand years later.....”","Spiritual beast Qilin gave a long sigh and paced back to its original spot as it prowled down again.","Since Li Moying was undoubtedly dead, it had no more reason to continue attacking him so it could slightly save some energy.","After all, Qilin tablet’s activation this time round had exhausted a large half of the Heaven and Earth Profound Qi which had been accumulated in Violet Sun Valley.","Violet Sun Valley would probably not make its appearance for the next couple thousands of years.","Following spiritual beast Qilin’s hibernation, the entire Qilin tablet regained its usual pitch dark environment.","All the raging thunder attributed energy had once again resumed back to silence.","After some time, Qilin tablet’s tablet body moved slightly as it began to slowly descend, sinking down into the ground.....","The refinement had ended and the Qilin tablet would return back to its original state.","The mechanism started slowly, giving off a slight abrasion sound.","Spiritual beast Qilin’s eyes were tightly shut as it totally didn’t detect that in the pitch dark corner without any light, the body which it had assumed was totally dead twitched slightly.....","...","Outside the Qilin tablet.","Huang Yueli hugged Little Qilin and squatted at the original spot without moving an inch as her eyes were tightly fixated onto the position of the stone tablet, totally not daring to even blink.","Since the moment when Little Qilin had fainted, the stone tablet kept showing various kinds of images.","Stone tablet’s colour kept on changing, sometimes giving off a blue colour and sometimes an abstruse violet colour.","In the sky, lightning kept on descending downwards, bolts after bolt of eye dazzling lightning bring along explosive thunder attributed energy, lighting up the dark sky into bright day light.","This scenario really was too abnormal and Huang Yueli was feeling extremely worried but there was nothing that she could do.","She had been checking on Little Qilin’s condition because as long as this little thing revived, it meant that Li Moying had successfully got past the crisis.","However, no matter how she looked left or right, up or down, Little Qilin still didn’t budged as it sprawled in her arms.","Furthermore, that little thing’s body was turned stiffer and slowly turning colder....","Huang Yueli was flustered as she simply didn’t know what she should do!","As this was an ordinary encounter, she could still think of ways to save him but Li Moying was now in the refinement so even if she wanted to go save him, she might possibly be more of a hindrance than a help.","Moreover speaking, this was Cloudy Qilin Clan’s refinement grounds. As a Sacred Phoenix Race’s practitioner, her ability was naturally suppressed and had no way to decode the mechanisms and arrays.","Just as Huang Yueli’s brows were tightly knitted while in deep thoughts, the stone tablet’s purple light suddenly faded.","The sky no longer had thunder and lightning and had turned exceptionally silent.","Everything seemed to have gone back to the original state before Li Moying had gone in.","That block of tall stone tablet stood upright in the original position and the Qilin totem which had been activated by Li Moying’s blood no longer shone. It looked no different from an ordinary piece of stone tablet.","“This... What is going on now? Has the refinement ended?”"]},{"number":1569,"title":"Chapter 1569 - Full moon again (2)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli frowned as she sized up the stone tablet while looking at it from top to bottom.","This really looked a little too abnormal!","Earlier it was still dark and gloomy as lighting and thunder kept on booming and now it suddenly turned peaceful? As though that raging electric current energy had totally not existed before.","Generally speaking, to have such a matter happening only meant that the refinement had already ended.","No matter if Li Moying had successfully passed through the stage or failed in the middle, anyway, it should have ended.","But not knowing why, Huang Yueli started feeling extremely uneasy, as though some accident would happen.","She couldn’t help but hugged Little Qilin tighter only to discover that it had laid straight in her arms, as though it had died.....","“Hey little thing, wake up!! Damn, what’s going on? Li Moying, come out quickly!! Passing the refinement, raising your ability, although these are important, but it’s not as important as your life! Can you stop making others get so worried for you?”","Huang Yueli bit her lips as she waited for Li Moying’s appearance.","Since the refinement had ended, then no matter what the result was, he definitely needed to come out.","By then, she ought to educate her own fiancé properly, to let him know that he was now a man with a family and could not play around with his life any longer!","However, she waited for a long time and yet Li Moying didn’t appear.","The stone tablet stood erect at its original position, high, mighty and motionless.","Huang Yueli initially didn’t think much of it but as time went by, her brows knitted tighter and tighter.","“Why hasn’t he come out yet? Could it be that he encountered the same thing as me previously, thrown to soak into some Qilin blood after the refinement? But it had been an entire day and night, so he should have been done right?”","Another three days and three nights passed by.","Today evening, at the stone tablet’s position, a burst of “clank clank clank” sound was heard.","Huang Yueli who sat in meditation nearby heard the sound and immediately opened her eyes.","Just one look and it made her have an abrupt change of colour!","The stone tablet in front of her actually descended into the ground slowly and from the looks of it, it seemed to be retracting downwards into the ground!","How could such a thing have happened? Li Moying wasn’t out yet! Why did the stone tablet suddenly disappear??","Huang Yueli let go of Little Qilin and shot right up to the stone tablet.","“How could this happen! Stop, quickly stop!”","She was shrilling at the top of her voice as she stretched out her hand to attempt to touch the stone tablet.","These days, she had been feeling extremely bored and had carefully observed the stone tablet’s structure. Based on her armament refining innate talent, she was still able to understand a little on the mechanism in the stone tablet.","But even so, there was no way she could enter the stone tablet because this kind of god","levelled mechanism which used blood to operate it, the prerequisite to control it was to have the bloodline of the Cloudy Qilin Clan.","But now, she couldn’t be bothered any longer as she retrieved several long sword from her realm ring and left it stuck in the chinks in the ground where the stone tablet was, in an attempt to stop the stone tablet from sinking downwards.","These long swords were refined out of extremely solid Muddy Sky Rock. Even if it was a ninth stage realm practitioner, he would find it hard to break. Any single one sword was priceless! It was enough to buy off more than half of the entire Celestial Light Sect.","But even so, a solid hard Profound Weapon like that was still unable to obstruct the stone tablet from sinking downwards.","It couldn’t even slow down the descending speed at all.","The sound “clack clack clack” kept on resounding.","The long swords’ breaking sound was heard and the priceless Profound Armament which was worth hundred thousands of high grade spirit stones had all turned to scrap within an instance!"]},{"number":1570,"title":"Chapter 1570 - Full moon again (3)","paragraphs":["But Huang Yueli couldn’t be bothered about these Profound Armaments as she was now terrified to the extreme!","Even when she had met a life and death crisis, she hadn’t been that anxious!","“Li Moying! What the hell are you playing at! Why haven’t you come out yet!!!”","Stone tablet continued to descend and not too long later, it had already descended by half of its height.","Huang Yueli tried to think of various ways but was still unable to stop it completely.","“Damn it! Why can’t it be stopped??”","She furiously lost her rationality as her fist smashed onto the stone tablet.","The next moment, the Sacred Phoenix Race’s practitioner suffered a backlash as she was sent flying out, crashing heavily onto the ground and fainted.","Because of that, she failed to notice that in the dark night, a full moon slowly rose from the ground level.","Yet another full moon night... had descended upon them.","Huang Yueli lost consciousness for more than four hours before she regained her consciousness as her head was still throbbing in pain.","She used her hand to hold up her head and her brows creased, “Really enough, what huge feud does Cloudy Qilin Clan and Sacred Phoenix Race have against each other? Isn’t it just a stone tablet? I can’t even touch it at all!”","Thinking of the place where the stone tablet stood erect earlier, it was now totally empty as there was nothing to be seen at all.","The ground was extremely flat, totally unable to tell that there was once an intricate mechanism which had once stood there.","Huang Yueli climbed up from the ground with her steely green face.","Since things had come to such a pass, she knew that there was no use to be anxious. Li Moying had absolutely met with an accident or trouble which he had no way to solve hence he did not show himself. She must first find out what had happened before she could come out with ways to help him.","Anyway, she absolutely would not believe that a man like Li Moying would die here so easily!","“Right, absolutely impossible! Li Moying is definitely still alive! He couldn’t possibly be dead, impossible!”","Huang Yueli clenched her fists and tried her best to convince herself. Even though she was feeling sure in her heart that all these were possibly her own deception to herself but if she didn’t hypnotise herself like that, she knew that she would definitely be devastated.","She refused to believe any possibility of Li Moying had encountered a mishap!","After Huang Yeuli hypnotised herself, she started to revolve around the core region to observe carefully, trying to find out the origins of operating the stone tablet mechanism.","“All the mechanisms have a way to decode it. I cannot do it means my standard isn’t enough yet... and there must be something which I had failed to notice....” She kept on thinking as she surveyed the area to search for clues.","But as she searched, she suddenly felt that something wasn’t quite right.","The surroundings turned quieter and quieter, so silent that she could hear her own breathing.","Huang Yueli’s heart started to palpitate faster and faster.","Although Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region was originally very quiet, but it had never been so quiet to such a state, as though the surrounding air was going to be completely frozen.","Not right! Something was extremely not right!","Huang Yueli turned her head around to see that at the original stone tablet’s position where it stood erect, there were three huge sinister looking magical beasts prowling around that area!","Their bodies gave off a powerful aura which made one’s hairs stand. This was the aura which ninth levelled magical beasts would reveal.","Huang Yueli’s mind suddenly flashed past the words which Li Moying said to her.","—He had defeated the three ninth levelled magical beasts before the stone tablet appeared!"]},{"number":1571,"title":"Chapter 1571 - Full moon again (4)","paragraphs":["Apparently, the appearance of these three magical beasts was because the mechanism of the core region had been reset to the original state.","Actually, this point was totally expected but as she was agitated by Li Moying’s disappearance earlier that she had lost the usual cool and rationality that she usually had hence she failed to notice that such a thing had happened.","But now, the appearance of the three magical beasts right here meant that.... she was in deep trouble!","If Huang Yueli’s ability was strong enough, then actually this was a very good opportunity.","She only had to think of a way to defeat these three magical beasts and she would be able to make that stone tablet appear at the same position once again.","Only this was with her current ability, it wasn’t possible for her to charge in to save him but on the contrary, she would be sending herself to doom instead...","Huang Yueli’s thoughts flew swiftly past her mind as she quickly made a decision.","A wise woman knew better than to fight when the odds were against her!","She nudged backwards silently, preparing to leave this dangerous place and preserve her life first.","But she had just moved when those three magical beasts turned around to face her.","Three pairs of vicious looking gazes all fell onto her at the same time and under the ray from the moonlight, it looked exceptionally sinister.","Huang Yueli gave a dry laugh, “He he, this.... don’t be mistaken, I’m not here to take part in the test... you need not pay too much attention to me, I’ll leave this instance.....”","However those three magical beasts gazes were fixated onto her rightly and furthermore the muscles on their bodies turned taut as they put on a posture which looked as though they were ready to attack at any point of time.","Huang Yueli scooped up little Qilin by her side, “I say... this... I have a spiritual beast Qilin for protection! We are all from the same family so you need not muster large forces..... AH!”","She had been long-winded still hoping for a slight glimmer of hope for little Qilin to emit out a little bit of spiritual beast aura, so as to stun these few magical beasts.","But apparently, all these were in vain.","How would the king among ninth levelled magical beasts possibly be scared off by a spiritual beast which was still in its infancy stage?","Not waiting for her to finish her words, the three magical beasts all simultaneously gave off an earth shattering howl, as they ferociously charged towards her!","Huang Yueli immediately stuffed Little Qilin into her sleeve as she turned around and ran with all her might!","While she was running, she threw out various kinds of Profound Armaments in bid to obstruct the magical beasts from pursuing her footsteps.","However, her ability against the ninth levelled magical beasts was just too huge and even though she had already utilised her Agility Dance Steps, raising her speed to the highest but the distance between her and the magical beasts kept on decreasing.","One of the magical beasts waved its claw and a bright striking thunderbolt descended from the sky as it struck towards her.","Huang Yueli hurriedly turned as she evaded just in time, with the thunderbolt just grazing past her.","She caught sight of the ground with her peripheral view as it was filled with multiple meters deep cracks and her heart couldn’t help but be frightened: Luckily her reaction was swift enough, otherwise wouldn’t she have been split into two halves directly?","But her current state wasn’t any better. She had managed to avoid one thunderbolt but it didn’t represent that she was able to evade every single bolt so it was best for her to leave their attack range as soon as possible.","Huang Yueli ran quickly as she observed the surrounding situation.","The three magical beasts behind her had entered into a range where they would attack her hence they kept on making their moves towards her.","Bolts after bolts of lightning repeating continuously as it rained down on her head, almost sealing off all the places which she could hide.","Huang Yueli moved left and right as she gave everything she got to evade the attacks."]},{"number":1572,"title":"Chapter 1572 - Full moon again (5)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli was feeling extremely fortunate right now that she had obtained the inheritance of Agility Dance Steps in Sacred Phoenix Race’s refinement tower and after continuous days of hard training, she managed to derive at a small realm.","This god grade move Profound Skill wasn’t proficient in speed but in evading attacks!","With the Agility Dance Steps, she successfully evaded most of the electric attacks but a small portion of the lightning still grazed past her body.","These external injuries weren’t too serious and mainly those were mere abrasions. What was most embarrassing was that her hair had curled up in different directions from the lightning currents at near distance.","She just needed to use her imagination to know what kind of bombastic hair condition she had right now. She gauged that she looked no different from a porcupine.","“Luckily Moying isn’t around otherwise it would affect my little public elected perfect image!”","Huang Yueli mumbled while finding joy in her sorrow but before she was done, a bolt of lightning struck her right back area.","She forcibly increased her qi and flew for a distance before she narrowly escaped it.","But her speed had now been raised to her limit and using this speed to advance was actually very taxing on her Profound Energy which was also shocking. She could clearly feel that the Profound Energy in her body speedily dropped drastically and not too long later, she was about to exhaust all the Profound Energy within her.","If those magical beasts chased up to her, then she would really be finished! In terms of going up directly against them, she couldn’t even defeat one ninth levelled magical beast, not to mention three of them!","Just at this life threatening crisis, Huang Yueli’s gaze shone and she barely managed to sneak a peek from the corner of her eye at the right front mountain wall, which was filled with messy disoriented notches.","To ordinary people, this seemed like sword scars which were left behind unintentionally by a practitioner when they battled.","But this made Huang Yueli’s eyes shine.","“Whoever the Senior who had left this array behind, he’s simply a life saver!”","She hurriedly shot upwards to the mountain and her right hand gesticulated an incantation as her ten fingers deftly turned into remnant images, totally unable to see the movements of her hands.","Her lips were pursed tightly as she put on a solemn expression. The speed of her hands was extremely swift as her ten fingers danced and had already become remnant images, totally unable to see the movements of her hands.","At the same time, droplets of sweat slowly slid down from the side of her forehead onto her chin.","Even though she had already recognised the defensive array which this certain senior had left behind in the refinement grounds but after several thousands of years, whether this array could be used or not was hard to say. Perhaps all the hard work which she had put in now was merely a waste of effort.","Furthermore, as she suddenly stopped, the three magical beasts behind her chased up with incredible speed as the distance between them narrowed even further.","If she was unable to activate the array in time, she would definitely be struck by lightning within a few breaths and be turned into a charred corpse!","The more critical the situation, the clearer her thoughts became.","This was the difference between top rated geniuses and ordinary practitioners. Under such circumstances, the real genius would be able to display their utmost potential!","The speed of Huang Yueli’s hands had already reached the limit, and even.... broke through the limit!","Finally when the three magical beasts were barely just ten meters away from her, the array patterns on the mountain wall suddenly lighted up.","Huang Yueli immediately took out a big handful of magical beast cores and spiritual stones from the Sky Phoenix Ring as she threw it towards the mountain wall!","Her throw was very precise. Although she had thrown out so many at one go, but each piece of magical core precisely lodged into the recess of the array.","The entire array’s patterns lighted up and an invisible barrier enveloped her within, nicely blocking out a burst of lightning which was directed at the top of her head."]},{"number":1573,"title":"Chapter 1573 - Full moon again (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","The array activated just in time and Huang Yueli just managed to scrap past the crisis.","She heaved a long sigh as she laid limp on the ground, looking at the outer electric currents sparkling as she felt super fortunate over this.","At least her luck wasn’t that bad. If not for this array which could just nicely be activated, it probably would be difficult for her to escape from this round’s death!","Three magical beasts discovered that their prey had actually escaped and all of them were raging with anger as they kept on howling outside the array and using up all their strength to make their moves. Bolts after bolts of electric currents crashed onto the array as though it didn’t require any Profound Energy.","For a moment in time, Huang Yueli was worried that this ancient array would suddenly become ineffective.","But she rejoiced at the result because. under such intense attacks, the array patterns kept on releasing dazzling rays, reflecting all the electric currents back!","“The Senior who created this array must be an Array Grandmaster! To be able to deflect three powerful magical beasts attacks, not many people are able to set this up eh?”","Huang Yeuli looked left and right. If it wasn’t for the fact that the current situation wasn’t suitable, she really wanted to do a thorough research on this array.","To be able to deflect ninth levelled magical beasts, this might probably be a god grade array.","But now was not the time for her to be distracted.","Very soon, Huang Yueli realised that although this array was able to block out the magical beasts outside, but the depletion of the magical beast cores was simply too fast.","The handful of magical beast cores which she threw out earlier were all seventh or eighth levelled magical beast cores, and those were from Li Moying who hunted for those magical beasts in Violet Sun Valley.","This kind of single attributed, pure energy and high grade magical beast cores were very durable in maintaining ordinary arrays.","But in this array, it was merely less than one hour and its energy was nearly depleted completely.","Huang Yueli had no choice but to change a new batch of magical beast cores.","But this wasn’t a good long term plan because she originally didn’t have many high levelled magical beast cores with her. As she was trapped in the array, she had no way to replenish it as well. In this way, it won’t take long before the array would collapse because of insufficient energy.","The only plan now was to pray that these three magical beasts would lose their patience soon and return to their original position.","However, not knowing what was going on, even Heavens went against her.","Huang Yueli waited and waited, and changed several magical beasts cores but those magical beasts continued to stubbornly prowl in wait outside the array.","Huang Yueli put her hand into Sky Phoenix Ring’s storage space to discover that she didn’t have much seventh grade magical beast cores left as her expression turned extremely grave.","“These magical beasts are really too much, haven’t they seen any beauty before? Don’t they know that they look very ugly? Why must they keep following me!”","Although she spat out these words of ridicule, Huang Yueli actually had an understanding in her heart.","This was probably related to the Sacred Phoenix Race.","The valley’s magical beasts seemed to be attracted towards fire attributed energy naturally. Previously when Little Phoenix exhibited it’s Profound Energy, it suffered a large group of magical beasts’ attacks.","Earlier when she was running for her life, as she had no choice, she had to exhibit her Profound Skill.","In this way, it turned her into a plate of tender fatty meat, luring those magical beasts appetites as they pursued after her relentlessly.","Huang Yueli’s brows creased tightly as she tried her best to think of corresponding ways to deal with this matter.","But this was destined to be solution-less. The array’s energy was about to exhaust whereas she.... had no place to escape to!","She only heard a loud “boom” and the array patterns suddenly lit up."]},{"number":1574,"title":"Chapter 1574 - Full moon again (7)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Following that, it collapsed completely.","Huang Yueli had already made preparations in advance.","Right before those magical beasts had reacted in time, she had already gained the initiative by striking first as she threw out all the thunder flame balls she had with her.","At the same time, she turned around and escaped for her life at the first instance!","Although it was possible that she might meet with her demise this time round, but she still had to put up some final struggles.","She would not possibly admit defeat until the very last moment.","Alas, no matter how swift her reaction was, there was no way she could escape from the encirclement of those three ninth levelled magical beasts.","This time round, there weren’t any more surprises and she no longer discovered any new arrays so she was quickly chased up by those three magical beasts.","Ninth levelled magical beasts’ intelligence were very high and they seemed to know that she was a difficult character to deal with hence they decisively split up into three directions, encircling her in the middle.","Huang Yueli looked to her left and right as the corners of her lips couldn’t help but twitched.","This time round, where was she supposed to run off to? She indeed had her wings clipped?","Before she could even think of any idea, the three magical beasts had simultaneously raised up their claws.","Three peerlessly frigid lightning tore the sky apart with astonishing might as it struck down towards the top of her head.","No one would be spared from this kind of lightning attack.","Huang Yueli was faced with a desperate predicament but instead she calmed down as her lips couldn’t help but curled into an arc.","Actually she had a faint premonition that Li Moying..... had not appeared till now meant that he definitely met with danger and there was a ninety nine percent chance that he had already died during the refinement. She tried so hard earlier because she didn’t believe in it, all just to hypnotise herself.","There was actually plenty of evidence to verify how the truth was.","But now, she finally could not deceive herself any further.","Anyway, she was about to die right away.....","This way was rather good as well. The both of them could share a mutual death, buried together in this mystic region where it was cut off from the rest of the world, wasn’t it a fortunate thing? Anyway, since Li Moying was already dead, she didn’t want to stay alive on her own. What was the meaning of living alone?","Moreover.....","“Am I considered to be buried into the grave of Cloudy Qilin Clan? If those Seniors from Cloudy Qilin Clan in God Realm knew about it, would they explode from anger?”","Not knowing why, this sudden thought popped out from her head.","At this moment, lightning had already descended onto the top of her head....","...","Moonlight was like frost.","Just as Huang Yueli was busy escaping from the three magical beasts, a full moon slowly rose up from the level ground, gradually up into the sky.","This day’s moonlight was especially cold but bright, showering down it’s splendour and even dispersing quite an amount of fog which shrouded Violet Sun Valley all year long.","Moonlight shone on the location where the stone tablet was and the sand on the ground suddenly started to swirl up even though there was no wind, as though some invisible strength was driving it.","In the ground where the Qilin tablet was deeply buried, it was filled with complete darkness and complete silence.","The body which had not moved at all in the corner suddenly twitched.","Spiritual beast Qilin seemed to sense something as it raised its head and looked towards the corner.","However, the surrounding was still dead silent.","Qilin felt that it probably had been hallucinating. How could a dead person possibly come back to life? It must have been thinking too much.","After verifying that, it buried its head back onto its front legs.","This time round, it sunk into deep sleep with a peace of mind.","Not knowing how long later, the person in the corner started to twitch again.","Immediately following that, it twitched one more time.","Again, and again."]},{"number":1575,"title":"Chapter 1575 - Past and present life (1)","paragraphs":["If there was light in the Qilin tablet, then spiritual beast Qilin would definitely be able to see it clearly that the man Li Moying whom it had already assumed was dead, had his entire face turned red as his forehead creased tightly bearing a painful expression.","The sweat on his forehead kept on dripping and very soon, the ground had a wet patch.","At the present moment, his entire body felt as though it was soaked in hot oil where every single part of him felt excruciating pain.","Not only that, he even sensed that his body which had originally exhausted all his Profound Energy had suddenly been filled up and moreover, it rose dramatically in an instance, as though it was about to split open all his meridians!","Following the passing of time, the sweat on Li Moying’s body sprouted even more and his clothes were entirely drenched in sweat.","His consciousness was sometimes clear and sometimes blurry as a large amount of images flashed around in his mind, scene after scene, from his past life to the present life, all mixed together.","While in a trance, he seemed to have gone back to fifteen years ago.","...","On a biting cold evening in the most northern part of Soaring Heavens Continent.","He stood in the snow as he worked tirelessly to hurry to where Huang Yueli was located.","As he was in the middle of advancement, he forcibly stopped it and came out of his closed door cultivation hence Mu Chengying suffered a serious backlash. His cultivation dropped back all the way from ninth stage realm peak to ninth stage realm mid-level and every single meridian in his body suffered varying degrees of damage.","For this kind of situation, if he didn’t stop to meditate and recuperate, then it was possible that he might not be able to return back to his original peak condition, not to mention breakthrough in the future. To a practitioner, that meant that his future was ruined.","However, Mu Chengying couldn’t care less as he forcibly suppressed the urge to throw up blood, clenching his teeth tightly and still increased his speed to the limit.","He only had one thought in his mind and that was to go save Huang Yueli! Regardless of any cost!","“Li’er, I’ll be there immediately, hand on and wait for me!”","But he was still one step too late.","By the time he reached the place where Huang Yueli was trapped, he only caught sight of the scene where Huang Yueli detonated her own dantian as flames filled the entire scene, turning up the temperature as raging fire attributed energy instantly consumed the entire Ice Fields!","There were several ninth stage realm practitioners around Huang Yueli and they had turned into charred bodies instantly. Even the layers of ice which never melted for a long time in the Northern Ice Fields, had a huge melted patch.","“LI’ER——!!!”","Mu Chengying eyes opened wide as he risked his life and rushed over.","But he could no longer reverse anything.","Huang Yueli burst into a fire image right in front of his eyes. Right after it killed all the enemies which had surrounded her, the flame seemed to revolve around Mu Chengying longingly once before dissipating slowly into the sky.","Mu Chengying stretched out his hand but didn’t manage to grab hold of anything.","He fell onto the ground in extreme pain, for a very, very long time.....","...","A month later, Blue Profound Sect.","“Mu Chengying! You.... you trash!”","Liu Buyan barged into Blue Profound Sect flustered and exasperatedly as he directly pushed the guards who were blocking him as he entered Mu Chengying’s residence directly.","The minute he saw him, he didn’t give an explanation and immediately punched Mu Chengying on his face as he broke out swearing at him.","“Aren’t you very incredible? Aren’t you labelled as the number one top expert in Soaring Heavens Continent and you’re invincible? Since you’re so incredible, why can’t you even protect your beloved woman?? Why... did you let Huang Yueli die in front of you!! You’re really a piece of trash! If I had known that you are so useless, why did I even give her.....”","Give her up to you....."]},{"number":1576,"title":"Chapter 1576 - Past and present life (2)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan choked with emotions but finally still swallowed the last few words back.","Since things had come to such a pass, this feeling of his would never be made known to anyone forever.","Liu Buyan howled wildly as he grabbed Mu Chengying’s collar, shaking him violently.","But very quickly, he realised that something was wrong.","Although the two of them were both in the ninth stage realm, but the disparity between their potentials was actually very huge. If it was usual, how would Mu Chengying possibly allow him to offend him in such a way and not fly into a rage?","When Liu Buyan thought of this, he turned his head and had a shock.","Mu Chengying’s face was ashen green and his eyes were lifeless with a disheartened look, as though nothing could possibly affect him. Even though his collar was being clutched by Liu Buyan, he seemed as though he had not noticed anything, only immersing him in his own world.","Liu Buyan saw his condition and was so shocked that his hand shook as he loosened his grip, “You.... what happened to you?”","Mu Chengying seemed as though he just realised that Liu Buyan had just arrived as he lifted his eyes to look at him and gave a miserable smile, “What’s wrong with me? What you say is correct, I’m certainly a piece of trash! I had once vowed to heaven that I will use my life to protect her, to let her be the same as when I first met her, without any worries... but, I actually let her die in front of me.....”","Mu Chengying buried his face into his hands as his heavily suppressed pained voice rang dully.","“Just a little longer, just a little longer... why didn’t she wait for me! Why can’t I be a little faster.... If I had got out of my closed door cultivation earlier, perhaps she wouldn’t have died.....”","Liu Buyan looked at his grieved look as though he wished he was dead, as his heart was stunned and developed a little bit of sympathy towards him.","Towards Huang Yueli’s demise, Mu Chengying’s pain was definitely not any lesser than his....","However, this thought just flashed by and he quickly reacted over.","Why should he sympathise with Mu Chengying? A man who couldn’t even protect his own woman, other than trash, what else could he be?","He sneered, “Right, who asked you to be late by that one step? Who asked you to only have cultivation in your mind, and not her!”","Mu Chengying immediately refuted his words, “No, it’s not like that... Li’er to me, had always been the most important....”","“Who are you trying to bluff? These words of yours might be effective towards other people but towards me? Don’t I understand you well enough?”","Liu Buyan’s gaze which was fixated on him seemed as though it was about to sprout fire!","“In your heart, of course cultivation is much more important. No matter how important Yueli was, she still could not be compared to your cultivation, isn’t it? You’re still trying to lie to me? Let me ask you, your closed door cultivation this time round, is it to breakthrough to tenth stage realm! If it wasn’t because something happened to Yueli mid-way, have you already broken through to tenth stage realm? Don’t tell me you are not aware that after the tenth stage realm, you will ascend to God Realm! You will leave Soaring Heavens Continent, isn’t it?”","Mu Chengying was stump with this question as his face flushed red, totally unable to say a word.","Liu Buyan looked at his expression and his heart felt both infuriated and pained!","“Have you thought about what would happen to Yueli after you leave Soaring Heavens Continent? You have plenty of enemies in Soaring Heavens Continent and you’re leaving her alone here? Let me tell you, her death is caused by you! Even if nothing happened to her one month ago, after you leave, you will eventually meet with the same end! This totally isn’t coincidental!”","“No, it’s not like that!” Mu Chengying frowned, “I know that all this is my fault but I really hadn’t thought about leaving Li’er here alone. I have prepared.....”"]},{"number":1577,"title":"Chapter 1577 - Past and present life (3)","paragraphs":["“Prepare? Prepare what?” Liu Buyan totally refused to listen to him finishing his words as he snorted disdainfully, “After Yueli obtained the Sky Phoenix Ring, it was because of you standing behind her which was why no one dared to covet it! Ever since the news of you going into closed door cultivation to prepare for breakthrough tenth stage realm broke out, numerous people laid their eyes on her! Don’t tell me you totally didn’t sense anything at all! But you still went into closed door cultivation, isn’t it?”","“If you really cared about her, would you allow her to go to Northern Ice Fields on her own? You should stay by her side at all times!”","“If... If... one really had placed her in your heart, that person would be willing to follow her to the ends of the earth! It’s until now that I finally understand why she refused to agree to marry you! Because your feelings always have a prerequisite and that is under the circumstances that your cultivation is not affected in any way, then you will place her into your consideration!”","“You... You are that kind of selfish b*strd!”","Liu Buyan completely blasted out everything he had hid inside his heart for so many years, as he blurted everything out at once!","He had once forced himself to give up, suppressing the feelings he had inside.","That was because he felt that his own potential wasn’t powerful enough and he was unable to protect the stunning and talented lady like Huang Yueli!","He originally thought Mu Chengying could, Mu Chengying’s innate talent and resoluteness deigned him to become Soaring Heavens Continent’s number one! Further, he appeared to love Huang Yueli so deeply.....","Liu Buyan had once thought that Mu Chengying was much more suitable for Huang Yueli.","In order not to spoil the friendship between Mu Chengying and himself, and to let the woman in his heart to have a better life, he stepped down reluctantly.","But now, he finally realised that... he was wrong!","Perhaps he would never be able to chase up to Mu Chengying in terms of cultivation, but at least.... he would always place Huang Yueli in first place, willing to accompany her to anywhere in the world! Even if he would not be able to protect her eventually, he would never let her die in front of his eyes!","Mu Chengying sat despondently on the ground as the deep pain swallowed him completely. The throbbing pain in his heart made him unable to breath.","“It’s not like that, I’m not what you think! Li’er... she really is more important than anything else.....”","He mumbled to himself but also knew that he had no way to explain himself.","It wasn’t that he didn’t place her in first place, but for the longest time, he had always assumed that as long as he was stronger, only then would he be able to protect her properly. Only when he was so strong that no one could match up to him, then would no one dared to offend his beloved woman.","Since the day he stepped into Sky Emperor City, it was love at first sight for him when he caught a glimpse of the graceful Young Priestess of the Mythical Flame Palace. All his hard work was so that he was worthy of her. Later on, it was to allow her to do whatever she wanted with a peace of mind, to behave unscrupulously.....","Everything he did was because of her....","Before deciding to advance, he already had a plan which was to ascend together with Huang Yueli.... he was only afraid that Huang Yueli might not be willing to do so, hence he thought of acting first and reporting later.","Whoever knew that this little intelligence of his made other people who were coveting his position mistook that he no longer placed Huang Yueli in his heart, hence deciding to make a move to kill her.","All these, ultimately, were all because of him.","So when Liu Buyan said he was the one who caused Huang Yueli’s death, he indeed had no way to refute it.....","Furthermore, no matter what he said now was of no use.....","“Mu Chengying, this is my last time coming to look for you! From now onwards, we will go our separate ways! I, Liu Buyan..... don’t have a friend like you!”"]},{"number":1578,"title":"Chapter 1578 - Past and present life (4)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan’s heart grieved severely as he could no longer face Mu Chengying. Just from seeing him, he couldn’t wait to strangle this former pal to death!","Liu Buyan left the words of severing their relationship and turned around to leave!","Mu Chengying sat in the room alone for a long, long time.....","He actually had not sensed when Liu Buyan actually left.","Even when his four guardians came over to persuade him, he totally had no response.","In his heart, there was only one thought, which was.... if he had another chance, he would stay by his Li’er’s side every single moment, not letting her to go take any risks alone....","If.... there was another chance.....","Suddenly he seemed to have thought of something as he violently shook his head and stood up immediately.","The four guardians standing guard at the door heard a noise and stood up one by one to check things out.","“Sect Master, are you better? Do you want....”","However, Mu Chengying seemed as though he had not heard anything as he directly walked past them, heading straight towards Blue Profound Sect’s scripture depository.","This place was the largest depository where all the scriptures are kept, as it had the most amount of ancient records.","Mu Chengying stayed in there for an entire seven days and seven nights without sleeping.","“I definitely remember... I obviously remember seeing it before around here.....”","He tried his best to search through all the books as his heart was in a flurry. Anyone who saw him, would definitely feel that... he had already gone nuts!","When Mu Chengying finally reappeared, even his guardians had a great shock.","“Sect Master, you.....”","Mu Chengying’s look was no different from a dead person, only with his eyes gleaming with a raging glow!","“Everyone.... Do as I tell you to!”","...","Two months later.","Liu Buyan charged into Blue Profound Sect once again and this time, he was even more exasperated than before!","He simply could not believe such a thing! Mu Chengying.... had he gone nuts! He could even do this sort of thing?","However, even before he reached the top, he was already blocked in the middle of the path by Mu Chengying’s guardians.","“Master Liu, please halt! Sect Master is now in closed door cultivation and has instructed this subordinate to not allow anyone to head up to interrupt him.”.... Especially Liu Buyan.","The guardian spoke without any expression.","Liu Buyan did not hesitate as he struck out a move towards his chest!","“Make way! Don’t tell me you don’t know what your Sect Master is trying to do! Mu Chengying has gone crazy, are you guys going crazy as well?? How can he believe this sort of thing? Do you know what kind of price he has to pay? Get lost!”","Saying that, he shouted towards the mountain door, “Mu Chengying, Mu Chengying! Come out right now!”","Guardian’s ability was far from Liu Buyan’s and after taking a palm strike from him, he immediately threw up a mouthful of blood. But he still abided by his duties as he blocked the middle of the road, not retreating a single step at all.","“Master Liu, please don’t make things difficult for me. Sect Master he has already instructed.....”","“Instruct my a*se!” The usually graceful man of the troubled times finally couldn’t help but spew vulgarities, “Don’t tell me that you can open your eyes wide to see him do such things? That is much more painful than death.... no way! Move aside, don’t force me to kill someone!”","“But...”","“What? You don’t want to save him? If you do, then scram to one side!”","The guardian’s hand clenched into a fist as he struggled for a very long time before finally nudging a step to one side.","His life was saved by Mu Chengying and this was the first time in his life to defy Mu Chengying’s command."]},{"number":1579,"title":"Chapter 1579 - Past and present life (5)","paragraphs":["But he couldn’t not do that!","Because he really didn’t want to see, Sect Master Mu whom everyone worshipped falling to that kind of ending!","Moreover now, Miss Huang was no longer around so if there was anyone who could persuade him, it would be Liu Buyan!","Liu Buyan took quick steps and rushed into Mu Chengying’s mountain valley which he went into closed door cultivation in.","At this present moment, it was already midnight and the sky was filled with stars with the moon especially bright, illuminating every corner of the entire valley.","When Liu Buyan charged into the valley, he saw Mu Chengying sitting cross legged on an empty space under the moonlight. From the looks of it, he seemed to be cultivating.","Liu Buyan saw this and was extremely surprised.","He thought that he would see.....","“You... what are you doing?”","Mu Chengying suddenly opened his eyes as a cold smile hung by the corners of his lips, “Master Liu, what a rare visitor! If I don’t remember wrongly, you seem to have said this yourself that you will never step into Blue Profound Sect anymore and you no longer wanted to see me. Such a short span of time... and you’re already regretting it?”","When Liu Buyan heard that, he recovered from his shock.","“You... stop acting! I’ve already heard that you’re getting your man to collect.... That thing! And you’ve already collected everything! I know what you’re trying to do!”","Mu Chengying smiled faintly, “What do I want to do? What do you know? I’m collecting that thing because Li’er loved it before and I’m using it to remember her, why? Can’t I do that? What does it have to do with you?”","He made it sound so easy that for an instance, Liu Buyan almost assumed that he had really made a misjudgement, that Mu Chengying really didn’t have that intention.","But very soon, Liu Buyan saw the evident greenish black colour under his eyes which was caused by the repeated depletion of Profound Energy.","“Do you think I’m an idiot! That ancient record was discovered by the both of us that year! I know what you’re thinking of doing, you’re nuts you’re really nuts! That is merely a subjective idea left behind by the predecessors and even the senior who wrote that ancient record had never done such a thing! That would definitely not succeed!”","“How do you know it’s not possible!” Mu Chengying’s idea was exposed by him so he totally couldn’t be bothered to continue acting, “As long as there’s a hint of hope, I will give it a shot!”","Liu Buyan shook his head in disbelief, “Do you know what you’re saying? Life and death are ruled by fate! The dead cannot be revived! Moreover, Yueli’s soul had been scattered, it’s not an ordinary death! My pain isn’t any lesser than yours but we must learn to accept the truth! Some things, since it has already happened, there would be no way to reverse it forever.....”","“Truth? What truth? How am I supposed to accept it?? I totally cannot accept it!!”","Mu Chengying suddenly shouted out as he broke down, rebutting Liu Buyan’s words. All the pretence of being calm and steady suddenly turned into naught.","Liu Buyan gritted his teeth as he glowered at him angrily, “Cannot accept it? Now then you say you cannot accept it! What were you doing before that? Do you think that by doing this, it would lessen your guilt? Did you think that by doing this, Yueli would feel happy in her grave? You can’t regain anything at all! All you want is to reduce your own guilt!”","Mu Chengying’s thoughts seemed as though the nail had hit on the head as he started to shake violently.","But after a while, he forced himself to calm down, “Up to you on whatever you want to say. No one can stop me on the things I want to do! Haven’t we already severed our friendship? Why have you still not scrammed away?”"]},{"number":1580,"title":"Chapter 1580 - Past and present life (6)","paragraphs":["Liu Buyan was so infuriated that his face turned green!","“Right, I’m acting low, coming to stop you even after our friendship has been severed! But I came not because of you. I just don’t want Yueli to see a trash like you tangling onto her even when she’s down there! If you’re in a hurry to go die, no one will stop you!”","Mu Chengying’s gaze swept towards him as his voice was incomparably cold.","“Liu Buyan, do you know why you can’t win me?”","This sentence was cold and calm, but it seemed like lightning striking onto Liu Buyan!","He thought he had concealed it very well but he didn’t expect that this little thought of his had been completely seen through by Mu Chengying!","Just as Liu Buyan was so shocked until he couldn’t move, Mu Chengying’s words continued to ring in his ears.","“This is because... you’re a rational man, whereas I.... am a lunatic! You will keep thinking that because you don’t have enough power so you will only start wooing her after you have made a name for yourself. You will give her up to me because you cannot protect her. You will also not do anything meaningless just because she’s dead, only silently mourning for her, but I.... am different!”","“I only know that I want her, I want her to be mine, whether she’s up in the skies or deep down in the earth, I will follow her in life and death! She can forget about casting me aside!”","“Perhaps you’re right, all I am doing might be useless but even if I can’t do anything, at least I could try to follow her in having my soul scattered, to have a feel of what kind of feeling it is?”","Mu Chengying was saying that and he actually smiled.","However, that extraordinary good looking face now seemed especially sinister. Accompanied with that smile, it made one feel terrified.","“Mu Chengying... you’ve really gone nuts!”","“I am nuts.... From the first day I met her, I have already gone nuts!”","Mu Chengying rose up his head suddenly and laughed wildly, “Let me be a complete lunatic this time! I’ve already said whatever I should so you can leave now!”","After his words, he waved his sleeve ferociously and an incomparably powerful Profound Energy came sweeping towards Liu Buyan.","Liu Buyan’s power originally wasn’t very strong and as he was caught off guard, he totally had no form of resistance as he was directly sent flying out. He flew for a dozen or more feet before he fell onto the ground.","But he wasn’t hurt in any way as he turned around and rushed into the valley once again.","However this time round, the valley was enveloped by a huge array. Many coloured array patterns kept on lighting up from the exterior of the array, blocking his view thus he was unable to see the situation inside at all.","Liu Buyan wanted to charge in but the minute he got near, he was expelled by the array.","“Mu Chengying, Mu Chengying!!”","He called out anxiously but there was no response at all.....","A burst of seven coloured flowing lights charged up into the sky.","...","Li Moying’s head became more and more painful as numerous memories instantly surged into his brain.","These memories were too complex, as though it was going to split his head apart. It caused him to be dizzy as his brain hurt so much as though it was about to explode.","At the same time, his body sensed the brilliance of the full moon and the Profound Energy in his body grew more and more abundant, as though it was going to flow out from his body!","His entire body was in unbearable pain and he finally couldn’t help but gave a moan.","“Hng.....”","Not only that, while he was unconscious, initially he turned around and struggled repeatedly as though he wasn’t able to bear the pain from the inside of his body.","Li Moying’s groan became louder and louder.","Spiritual beast Qilin which laid on the centre position of the stone tablet sensed something as it slowly opened its eyes."]},{"number":1581,"title":"Chapter 1581 - Rise from the dead (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","At the beginning, Qilin was still a little dazed, apparently not understanding why the Qilin tablet had already returned back underground and it would still suddenly be awoken.","But immediately following that, the intermittent moans from the corner made it suddenly awoken.","Qilin’s pair of bronze bell eyes opened as it swept towards the corner and only one look and it was completely shocked.","Although it was absolute darkness, but spiritual beast’s vision far surpassed humans hence it could clearly see the figure was kept on twitching on the ground.","“What’s going on? Hadn’t this little fellow already died completely? How did he suddenly start to move again?”","Qilin raised its front paw and rubbed its eyes, thinking that it had developed a hallucination.","However, the truth was placed right in front of it.","The ‘dead corpse’ in the corner actually rose from the dead!","“This isn’t possible eh? Earlier I obviously witnessed it with my own eyes that his Profound Energy was totally exhausted and under this kind of situation, he would breathe his last within two hours! How is it possible that he actually came back to life? Something’s wrong, this is not right!”","Qilin muttered to itself as it stood up from the ground and walked towards the corner.","The minute it got nearer, it could see even clearly.","Li Moying kept rolling around as he cramped up, apparently suffering a huge amount of pain. Qilin had even sensed that there was an extremely powerful energy in his body, which would explode out at any point of time!","Li Moying’s condition was extremely bad but no matter how bad it was, he... was still alive!","Moreover, from the way that his eyelids trembled, it seemed as though it wouldn’t take long for him to open his eyes to regain consciousness.","“This... what should I do? He actually came back to live in such a manner!”","This time round, Qilin was really dazed.","It had never committed such a serious mistake, to cut off the refinement while the person in the Qilin tablet was still alive, and even bringing that live person underground!","This was a complete violation to the Qilin tablet’s operating procedure!","Moreover, since Li Moying wasn’t dead, this refinement shouldn’t have ended. Could it be that.... he should go up ahead to deal with Li Moying a fatal blow before he regain consciousness completely?","To tell the truth, spiritual beast Qilin could not bear to do so.","It was experienced and knowledgeable so how would it not know that a peerless expert like Li Moying was extremely rare in the entire God Realm, enough to become Cloudy Qilin Clan’s future leader.","Earlier even after experiencing that fatal refinement, he was lucky enough to have survived. That meant that he had soaring luck and was genuinely unmatched in his generation!","If it had to kill him, it would defy heaven’s will and perhaps it might even affect the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan’s luck!","While spiritual beast Qilin was hesitating, it suddenly sensed roars of thunder coming from the sky, as a powerful suppression surfaced on its heart.","It immediately realised that this was the beginning of the operating procedure of the Qilin tablet!","If any live person entered the Qilin tablet, then it must attack that person until that person gave up or if any one of them were killed!","This was the natural regulation which spiritual beast Qilin, which had been sealed as the spirit artefact, could not defy!","Under the drive of this kind of oppression, the colour of Qilin’s eyes turned darker and darker as the rationality in its mind started to turn weaker and it’s beast nature was completely unleashed!","“RAWR——!!!”","Spiritual beast Qilin raised its neck upwards and gave a raging howl, totally unable to control itself as it pounced towards Li Moying’s body!"]},{"number":1582,"title":"Chapter 1582 - Rise from the dead (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Spiritual beast Qilin’s body moved and it brought along the hibernated thunder attributed energy within the Qilin tablet.","The entire stone tablet space was charged with the electric current power as it gave off a serene yet terrifying blue purplish glow.","This glow reflected onto Li Moying’s face, making his terribly pale complexion look no different from a dead man.","Electric currents speedily gathered into spiritual beast Qilin’s body and not too long later, it made Qilin’s aura rise to the maximum!","Following that spiritual beast Qilin’s claw waved outwards and a raging lightning kept on flickering under its claw, as though one would be torn into two halves if one was touched by it!","However, just at the instance when Qilin touched Li Moying, the originally unconscious man suddenly opened his eyes.","Qilin was now helpless but upon seeing Li Moying opening his eyes, it suddenly had a regretful thought in its mind.","No matter what, such an excellent practitioner dying here, was really a huge pity.....","But at this moment, it suddenly realised that something was wrong with Li Moying. His gaze was exceptionally cold and emotionless, so penetrative as though it could shoot through one’s soul.","From just one look, Qilin sensed a chill running down its spine!","At the same time, Li Moying’s agitated Profound Energy instantly exploded!","“BOOM——!”","Heaven shattering explosion rang and the entire Qilin tablet started to shake uncontrollably as the limestones from the wall kept on falling off.","A blinding lightning suddenly lit up, with an aura which pressed forward, the might of the thunder attribute energy coercing one’s heart to tremble, as it came blasting towards spiritual beast Qilin’s direction.","This lightning contained energy which was incomparably pure. Even a matured spiritual beast like Qilin was in awe till it couldn’t move a limb!","Qilin was only able to see that burst of silver thread like lightning flash past and immediately following that, it sensed extreme pain which ran through its entire body!","“I.... am going to die??”","It’s mind only had this thought and following that, it completely lost its consciousness.","In the Qilin tablet, Li Moying had already unknowingly stood up.","If Huang Yueli was around, she would be able to tell that even though his faze was sharp and horrifying, but he had no spirit.","Evidently, his Soul Detachment Illness had acted up once again!","Li Moying’s conscious was blurry and the large amount of images in his brain made him blurred out his past and present lives. He wasn’t sure where he was, only knowing that he... must kill all those who stood in his way, clearing all obstacles! He must return to his beloved woman’s side!","Anyone who dared to obstruct him.... would only have a death ending!","Li Moying clenched the Amethyst Light Sword tightly and with a wave of his sword, the surging Profound Energy within his body was unleashed along with the sword blade!","That sword ray directly shattered the Qilin’s spiritual body!","Just one move and the original spiritual beast which left him soaked in blood earlier, was eliminated with just one move!","However, the sword ray’s energy had not diminished. That dazzling ray had not even weakened as it directly crashed onto the top part of the Qilin tablet!","Qilin tablet had suffered this kind of attack and started to shake violently, as though it would be shattered from the Profound Energy unleashed from him!","Li Moying raised up his Amethyst Light Sword emotionlessly as he prepared to make a move.","But right at this moment, small blue purplish light balls started to gather from the Qilin’s spiritual body which had been shattered by him as it directly injected into his meridians."]},{"number":1583,"title":"Chapter 1583 - Rise from the dead (3)","paragraphs":["Li Moying’s movements paused as he clearly sensed those thunder attributed Profound Energy entering his body, instantly raising the Profound Energy in his body to another new height!","The current him was originally in ninth stage realm peak condition.","After spiritual beast Qilin’s Profound Energy entered his body, the Profound Energy within his body grew so abundant as though it was about to expand and split him up!","Especially the Profound Energy in his dantian, it kept on charging against his body’s limit as though the very next moment, he would advance once again!","Li Moying uncontrollably raised up the long sword in his hand as he struck again!","His current condition was incomparably near to tenth stage realm and the might of this sword was so powerful that it was totally unimaginable.","For an instance, thunder attributed energy exploded.","Sword glint directly split through the top part of the Qilin tablet, shooting into the sky!","This time, even the ground started to shake violently, like an earthquake.","The ground in the core region shattered completely as bursts after bursts of ground splitting cracks appeared and the energy’s aftermath scattered out towards its surroundings!","By the time the vibration stopped, the top part of the Qilin tablet had already been penetrated through by Li Moying’s sword qi, revealing a huge large broken hold.","The full moon’s beam penetrated the broken hold and shot into the inside of the stone tablet, landing onto Li Moying’s body.","Under the irradiation of the moonlight, the turbulent Profound Energy in his body finally started to subside a little.","However, his peerlessly handsome face was still shrouded with a dark and gloomy expression as his gaze was so deep that it was unfathomable. His perfectly sculpted peripheral view was like a cold sculpture under the moonlight.","Following that, Li Moying leapt upwards and jumped out from the hole on the top part of the stone tablet.","...","Huang Yueli summoned up all the existing Profound Energy in her body as she faced the lightning which was coming at her.","Even though she knew that it was definitely impossible for her to survive under such a strong intensity attack, but she could only braced herself to resist for the last time!","The minute the appalling and mighty lightning rained down on the top of her head, the ground suddenly shook.","Huang Yueli’s feet were unstable as she wasn’t able to stand still from the shaking, as she fell onto the ground.","On the mountain, a large rock dropped down and luckily and coincidentally blocked the top part of her body.","Three bolts of lightning simultaneously fell onto the huge rock, turning the vast sized, rock solid White Mist Rock turning into powder instantaneously.","Huang Yueli sprawled onto the ground as the powder fell all over her body. She looked as though she had just been dug out from the mud and as compared to much earlier, she was in a much sorrier state by ten times or more!","However, Huang Yueli felt extremely fortunate because she was really too lucky to have survived in such a situation!","Alas, her joy only lasted for a short span of one breath.","Because her good luck did not allow her to really escape danger. The three magical beasts paused for a moment and immediately stretched out their claws, as they struck an attack posture.","But it seemed as though Heavens was intentionally on her side.","Just as the three magical beasts were prepared to make a move again, the ground started shaking again and furthermore this time round, the sky spun and earth went round while the ground shook and mountains swayed!","The ground shook violently and cracks appeared below their feet. Large rocks kept on falling down and fell all over the heads of Huang Yueli and the three magical beasts.","Huang Yueli hurriedly extended her footwork to evade.","The three magical beasts also hurried to evade the falling rocks and they weren’t concerned about continuing to attack her for the moment.","Huang Yueli’s heart leapt with joy as she moved towards the direction far away from the magical beasts. But due to the falling rocks, she could not move too quickly."]},{"number":1584,"title":"Chapter 1584 - Rise from the dead (4)","paragraphs":["The ground vibrated vigorously for a quarter of an hour or so before it slowly stopped.","Right now, Huang Yueli had barely moved a distance of five hundred meters and was still in the attack boundary of those three magical beasts.","Sending that the ground was no longer shaky, Huang Yueli went into a blank.","“Damnit, why is it not shaking anymore! Isn’t there an earthquake? Quickly continue to shake!” She clenched her teeth as she screamed in exasperation.","But this time, the ground really stopped shaking!","Huang Yueli was so anxious that she nearly threw up blood and lifted up her head, she saw those three magical beasts had already calmed down as they cast their gazes onto her once more.","Furthermore, this time round, their gazes turned even more malicious and even more savage.","Apparently, this kind of prey which they could swallow in one mouth had escaped a number of times right when she was in their claws, and had thoroughly spiked that beast nature!","Huang Yueli was screaming inside her heart that things were far from good as she immediately turned and ran.","Alas, it was too late. When she heard the bursts of electric currents breaking in the air, she knew that she would definitely not be able to escape death this time round.....","Huang Yueli shut her eyes as she waited for the lightning to strike her to death.","However, the expected pain did not descend on her. Not only that, she even heard peals of miserable shrieks coming from behind her and following that was the sound of a heavyweight item crashing onto the ground.","Huang Yueli’s footsteps took a halt and before she was able to turn her head around, she suddenly felt a powerful aura in the air, even stronger than those three magical beasts’ aura, much more overbearing by a hundred times!","But this terrifying Profound Energy aura gave her an extremely familiar feeling, so familiar that... she almost shed tears on the scene.","Huang Yueli turned her head around in a daze and she saw a tall and lanky figure, standing behind her not too far away.","That man stood in the darkness and his eyes were covered by the shadow. But from the contours of his lower jaw, she could tell that he was an extremely good looking man.","When Huang Yueli saw him, her tears started rolling down.","“Moying... Moying!! You’re not dead, you’re really not dead!!”","She leapt upwards as she flew towards Li Moying and pounced into his arms, tipping her toes up as she hugged his neck.","“Boo hoo hoo, you really scared me to death, I thought you were a goner for sure!! What exactly happened? Why haven’t you appeared for such a long time, do you know that I’d be worried? You badie, big badie!!”","Huang Yueli rubbed her face against his chest, as she rubbed all her tears and mucus onto him as well.","She had not cried for a very long time because she had always believed in her own strength, not believing that tears could change anything hence she didn’t allow herself to be so soft!","But at this moment, she completely couldn’t control her own emotions, as that strong and unyielding lady disappeared from her body.","What was left in her shell was an ordinary young lady.","One who was worried and scared over her fiancé’s disappearance, who had turned into a frail ordinary young lady!","Noticing this point made Huang Yueli feel even more vengeful.","She cried for a long time in Li Moying’s arms and slowly started to calm down. She stretched out her hand and whisked Li Moying’s top to wipe her tears, and at the same time punched him with her little fists with fury.","“It’s all your fault, causing me to be so embarrassing.... All your fault for scaring me!!”","She mumbled and suddenly, sensed that something was not right.","Because Li Moying had been really too quiet.","If it was usual times, seeing how sadly she cried, this man would have felt extreme heartache."]},{"number":1585,"title":"Chapter 1585 - Rise from the dead (5)","paragraphs":["He would probably have been hugging her nervously, comforting her so how could he possibly be that silent?","Huang Yueli’s heart jolted as she hurriedly raised her head up.","The next moment, her eyes met with a night-like dark pair of pupils and that pair of eyes even had occasional flashes of bluish purple currents. Under the moonlight, he seemed extremely terrifying!","Whereas this man’s Profound Energy’s fluctuations were so powerful beyond anyone’s imagination.","Electric currents kept on flickering around the duo, giving off a buzzing exploding sound, as though it would explode at any point of time.","Huang Yueli’s body instantly went stiff as she subconsciously raised her head to look at the sky.","When she saw that bright full moon, she immediately understood what had happened.","“You... Your.... Soul Detachment Illness acted up again?” She asked carefully.","However, apparently, Li Moying would not answer her.","That pair of cold and stern eyes was fixated on her without a single word or a single movement.","Even though his surrounding Profound Energy was on the verge of explosion, but Huang Yueli who hugged him tightly was still unharmed. Even after such a long time of crying while hugging him, not one part of her was electrocuted at all.","Huang Yueli realised this and her lips couldn’t help but curled into a smile.","“Sigh... really, every time you need me to save the hero in distress.....”","Saying that, she tipped her toes up as she raised her head to block Li Moying’s lips.","Li Moying’s subconscious was originally rather blurry. He walked all the way here to kill the magical beasts and saved Huang Yueli because of the murderous intent of his Soul Detachment Illness. These three magical beasts were the nearest living creatures hence it attracted him over.","When Huang Yueli pounced towards him, for one moment, he almost struck out directly.","But not knowing why, the electric currents in his hand had already gathered into a light circle but he wasn’t able to lift his arm up no matter what and could only watch helplessly at this dirty young lass pouncing into his arm while crying and rubbing him.","As his past and present lives’ memories are mixed up in his mind, Li Moying’s head was so painful that it was about to split open so he couldn’t remember who this young lass was.....","Until Huang Yueli kissed his lips.","That familiar sensation, familiar presence as it instantly emitted into his body, making his raging Profound Energy comforted gently by an invisible big arm.","His consciousness slowly cleared up.","This presence....","Yes, that’s right. This was that presence which he had crossed over his past and present life, seeking again and again in spite of all the setbacks, forever going crazy over.....","The presence of his beloved woman....","His Li’er.....","Li Moying’s surrounding aura slowly restrained itself as the Profound Energy in his body slowly went back to original. He locked onto Huang Yueli’s slender waist and turned from guest to host as he brought her into his arms and wildly but passionately started to kiss her.","He seemed to place all the experiences such as terror, worry, self-blame, regret, in his confused memories.... Melding everything into this scorching passionate kiss.","Li Moying’s kiss became stronger and stronger, wilder and wilder, as though he was going to swallow her into his stomach.","Haung Yueli felt Li Moying kissing her back. Initially she was rather happy over it because it meant that Li Moying’s Soul Detachment Illness was under control and he was about to regain back to his normal self.","But after a while, she felt that something was amiss.","Li Moying’s kiss was too devoted as he locked on to her tightly and the intensity of his strength almost broke her waist."]},{"number":1586,"title":"Chapter 1586 - Rise from the dead (6)","paragraphs":["Huang Yueli subconsciously started to struggle, trying to push this man aside.","But Li Moying’s strength was just too strong and the arm around her waist was like metal. No matter how hard she pushed, she was unable to struggle free.","Not only that, as she continued to struggle, Li Moying became even more impatient and his actions started to become even more intensive.","He suddenly raised his head up and left Huang Yueli’s lips.","Huang Yueli hurriedly took the opportunity to take in deep breaths, feeling that she was about to suffocate!","However, right before she had finished panting, Li Moying pinched her lower jaw forcing her to raise up her head and started to kiss her once again.","This time round, Li Moying simply locked her lower jaw leaving her unable to move totally hence she could only obediently take in his close-to venting wild kiss.","Originally Huang Yueli still struggled a little but subsequently, she was conquered by that raging sensation as she subconsciously threw herself into his arms befuddled.","By the time Li Moying finally released her, Huang Yueli’s lips had already turned swollen and her skin was broken as the corners of her lips had some blood stains left behind.","Huang Yueli blinked her eyes in a daze, realising that she had regained her freedom.","She jumped right up and used both hands to cover her swollen lips as she berated him in exasperation, “Li Moying, you lunatic! Which artery had been connected wrong, do you need to act like this? You, you, you.... are really too much!”","Whoever knew that after Li Moying hearf that, not only did he not repented, he even started laughing as his eyes shot past a sliver of reminiscence.","“Bingo, what you said is right, I am a lunatic.....”","Past and present live, only crazy for you.....","Really, he was extremely grateful to heavens, for allowing him to complete something which no one had successfully done before, allowing this young lady to be reborn right in front of him....","Huang Yueli was extremely upset because this man was just too sickening, and he didn’t know how to repent!","She raised up her large watery eyes as she gave him a furious stare, “You.... don’t think that you’ve escaped death then you can act like this! You must apologize!”","Li Moying didn’t make a sound.","Huang Yueli became angrier as she couldn’t help but gave him a push, “Why aren’t you saying a word?”","Whoever knew that her hand had just brushed onto Li Moying’s body and that man just followed according to her strength and fell backwards.","Huang Yueli had a huge fright!","Because she totally hadn’t used much strength. Not to mention what kind of peerless strong practitioner Li Moying was, even an ordinary child who didn’t cultivate would not fall in such a manner.","She went into a blank and finally reacted and stretched out her arm to catch him.","Li Moying fell into her arms and the energy from his body seemed to have been sapped dry. He totally had no strength and the colour in his face drained away cleanly within a couple of breaths.","“Li Moying! Wake up, what the matter!!”","Huang Yueli shook him but could only hear him coughing slightly as a sliver of blood dripped down from the corner of his lips.","Huang Yueli didn’t dare to move casually as she laid him flat on the ground. She retrieved various kinds of medication from her space and shoved it in handfuls into his mouth. At the same time, she tore open his shirt as she started to clean and bandage his wounds.","Upon seeing Li Moying’s body filled with various injuries, there were even a few which were obviously fatal injuries, Huang Yueli’s heart started to tug him tightly.","“Luckily... luckily you came back alive, I knew that you wouldn’t leave me alone.”"]},{"number":1587,"title":"Chapter 1587 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (1)","paragraphs":["Li Moying was originally seriously injured in the Qilin tablet and later on when his Soul Detachment Illness acted up, it hurt his state of mind hence he was unconscious for a longer time this time round.","This wasn’t the first time Huang Yueli experienced this hence she wasn’t as nervous as previous times. After ascertaining that his pulse, breathing and Profound Energy fluctuations were normal, she rested her heart and moved him into the small little cave which they had once stayed for a little while to recuperate.","Luckily after Li Moying appeared, Little Qilin also revived immediately as it leapt and frisked about unleashing its might to awe those sixth and seventh levelled magical beasts around the boundary of the valley. Hence during the period of time when Li Moying was recuperating, they hadn’t met with any danger as everything went along smoothly.","Seven days later very late into the night, Huang Yueli was sleeping soundly.","Although they were only temporarily residing here to recuperate, she had always emphasized heavily on the quality of living so she redecorated the cave, placing thick bedding on the ground and also set up an array in the cave which became a warm and comfortable place to live in.","Little Qilin laid in her little den by her feet but to show the disdain towards the Sacred Phoenix’s little chick, it used it’s little bottom to face it.","She was in a daze when she seemed to have heard a strange sound.","Huang Yueli opened her eyes and looked towards Li Moying’s direction and immediately sobered up then climbed up.","Li Moying who was lying not too far away suddenly kept flipping around and even gave deep groans with an extremely uncomfortable look.","Huang Yueli walked over as she bent down and looked at him worriedly, “Moying, what’s the matter? Which part of you feels uncomfortable?”","Li Moying’s eyes opened up into a slit as his lips opened up slightly.","Huang Yueli saw him regaining consciousness and gave out a joyful look as she leaned in close to him.","She only heard Li Moying’s weak breathing as he said, “You.... you hide further away a little, I think I am.... about to advance.....”","Huang Yueli’s eyes widened, “What did you say???”","Before Li Moying opened his mouth again, an earth shattering thunderous sound was heard from the sky.","Following this bolt of deafening thunder, the entire cave kept on shaking as bolts after bolts of lightning descended from the sky, penetrating the mountain walls as it flowed into Li Moying’s body.","Strong thunder attributed Profound Qi filled the entire cave as sounds of pitter pattering electric currents were heard coming from the sky.","Huang Yueli basically couldn’t withstand this strong aura as her chest felt a turbulence of her qi and blood hence she hastily retreated backwards.","She retreated several thousand miles away before she finally felt slightly better, at least she didn’t feel like throwing up blood.","Originally she wanted to bring little Qilin along but whoever knew that when this little thing sensed electric energy, it wriggled out from her arms immediately as it flew towards the centre of the lightning, casting this female Mistress of it aside.","Huang Yueli could only sit down alone at a hill far away, looking afar at the position of the previous cave.","Precisely speaking, that location was no longer a cave.","Within a short span of a quarter of an hour, that entire mountain had already been flattened to ground level by the continuously descending heavenly thunder. It even struck the falling stones from the mountain into charred greyed dust.","Li Moying’s body was lifted to the middle of the sky by the electric currents might and on his back was a pair of thunder wings which seemed even more distinct than when she first saw it.","When he was in the seventh stage realm, that pair of wings was not totally visible and was only in the form of an energy body but now, it was clearly seen in fine details with substantial essence seemingly no difference from a real pair of wings."]},{"number":1588,"title":"Chapter 1588 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (2)","paragraphs":["Li Moying was surrounded by dazzling brilliant purple electric currents.","Bolts of lightning surrounded him to form a large zone filled with flickering thunder bolts.","In this piece of thunder attributed energy formed zone, every single inch of energy was under Li Moying’s control.","Anyone who wanted to get closed to him would be turned into ashes with just a single thought.","This thunder zone almost enveloped the entire valley as the abundant Profound Qi gushed through the clouds, all the way till it enveloped the top part of Violet Sun Valley’s thick fog, illuminating the entire sky as though it was day time!","When Huang Yueli saw this from far away, her little mouth formed an ‘O’ shape, totally unable to close up.","“What on earth.... He is going to advance into the ninth stage realm already?? He had plainly just advanced into the eighth stage realm a few days ago!! Both of us are god grade geniuses but why is he advancing much faster than me? What on earth happened?”","With her eyes, she could naturally see that the Profound Energy fluctuations had already reached the limit of the ninth stage realm and the entire valley’s thunder attributed Profound Qi were all gathered on him, which was barely enough to supply him the energy for advancement.","Not only that, his body also began to undergo changes. Under the invasion of the electricity, his skin started to break into tiny pieces as it started to grow out inch by inch. His entire body kept on sprouting blood and that original peerlessly handsome face looked even more sinister than a demon!","Huang Yueli had once experienced the process of advancing into the ninth stage realm so she knew clearly that failing to succeed and the changes of shedding one’s mortal body to exchange one’s bones were the signs of advancement.","Because for those practitioners under the eighth stage realm, even though their abilities far surpassed ordinary people, they were still human. But once they advanced into ninth stage realm, their substance had actually entered half god realm territory so no matter if it was in terms of Profound Energy’s flow or the strength of their meridians or body, it was a huge difference from eighth stage realm!","Because of them, when one was below eighth stage realm, challenging someone beyond the big realms wasn’t too difficult but ninth stage realm practitioners, no matter how weak their combat power was, there wasn’t a possibility of being defeated by eighth stage realm practitioners!","The only one who could cross realms, challenge against a ninth stage realm practitioner and win was probably only Li Moying alone.","But after today, he need not do any cross realms battle again.","Huang Yueli looked from far as she got rather nervous and her hands had already clenched into fists while mumbling silently, “How could there be such a huge formation.... Even when Mu Chengying advanced then, the surrounding thunder zone wasn’t that strong! Today there aren’t any ninth stage realm and above practitioners guardians around, Moying, you’ve got to be careful!”","To a practitioner, the stronger one’s innate talent was, the more powerful the strange phenomenon would be attracted to, and the stronger the ability after advancement would be!","And at this present moment, Li Moying had already gathered all the thunder attributed energy from the entire Violet Sun Valley onto him. With a raise of his arm, he would be able to cut across mountains and rip apart heaven and earth.","But his body still seemed like a black hole, continuing to absorb the Heaven and Earth Profound Qi.","Violet Sun Valley and Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region originally had an array to mutually isolate each other but under the impact when he gathered the energy during advancement, the array kept on shaking violently.","Huang Yueli raised her head to see bursts of light flashing continuously in the sky. Those were the array patterns which were being activated continuously from the exterior of Violet Sun Valley, obstructing Li Moying from absorbing the Profound Qi from outside the valley.","However, this condition only maintained for a short period of time and not long later, an intense bursting sound was heard coming from the mid-air!"]},{"number":1589,"title":"Chapter 1589 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1589: Returning back to ninth stage realm (3)","The ancient array outside Violet Sun Valley finally could not withstand the impact from Li Moying’s Profound Energy as it collapsed completely!","The energy required to forcibly shatter an array was ten times the energy required to maintain an array so it was imaginable just how strong the gathered thunder attributed energy which Li Moying had gathered was.","The array collapsed and caused a huge force of impact as it blew Huang Yueli away in a moment.","Huang Yueli’s body drew out an arc in mid-air and she was almost going to fall heavily incurring serious injuries. She hurriedly summoned Little Phoenix making it speedily grew larger as she sat on its body to leave the thunderous core zone.","One lady and one phoenix flew all the way to the boundary of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region before they finally stopped.","The only advantage was that since Li Moying had already absorbed all the thunder attributed energy from the valley, those magical beasts which had been reared in Violet Sun Valley and had automatically attacked Little Phoenix had all turned into energy balls, merging into his thunder zone.","So Little Phoenix was no longer afraid of appearing.","But under several impacts from the energy, Huang Yeuli had already turned ashen faced as she sat on the grass in an extremely dishevelled state.","Little Phoenix also turned back into a little shota look as he sat by her feet, staring at afar in a daze.","“H...H... Heavens! Big Demon Lord is going to ascend to God Realm?? Isn’t that a little too fast! You’ve just gotten engaged and he’s going to abandon you?” Little Phoenix’s chin almost dropped onto the ground.","Huang Yueli swept him with a glance, “Stop talking rubbish, Moying is merely advancing into the ninth stage realm! It’s still too early to ascend!”","Although she said that, Little Phoenix’s words still made her feel a slight crisis.","Originally the gap between her cultivation and Li Moying’s had shrunk but whoever knew that after Li Moying entered the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, he actually broke through two large realms, ditching her aside by a huge chunk again!","No way, she got to work hard in order to ascend together than her fiancé!","Little Phoenix was still making a big fuss, “Ninth stage realm, are you kidding me! How is that possible? Thinking of cheating the young me, as though I’ve never seen a practitioner advancing? When I was with my brother in God Realm, I’ve also experienced a lot of things alright? There are so many geniuses in God Realm but none of them had caused such a shocking phenomenon while advancing to the ninth stage realm! If it wasn’t for the lockdown of the barrier from the outside of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, I think he would even poke a hole through the sky!”","Huang Yueli looked at him, raising his voice with that exaggerated tone, making her lips twitch.","“Enough, stop shouting! It’s a crucial moment for Moying to advance and if you affect him, see if I will beat your butt or not!”","Wang Cai covered his little butt in a conditioned reflex as he guarded against her.","“You... if you dare to cast domestic violence against this little lord, I will not allow you to mount on me in future!”","Huang Yueli was about to speak out when she heard an earth shattering sound from the sky as thunder and lightning swept across the entire mystic region, almost blinding everyone’s eyes.","Huang Yueli immediately prowled down as she put out a defensive posture.","“Wa.... Save me!”","Little Wang Cai whooshed and snuck into her arms as his little body kept on trembling, his little face turning pale.","Oh my goodness! Female demon’s fiancé is really too terrifying! Was he really breaking through to the ninth stage realm!?","But he was still in the seventh stage realm when he first entered the mystic region and now it was scary enough that he was breaking through to the ninth stage realm. Tenth stage realm of course wasn’t possible.....","But the strange phenomenon... was something which he had not seen before in God Realm!","That’s it, Big Demon Lord was so amazing so it definitely had no way to stick out in future!"]},{"number":1590,"title":"Chapter 1590 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (4)","paragraphs":["Right now, Li Moying himself wasn’t feeling very good.","The process of failing before succeeding wasn’t only on the dermatological surface but it also penetrated deep into his bones and internal organs.","Every inch of his body had been purified by electricity while purging out the impurities in his body and that pain was indescribable with mere words.","But this to him was an experience and besides, his tolerance level had always been rather high so the physical pain wasn’t a big problem for him at all.","What made him really in pain was the splitting pain from his primordial spirit, as though his brain was about to split open. Various complex memories kept on flashing past. As though it could no longer take on the strong suppression from his advancement, which might completely burst anytime, anywhere.","This wasn’t an illusion but under the kind of strong intensity thunder attributed energy, it was possible that his soul might be scattered at any point of time.","Li Moying was very clear on how this situation came about.","It was the price which he had to pay for his heaven defying action in his past life!","In reality, he himself wasn’t as optimistic as Huang Yueli because only he himself knew that his advancement this time round... he might not be able to succeed!","Every single time he advanced, the risks he had to take on were much higher than ordinary practitioners. Although it looked as though his cultivation speed was swift, but the higher his cultivation, the more risks he had to undertake.","So much that the danger level when his Soul Detachment Illness acted up, was in line with his cultivation.","Liu Buyan had once told him that the best way of curbing his Soul Detachment Illness was to never advance forever.","But for a genius practitioner like Li Moying, how could he possibly accept himself to be a weakling forever? Especially after he met Huang Yueli, his desire to become even strong grew so that he could protect her forever.","Hence, Li Moying cultivated with even more diligence, causing his Soul Detachment Illness to act up even more frequently.","Whereas now, the process of advancing into the ninth stage realm was the most crucial and most dangerous checkpoint.","Liu Buyan had once warned him that if he could not handle this crucial point prudently, then the result that awaited him.... was possibly the scattering of his soul!","Of course, Li Moying would not possibly give up on charging towards the ninth stage realm just because of a mere warning but he had thought of making more preparations before he advanced.","He had not predicted that his own ability actually rose that quickly and after absorbing the energy from the magical beasts in Violet Sun Valley, to immediately breaking through to eighth stage realm and later on borrowing the acting up of Soul Detachment Illness to unleash ninth stage realm peak’s potential to kill the spiritual beast Qilin, obtaining the Profound Energy reward from the Qilin tablet.","Under the push from various elements, he actually faced the moment of advancing in such a short period of time.","Originally, he wanted to try ways to suppress the impulse of advancing, waiting to advance at another suitable time after they left Violet Sun Valley.","But right after his body was heavily injured, he could no longer suppress the turbulent Profound Energy in his body and as the intensity of thunder attributed energy was too high in Violet Sun Valley, he instantly sensed the drawing of his engine, wildly surging towards him and flowing into his meridians, forcing him to advance right now.","The pain in his state of mind kept on accumulating and adding on to the confusion from his memories, it made Li Moying feel so sick that he wanted to throw up, feeling that he would go crazy at the very next moment.","However, just as he was almost about to lose control of himself, there was a moment in time when Huang Yueli’s face flashed past his mind.","No, he could not admit defeat, he could not fall right here.....","He had not even married Li’er so how could he fall so easily?"]},{"number":1591,"title":"Chapter 1591 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Moreover speaking, the entire Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s electric current energy had all gathered at this place so if he fails in advancement, his soul would be scattered and all these electric currents would immediately lose control completely.","The person who would bore the brunt and be torn into shred by the rampaging currents would be Huang Yueli who was the nearest to this place!","When Li Moying thought of this, he suddenly became frightened as his senses finally sobered up a little.","He forcefully suppressed the dizziness in his head as he gathered all his energy to control the Profound Energy within him, preparing to break through the bottleneck of the ninth stage realm.","Since things had come to such a pass, he no longer had a second choice and could only choose to advance immediately.","The faster he completed the advancement, the lesser pain he had to endure and the safer Li’er, who was at the boundary of the violent storm would be.","Finally, under his hard work, the electric currents energy slowly entered his body as the Profound Energy within him kept on contracting and concentrating as the changes to his body kept on speeding up.","The surrounding thunder attributed energy seemed as though it had reached the limit and was no longer rampaging, but slowly settled down as it struck a miraculous balance along with the speed of Li Moying absorbing the energy.","Li Moying’s advancement process finally passed the most dangerous point as it started to enter the stable period.","...","God Realm, Cloudy Qilin Sect.","Ever since Sage Wu Ding and Sage Dong had been obstructed by You Da Zhuang resulting in the lower realm genius’s demise, they were totally unable to recover for a long period of time.","Especially Sage Wu Ding, he had already closed his doors to visitors for more than half a month.","It was until today when Sage Dong visited him to play chess, did he give his old friend some face as he barely agreed to it.","Visit our comic site Read.live","“I say, Old Man Wu Ding, stop being so melancholic. We Cloudy Qilin Clan’s history has been around for at least several hundred thousands of years and within the long history, we had many god grade geniuses. Although that lower realm genius’s aptitude was really great and it was indeed disappointing for him to have died, but since things had already happened, why do you still get yourself tangled over it for? Those who aren’t clear on this would probably think that he was your son or disciple?”","Sage Dong held on to the chess piece as he shook his head and advised him.","Sage Wu Ding gave him an angry stare, “Look at what you’re saying? As the Violet Sun Valley’s Valley Master, all the practitioners who had passed through Violet Sun Valley’s refinement are considered to be my disciples! Now that a genius has died in Violet Sun Valley, of course I don’t feel good about it! Moreover speaking, do you know that even though we have a lot of god grade geniuses in Cloudy Qilin Clan, but there aren’t many who could match up to that lower realm genius!”","“Alright, alright, I know. He was indeed very talented and anyway I’m not even as incredible as him when I was young. But he’s already gone so saying all these.....”","Sage Dong was advising him when he suddenly saw Sage Wu Ding pat the table hard, as he stood up from his seat.","“What are you doing?”","Sage Dong frowned and raised his head up.","Sage Wu Ding’s expression was very colourful. It was mixed with terror, ecstasy, puzzlement, loss and various other expressions as his eyes totally didn’t fall upon Sage Dong. Instead he was staring straight ahead as though he was possessed.","Sage Dong frowned as he went up and patted him on the shoulder, “I say.... Old Man Wu Ding, you.... are you alright?”","This old man was especially headstrong when he was young so surely he wouldn’t have taken a change for the worse after he got old right? Just this small setback and it had already caused him to go mad?","Sage Wu Ding seemed as though he did not notice him as his eyes opened wide and mumbled to himself, “How is this possible? How could such a matter have happened? This must be my illusion.... It’s simply inconceivable.....”"]},{"number":1592,"title":"Chapter 1592 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Hey, are you alright? Surely you haven’t gone into Qi Deviation from yesterday’s practicing of work skill right?” The more Sage Dong looked at him, the more he felt that something was wrong.","Sage Wu Ding then suddenly recalled his senses as he heard what Sage Dong was saying and couldn’t help but open his eyes wide and blew his moustache.","“What Qi Deviation? How could I possibly go into Qi Deviation! Old Man Dong, something big has happened!”","“What big matter has happened?”","“I suddenly sensed that the lower realm genius in Violet Sun Valley, had.... had actually came back to life!”","Sage Dong went into a blank thinking that he must have heard wrongly, “What? Come back to life? Didn’t you say it yourself that that genius had already died in Qilin tablet? Have your senses gone awry? But that shouldn’t be so. Haven’t you said that Qilin tablet’s energy wasn’t enough and before he killed the spiritual beast Qilin, it’s not possible for him to leave. If he really came back to life, doesn’t that mean.... mean.....”","Sage Dong really couldn’t continue his words because the thought of that appearing in his mind was simply too shocking!","Among the god grade geniuses in Cloudy Qilin Clan’s long history, no one had been able to kill spiritual beast Qilin and to pass through the Qilin tablet refinement. But if that lower realm genius did it...","Didn’t that mean that he was the first person among Cloudy Qilin Clan’s geniuses to have done so?","This sort of thing was just too ridiculous because he was after all born in the lower realm. Under the scarcity of limited resources and cultivation methods, how could such a genius possibly appear? Was he still allowing others to survive?","This absolutely could not possibly have happened!","However, after Sage Wu Ding heard that, he shook his head.","“What does it mean? Meaning he killed the spiritual beast Qilin? The truth is just that!”","“What?? How could it be possible?? I don’t believe in such a matter! Your senses must have gone wrong!”","Visit our comic site Read.live","Sage Wu Ding bore a humiliated expression, “Who am I? How could my senses possibly have gone wrong! I didn’t believe it initially but after that lower realm genius came back to life, the Profound Energy fluctuations in Violet Sun Valley turned volatile and even the exterior array could have possibly cracked from it.... no, not possibly... heavens, Violet Sun Valley’s barrier array had been shattered from the inside! Too scary.....”","Sage Wu Ding sensed a new wave of Profound Energy fluctuation as his eyes popped out in surprise, just short of his jaw dropping onto the ground.","If it wasn’t something which he had sensed personally and believed that his senses wouldn’t be wrong, then even he himself would not believe that such a matter had happened.","Just where did this lower realm genius come from? Why was his innate talent so ridiculously strong to such an extent?","Every single time he had assumed that this man was already genius enough, the other party always had ways to refresh his understanding, coming out with even more unbelievable stuff!","Sage Dong was completely dazed, “Shattered the barrier? I say, Old Man Wu Ding, now I’m absolutely certain that you’ve really gone into Qi Deviation. To come out with such hallucination, your illness really isn’t light!”","If it was usual times, according to Sage Wu Ding’s character, he would absolutely scold him back as it was not possible for him to allow anyone else to suspect his own judgement?","But right now, he actually couldn’t say a single word of rebuttal.","A genius practitioner of such standard had far surpassed his imagination. Even if they were the God Realm Clan’s core members, they had never met this kind of genius before.","For Sage Dong to have such suspicions, it simply was absolutely normal matter!","But things had not come to a conclusion yet as Violet Sun Valley had once again emitted another set of news——"]},{"number":1593,"title":"Chapter 1593 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (7)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Following Violet Sun Valley’s barrier being shattered, Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region’s Heaven and Earth Profound Qi was almost sucked dry!","This kind of situation seemed to only have one kind of possibility, and that was someone was advancing in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region!","Furthermore, it was at least an advancement into ninth stage realm!","To the extent there was a possibility of advancing to tenth stage realm from the way the Profound Energy fluctuations were attracted!","There was an age limit to entering Violet Sun Valley’s refinement. Only those genius practitioners under thirty were able to obtain the qualification to enter.","Generally, those under thirty’s who were able to advance into the eighth stage realm were already considered extremely outstanding in God Realm and generally they were the top figures among the god grade geniuses to do that.","As for those who had advanced into the ninth stage realm before they turned thirty, only those peerless geniuses from God Realm’s large Clans throwing in an extensive amount of resources would be able to manage that. This wasn’t just merely a matter of god grade innate talent because cultivation was after all not only about exhausting resources, but also burning money. Without the clan’s full support, no matter how genius that person was, it wasn’t possible to advance that quickly!","Although he wasn’t sure how old that lower realm genius was, but no matter what it wasn’t possible that he had reached thirty years old, right?","Just what stage realm was he advancing into??","By now Sage Dong had slowly accepted reality as he slowly regained his senses. In the end upon one glance, he discovered that Sage Wu Ding’s face seemed to have been struck by lightning as he was standing in a daze by the side.","He hurriedly headed over and patted Sage Wu Ding, “What’s the matter? What happened this time? Surely it couldn’t be that your senses really made a mistake? Or that lower realm genius died again?”","“Pui pui pui, you crow beak!” Sage Wu Ding regained his senses as he stared angrily at him.","He recounted the situation which he had sensed earlier and described it to Sage Dong.","Sage Dong simply could not believe such a matter was happening but Sage Wu Ding’s words seemed irrefutable so he could only treat it as it was real.","Once he had accepted this installation, it seemed that whatever shocking matter which the lower realm genius had done could be accepted logically.","Sage Dong thought about it and said, “What you’re saying isn’t totally impossible! Tenth stage realm is a little too ridiculous but if that lower realm genius is just twenty seven or eight years old, advancing into the ninth stage realm is very normal. Lower realm’s resources might be a tad too little but his innate talent is right there so how could he possibly be compared on the same level as an ordinary earth grade genius?”","“Ai, you don’t know this, that intense Profound Energy fluctuation had already broken Violet Sun Valley’s barrier! In future all Cloudy Qilin Clan’s practitioners are not able to enter it anymore! This abnormal might.... Even if I asked myself honestly, when I was advancing into the tenth stage realm, it had never happened before! He might really be advancing into the tenth stage realm! A thirty year old tenth stage realm.....”","Sage Wu Ding shuddered as he gave himself a huge fright.","Sage Dong was much more stable, “How can you and me be compared to this kind of genius? Haven’t you said it yourself? He’s the first practitioner in the entire Cloudy Qilin Clan’s history to have passed the Qilin tablet’s refinement successfully so the reward which he obtained might be extremely astonishing, something which you and I could not imagine! Perhaps when he’s advancing, he has obtained a huge amount of resources and with numerous Profound Energy as reward, matching with his own innate talent, this isn’t something impossible!”","Sage Wu Ding blinked, “It really seems so since you’ve put it in such a way.....”","Sage Dong replied, “Right? My guess is logical and reasonable, it’s because you’re too anxious.”","Sage Wu Ding recollected his thoughts for a moment and finally nodded, “Looks like what you said shouldn’t be wrong.....”"]},{"number":1594,"title":"Chapter 1594 - Returning back to ninth stage realm (8)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Actually, Sage Dong’s guess towards the actual scenario which had happened to Li Moying was especially close.","Li Moying had indeed obtained a huge amount of Profound Energy replenishment after he killed the spiritual beast Qilin, hence obtaining the foundation of breaking through.","But Sage Dong could never have guessed that Li Moying was already a ninth stage realm peak practitioner in his past life. His memories had been activated during the full moon’s night under both activation of memories and provocation, he was able to succeed in advancing under coincidental opportunity.","Furthermore, the most important thing was something which both Sages would never have expected in their wildest dreams. Li Moying was merely twenty one years old this year, much younger than what Sage Dong and Sage Wu Ding had expected. So it was foreseeable that based on his innate talent, breaking through to the tenth stage realm would not require a long wait of ten years or so.....","Sage Dong continued, “But for the clan to come out with such a genius, it indeed is worth celebrating! Moreover, we should also try to bring him back to the main branch of the clan as soon as possible so that we won’t delay his future! We had better hurry over to meet the Clan Leader and tell him this good news! We can also give You Da Zhuang a tight slap on his face at the same time!”","However, Wu Ding shook his head.","“Forget it, Clan Leader is really in closed door cultivation. The last time I was in a hurry to save him and under such a precarious situation hence I just went up directly to ask for a meeting. But now that lower realm genius had already gotten himself out of the crisis so we need not be hasty this time round. Let’s wait for Clan Leader to come out from his closed door cultivation then talk about it. Moreover speaking, he’s still so young and had already successfully advanced to the ninth stage realm. There should be no problems for him to ascend successfully in future. There’s still time for him to undergo some experience learning there then nurturing him when he arrives at God Realm later on.”","Sage Dong nodded, “What you said is right as well... but this is really a huge joyous matter. I’d not expected that after so many years, among the disciples which we Cloudy Qilin Clan had put in our best efforts to nurture the disciples in the clan, Clan Master still hasn’t picked any satisfactory candidate to be his successor. But in the end, such a genius is discovered from the lower realm.....”","“That’s right, in future when he returns to the clan, I wonder what kind of commotion will he raise....”","Sage Wu Ding thought about the intense fighting among the clan’s different factions and couldn’t help but go into deep thoughts.","....","In Violet Sun Valley.","Li Moying’s advancement finally entered the ending stage.","The frequency of thunder and lightning in the sky started to subside and the surrounding rampaging thunder attributed energy also started to become stable and peaceful.","After Li Moying had finally completed his succession from failure, there was an evolution to his physical body’s physique.","Under the effect from Heaven & Earth Code, the wounds on his body started to heal slowly and his freshly grown skin was supple and smooth, crystal clear like jade and under the refraction from the electric currents, it seemed to give off a dim glow.","Just taking one look at him and one could distinctly feel that his perfectly good-looking sculpted body contained a terrifying powerful energy, as an unexcelled aura was emitted from his bones!","After he shed his mortal body and underwent an exchange of bones, his meridians and dantian were much more tenacious and spacious than before, allowing him to accommodate up to ten times the energy.","Li Moying’s body had been swept along by electric currents as he suspended in mid-air while thunder attributed energy seeped into his body, flowing along his meridians as it continued to revolve.","Every single time his Profound Energy went one cycle, his meridians would be strengthened once again as the condensation of his Profound Energy in his body was raised to a new level.","Over and over again, as it kept on repeating the cycle.","This was an extremely slow process and it varied among different people’s innate talent which might last between several hours to several days."]},{"number":1595,"title":"Chapter 1595 - A debt to settle (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After Huang Yueli saw Li Moying entering the stability stage, she heaved a long sigh of relief.","Even though she wasn’t aware of what price Li Moying had paice in his past life, she instinctively felt extremely worried.","Advancement to each practitioner had a certain amount of risk to it. Moreover, Li Moying had continuously broken through two large realms within ten over days and there was a possibility of an unstable foundation.","Luckily, everyone was still rather smooth.","The process of Li Moying absorbing the energy lasted for seven days and seven nights.","At last, the electric currents slowly dissipated and Li Moying steadily landed on the ground.","His peach blossom eyes which had been tightly shut slowly opened and an electric current flashed past his eyes as there was a deeper sense of reservation in his cold and penetrative eyes.","Huang Yueli cried out with joy and shock, “You.... you’ve advanced successfully! That’s right, the Profound Energy fluctuations from you is indeed that of the ninth stage realm!”","Li Moying nodded as his gentle gaze fell onto her sweet looking face, “Li’er, I’ve made you worried. I’m already in the ninth stage realm right now and I can protect you properly....”","Huang Yueli pouted, “I can take care of myself, I don’t need to rely on you!”","Although she said that, but she still ran swiftly into Li Moying’s arms.","Li Moying locked on to her waist tightly as he lowered his head and planted a kiss on her cheek while laughing in adoration, “You don’t need me to protect you, I’m the one who wants to stick to you shamelessly!”","Huang Yueli snorted and was just about to say something when she felt something nudging around her neck as she got a fright.","She lowered her head to discover that a little Qilin had snuck out from Li Moying’s top around his chest. It seemed to have grown a little larger and the scales on its body didn’t seem to be that soft anymore as it felt much tougher to the touch.","Apparently this little Qilin had also advanced. But because Li Moying’s aura was just too strong, hence he had covered its advancement fluctuations.","This little thing was obviously not at ease as it kept moving around, as though it was trying to stop its Master and his fiancée from Sacred Phoenix Race from getting intimate.","Li Moying lowered his head several times and whenever he wanted to kiss Huang Yueli, this little thing kept interrupting them.","Huang Yueli’s face turned green as she stared at Little Qilin and said, “If you continue to make trouble, I’ll cut you up into pieces and make barbecue meat out of you!”","Little Qilin seemed as though it understood what she was saying as it gave off a terrified cry, “Aw aw aw.....”","Li Moying couldn’t help but bursted out laughing as he placed his hand on little Qilin’s back and kept it away. At the same time he lowered his head towards Huang Yueli and said, “Why are you thinking about barbecued meat? Are you hungry? Let’s grab time quickly and keep all the treasures in Violet Sun Valley, then.....”","“Then? Then go and eat?” Huang Yueli blinked her large eyes as she asked puzzledly.","Li Moying laughed but a chilly murderous intent arose in the depths of his eyes!","“I’ll bring you to have something first, then.... we still have a huge debt, which we should settle properly!”","These days when his consciousness was blurry in the Qilin tablet, the most images which appeared in his mind, other than the scene where Huang Yueli self-exploded, was the scene where she was pushed down the cliff by Murong Fei.","At that moment, his heart almost stopped and that ultimate terrifying feeling still stayed at the depths of his heart until now.","“Murong Fei, Li Lingchuan and Leng Yi Feng! Looks like I’ve been too merciful for these few years to allow you guys to have the guts – to think that you can provoke me?”"]},{"number":1596,"title":"Chapter 1596 - A debt to settle (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli heard his frigid words and a smile curled up on her lips.","In his past life, Mu Chengying had never been a merciful man but in this lifetime, Li Moying seemed to be much gentler this time as compared to the long ranger in his past life.","But if one really ruffled his feathers, the consequences would absolutely be extremely miserable.","Murong Fei and the others were definitely going to be in deep trouble this time round. She wasn’t sure how they were going to die so it really made her feel a little sympathy for them.....","Huang Yueli quickly noticed another important point.","“Wait, the Violet Sun Valley that you mentioned, do you mean that valley which we had been doing the refinement in for the past few days? How do you know the valley’s name? And what kind of treasures are there in the valley? Let’s hurry and go retrieve it!”","She had already declared Murong Fei and the other’s death sentence and knew that these few scums weren’t able to escape from Li Moying’s hand hence she totally didn’t bother about them as her attention was shifted aside very quickly.","In comparison, she still felt that treasures were a greater attraction for her.","Li Moying took a look at her and said, “Remember that stone tablet which we found in the core region? That is the mechanism which Cloudy Qilin Clan uses to assess god grade geniuses, which is also known as Qilin tablet. The exterior of the valley which is used to filer earth grade and heaven grade geniuses is known as Violet Sun Valley. I’ve passed through god grade geniuses’ final refinement hence a lot of information regarding Cloudy Qilin Clan automatically merged into my memories.....”","As the reward for passing the stage, I’ve obtained a huge amount of Profound Energy. Other than that, Qlin tablet also had a huge reserve of medicinal pills and Profound Armaments and some are god grade and all these now belong to me.....”","“Ah ah ah, god grade Profound Armament! Aren’t those God Relics then? I want to see, I want to see, quickly bring me there!” Huang Yueli grabbed on to his sleeve excitedly.","Li Moying shook his head and laughed as he knew that this young lass would act in exactly this way....","“Alright, let’s head over now! But my potential exploded due to the full moon and accidentally pierced through the Qilin tablet so I’m not sure if the treasures inside are affected or not.....”","Huang Yueli’s face turned black, “What? How could you be such a wastrel! Even damaging God Relics!”","Li Moying held on to his arrogantly pampered fiancée gently as they returned back to the position where the Qilin tablet was.","Regarding Violet Sun Valley’s exterior barrier array, it had also been shattered by Li Moying accidentally when he was advancing so a lot of Violet Sun Valley’s thunder attributed Profound Energy, other than the portion which Li Moying had already absorbed, had all dispersed out.","Without high density thunder attributed energy, Violet Sun Valley’s magical beasts totally disappeared.","The two of them didn’t meet with any obstruction in their entire journey and they soon reached the core region.","Huang Yueli took a quick look at the ground to see that the Qilin tablet’s top part had been blown away, revealing a dark space below.","Luckily the Treasure Depository was right at the bottom layer level of the Qilin tablet and had not been affected much so most of the items inside were still intact.","Huang Yueli’s eyes shone immediately when she saw the treasures and she let go of Li Moying’s hand immediately as she excitedly rushed into the Treasure Depository.","“Wa, although there are not many things here but each piece of it are really treasures! I think I read about this bottle of heaven level smelted god pill in an ancient record some time ago. Practitioners below the fifth stage realm who take one piece of half God level pills will immediately breakthrough a large realm! Even for ninth stage realm practitioners who take it will be able to have a huge breakthrough in their speed of cultivation...”","“This Nine Transformations Soul Recall Pill is said to have the effect of reviving one from the dead!”"]},{"number":1597,"title":"Chapter 1597 - A debt to settle (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“Good pill, really good pills! Quick, quick, quick, keep it!”","“And what other pill is this, Nefarious Bewitching Thoughts Pill? I’ve never heard of this.... anyway it must be some good stuff so let’s keep it first!”","Huang Yueli looked left and right as she kept on crying out excitedly as she kept all the medicinal pills into the Sky Phoenix Ring.","After browsing through the medicinal pills, she turned towards Cloudy Qilin Clan’s collection of Profound Armaments.","These Profound Armaments were mostly half God relics and each and every piece were extremely practical rare treasures as its might was extremely strong.","Among those were a few pieces of God Relics.","Seeing these, Huang Yueli was so excited that she almost lost herself as she pounced over to pick up every single piece while taking a careful look.","“It’s too incredible! How is this even casted? The array patterns can actually be engraved in this way? I’ve tried that several times in my past time and had never succeeded at it! God Realm’s Armaments Masters could actually finish this?”","“And this here, there must definitely be a special smelting method...”","She looked left and right and was totally smitten over it as she even forgot the time.","Li Moying stood at the entrance as his gentle gaze followed her wherever she went, with a slight smile beneath his eyes.","This young lass.... she indeed lost herself whenever she saw high levelled Profound Armaments, exactly the same as in her past life.","He raised up his head and looked at the sky. A bright moon had already ascended into the night sky, apparently it’s already night time.","But he didn’t call out to remind Huang Yueli, merely allowing her to do as she wished as he silently protected her.","After a long, long time, Huang Yueli had finally satisfied her first level of curiosity, keeping a large portion of the Profound Armaments.","She picked out a God levelled long sword and a god levelled Armour as she passed it to Li Moying.","“These two pieces are much better than what you’re using right now, quickly change into it! Especially this long sword, it is refined with the resonance smelting method which is much better than the Amethyst Light Sword and suits your movements. Furthermore, it’s also attached with three kinds of god grade thunder attributed Profound Skills. Try it and you’ll know.”","Li Moying smiled as he received it, “I don’t need to try and I also know, whatever my Li’er said must be correct!”","Huang Yueli raised her chin complacently, “It’s good that you know!”","Li Moying tried to wave the long sword and it indeed was more compatible with himself. His heart was deeply moved because having such an intelligent fiancée was really too fortunate.","But he turned back only to discover Huang Yueli staring at Profound Armaments again.","Li Moying laughed out, “Why so fascinated? It’s not the first time you’ve seen a God Relic! Don’t you already have a God Relic, Sky Phoenix Ring, on you?”","Hearing this, Huang Yueli went into a pause, “Speaking of the Sky Phoenix Ring..... no wonder I felt sensing that there’s something strange about the God Relics in Qilin tablet. These God Relics, although the might is extremely powerful but as compared to the Sky Phoenix Ring, the disparity is a little too huge isn’t it!”","There wasn’t only space in the Sky Phoenix Ring, it was also able to seal a spiritual spirit’s spirit body like Wang Cai in it and also came with Saint Spring and various planting functions. It even could be upgraded according to her own ability, advancing accordingly...","In comparison, the God Relics in Qilin tablet appeared a tad too ordinary. Those were merely more powerful in terms of attack and defence and the attaching Profound Skills made it more formidable while some even had its own spirit artifacts.","Li Moying’s eyes also flashed past a smirk of deep thought.","“In this case, the grade of your Sky Phoenix Ring must be a much higher grade of God Relic! Even though all of them are God Relics, but it should be split up into different kinds of levels!”"]},{"number":1598,"title":"Chapter 1598 - A debt to settle (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","Huang Yueli’s fingers touched her chin as she said seemingly in thoughts, “In this way, my luck isn’t that bad at all! Luckily it wasn’t a wasted effort for me to bring it out even though it almost killed me.”","Speaking of that, the Sky Phoenix Ring was a treasure which she obtained when she cooperated with Mu Chengying together on experience learning for the very first time.","They were both in seventh stage realm then and it took quite an huge effort to get this treasure into her hands but in the end, it was just fragments and totally could not be used, so it was extremely disappointing for her.","Whoever knew that many years later, Huang Yueli had actually died because of it, whereas this dusty treasure had been restored because of that?","Li Moying apparently thought of the past as a faint smile appeared on his lips.","But following that, his expression sunk again.","If it wasn’t for the Sky Phoenix Ring, he and Huang Yueli would have been separated for so many years... to tell the truth this thing wasn’t very auspicious.","However, as this treasure had an extremely high levelled existence among the God Relics, perhaps it might be hiding some secret.....","But these were merely his guesses as Li Moying didn’t voice these out.","After Huang Yueli kept away all the treasures in Qilin tablet, she turned back to say to the man beside her, “Let’s go, it’s time for us to leave! Celestial Light Sect’s people all probably thought you’re already dead and if they see us appearing, just how shocked would they be! I can’t wait to go back and take care of those few pieces of trash!”","Li Moying shook his head, “Wait a minute, there’s one more thing.....”","“What thing?” Huang Yueli blinked as she had a puzzled look on her face.","Li Moying continued, “Previously when we were trapped in Violet Sun Valley, we don’t know what happened in the exterior boundary of the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region but now, I should be able to sense everything that’s happening in the mystic region....it seems that someone has stayed behind in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region and had not left!”","Huang Yueli went into a pause, “What? Could it be that there’s someone who had met with danger and missed the gathering timing?”","“Should be different from what you’re thinking of.”","Li Moying saw her puzzled look and didn’t make any explanation. Instead he held her little hand and walked through the dense forest then after making a few turns, they came to the front of a cave.","In the cave were several ashen faced practitioners who looked towards them, each bearing expressions of shock and joy.","“El..... Eldest Senior Brother.... You’re really.... really alright! Heavens, really scared me to death! I knew it... I knew that your ability is so strong and you definitely would not be harmed by that despicable villain like Li Lingchuan!”","Luo Jiyun looked at them both and immediately pounced over as he started crying out of extreme happiness.","Mo Yi and the rest also started to crowd over. The Shadow Guards were reserved in their emotions, unlike Luo Jiyun who was half a Young Master, crying as he wished. But it was obvious that all of them were emotionally moved from their abnormal looks.","They searched around the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region for a very long time and were almost about to give up hope, thinking that perhaps something had really happened to Li Moying.","It was based on their irreconcilable thoughts which made them last till today.","But they had not expected that Li Moying had appeared on his own.","This was indeed a pleasant accidental surprise!","Li Moying was hugged by Luo Jiyun and initially he remained expressionless but after a while, he finally could not tolerate it any further as he frowned and pushed him aside.","“Alright, you’re a grown man now, what’s there to cry about? You’re so old already and acting like this is really too ugly. Quickly rub away your tears!”","Luo Jiyun then retreated slightly as he asked, “Eldest Senior Brother, how on earth did you manage to get out of danger?”"]},{"number":1599,"title":"Chapter 1599 - A debt to settle (5)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","“We... we have been searching for you for over a month in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region and we’ve tried many ways but eventually we still aren’t able to get around the cliff to climb down it. There are several times we tried to climb down but before we even reached the depth of a few meters, we were already surrounded by those magical beasts and almost lost our lives! There must be even more magical beasts in the valley below the cliff!”","Luo Jiyun recalled the scene where he was attacked and still had lingering fears over it.","Li Moying merely replied calmly, “This is a long story. I’ll tell you more about it in future. In total, the valley below the cliff is a refinement ground for Cloudy Qilin Clan’s geniuses so both Li’er and I have passed through the refinement and made it out successfully.”","“Ah? Refinement grounds??”","Hearing that, Luo Jiyun and the Shadow Guards all let out an interested expression with an obvious intent that they wanted to head in and try as well.","Li Moying swept a glance past them and said, “Violet Sun Valley is extremely dangerous and it’s only suitable for thunder attributed practitioners to go on experience learning. For those with thunder attributed innate talents of ninth grade and below to enter such a place has almost zero chances of survival!”","“Ah.....” Luo Jiyun heard that and his face turned as red as a tomato immediately as the expression on his face collapsed.","But very quickly, he turned around and looked at Huang Yueli, “But, isn’t Sister-in-law she.... isn’t her attribute under fire? How could she possibly stay in the valley for such a long time?”","Huang Yueli was all smiles as she looked at him and said, “Because..... very coincidentally, my thunder attribute innate talent just happens to be ninth grade!”","“What??”","When everyone heard that, their mouths were agape as their tongues were tied as their jaws almost fell onto the ground.","After some time, Luo Jiyun spoke out stammering, “You... Si.... Sis-in-law, you’re not joking right? You.... you’re just too... too abnormal!”","Huang Yueli’s fire attributed innate talent was something which everyone could tell, and it was at least a ninth grade upper level innate talent! With such an innate talent, she was already considered as a top rated unexcelled genius in the entire Soaring Heavens Continent! Plus the fact that she was also a talented Armament Master, well versed in array skills... that itself was already very scary.","In the end she actually said that she also had a ninth grade talent in thunder attributed innate talent??","How could this possibly be true?","Luo Jiyun thought that he himself was an eighth grade metal attributed talent and was already one of the famous geniuses in South Sky Region so it was hard for him to imagine just what was it like to be of dual ninth grade talents?","Huang Yueli looked at his dazed look and actually wanted to tease him but recalling that they had an even more important matter to deal with, hence she didn’t tangle too long on this topic.","“Alright, all of you are injured so you’d better take these pills first! After that let’s hurry and be on our way!”","“Be on our way?”","Everyone went into a blank.","Huang Yueli’s delicate face revealed an icy cold intent, “That’s right, hurry back to Celestial Light Sect to settle a debt! Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei have such guts to dare to scheme my man, so they must pay a corresponding price for it!”","When she said that, all of them started to stand up with their blood boiling.","“That’s right, these few villains are just too shameless, how dare they dare to take action against our Master!”","“That dumba*s really thought that sitting onto Young Sect Master’s position meant that he could really be comparable to our Master? Hadn’t he even taken a piss and took a look at his own reflection in it! A mere Celestial Light Sect, Master can’t even be bothered about it!”","“Master is just giving Sect Master face, hence tolerated with them for such a long time, did they think that he’s afraid! This time.... We absolutely cannot let it rest!”","Everyone was fired up as righteous indignation filled their chests as they couldn’t wait to rush back to Celestial Light Sect immediately, dragging Li Lingchuan and Murong Fei out to whip their corpses one hundred times!"]},{"number":1600,"title":"Chapter 1600 - A debt to settle (6)","paragraphs":["Translator: Misty Cloud Translations Editor: Misty Cloud Translations","After they had finally swore their loyalty, everyone suddenly realised that something was amiss.","They all recalled the scene earlier only to realise where the problem was.","The person who said those bold and visionary words, wasn’t.... Li Moying but Huang Yueli!","Everyone was dishevelled.","What was wrong with that? Shouldn’t it had been Li Moying who appeared to teach those people who had schemed on his fiancée a lesson? But why did it turn out to be Huang Yueli who said such words? And even saying such things making the fellow who schemed “her man” to pay a corresponding price.....","This feeling.... was too indisposed!","However, Li Moying’s lips secretly curled upwards as he stood by the side.","His Li’er was always like this, always protecting him as part of what she should do and never hiding behind him just because her battle power couldn’t match up to his.","Although he had the ability and determination to protect his beloved woman, but every time he saw Huang Yueli fight back indignantly because of him, his heart would always feel touched.","Huang Yueli retrieved pills from the Sky Phoenix Ring and distributed them to everyone accordingly.","These pills were all sixth level upper grade and above and it unsurprisingly caused gasps of exclamation among everyone.","Huang Yueli generously gave each person a bottle and finally she walked to the front of Yuan Zeyu.","Not knowing what these people had experienced in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, Yuan Zeyu had long lost that elegant demeanour gentlemanly look. On the contrary, there were many broken and worn out holes on his clothes and some were even stained with blood as his face was filled with patches of green and purple bruises. It looked like he had suffered quite a lot during the learning experience.","But Huang Yueli could also sense that the Profound Energy fluctuations from him, had evidently increased by quite a bit.....","“You’ve advanced? And advanced by a large realm?” Huang Yueli queried in shock and joy.","When Yuan Zeyu had just followed her into the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region, his cultivation was only at fourth stage realm and if it wasn’t for her as his Mistress, there was no way that he could get a quota into the mystic region.","But now, he had already become a fifth stage realm practitioner.","Based on Yuan Zeyu’s innate talent, this cultivation speed was rather astonishing.","Yuan Zeyu nodded and said, “That’s right, I’ve encountered some chances in the Cloudy Qilin Mystic Region and ran into a bit of luck so I grabbed the chance and advanced successfully...”","Hearing that, Mo Yi couldn’t help but butted in, “Third Miss, Brother Yuan had been extremely hardworking in searching for chances as his entire thoughts were that he absolutely could not let Third Miss lose face.....”","When Huang Yueli heard that, joy filled her face as she nodded her head and said, “Yuan Zeyu, you’ve indeed given me a surprise. I’d not expected that you’d choose to stay on in the mystic region.”","A complicated emotion flashed past Yuan Zeyu as he shook his head vigorously, “Since I’ve already signed the Master-Servant Contract, I should naturally do what I should do. Actually I’m not the only one who worked hard. Brother Mo Yi and the others had all obtained breakthroughs in the mystic region so what I’ve achieved isn’t really very outstanding.”","These weren’t merely humble words.","The practitioners who had chosen to stay behind this time round to search for Li Moying had all met with various kinds of dangers and at the same time, they had continuously obtained breakthroughs amid the crisis!","Mo Yi was the fastest in terms of advancement and he had already reached the sixth stage realm peak, just one step short of advancing into the seventh stage realm.","The remaining others had also advanced by a large realm.","Huang Yueli nodded her head satisfactorily as she said, “Be assured, following me..... you will not regret it!”"]}]);
